{"name":"Acaana","type":"herb","img":"icons/commodities/flowers/flower-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-acaana","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"f-M-7","sourceCost":"600gp","sourceCategory":"Poisons","utilityGroups":["Poisons","Nerveux"],"poisonType":"Nerveux","climateCode":"f","localeCode":"M","regionCode":null,"sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Acaana","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-acaana","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"poison-nerveux","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Acaana","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette fleur se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat glacial, notamment dans les montagnes.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste extrêmement difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle est préparée sous forme de pâte.</p><p>Poison nerveux de niveau 10E. La pâte noire détruit progressivement le système nerveux ; à son effet extrême, elle tue instantanément.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Acaana","system":{"notes":"<p>This flower is found chiefly in frigid climates, especially in mountains.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains extremely hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is prepared as a paste.</p><p>Level 10E nerve poison. The black paste progressively destroys the nervous system; at its most extreme effect it kills instantly.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Nerveux"],"en":["Nerve"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["poison-nerveux"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"M","findDifficulty":"Extremely Hard","form":"Flower","prep":"paste","season":"","cost":"600gp","notes":"<p>This flower is found chiefly in frigid climates, especially in mountains.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains extremely hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is prepared as a paste.</p><p>Level 10E nerve poison. The black paste progressively destroys the nervous system; at its most extreme effect it kills instantly.</p>","addictionFactor":0,"effects":[],"table":"","level":10},"_id":"OYzdquUqyZDDUGSR"}
{"name":"Adder Venom","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-adder-venom","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"m-F-7","sourceCost":"75gp","sourceCategory":"Poisons","utilityGroups":["Poisons","Nerveux"],"poisonType":"Nerveux","climateCode":"m","localeCode":"F","regionCode":null,"sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Adder Venom","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-adder-venom","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"poison-nerveux","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Venin de Vipère (Adder Venom)","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette pâte se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré doux, notamment dans les berges et rivages d’eau douce.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste extrêmement difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle est introduite par injection.</p><p>Poison nerveux de niveau 10 composé de venin de vipère et de Curulot. Il peut provoquer une paralysie flasque pendant 1 à 100 rounds ou tuer en cinq rounds.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Adder Venom","system":{"notes":"<p>This paste is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in freshwater banks and shores.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains extremely hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is administered by injection.</p><p>Level 10 nerve poison made from adder venom and Curulot. It can cause flaccid paralysis for 1–100 rounds or kill in five rounds.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Nerveux"],"en":["Nerve"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["poison-nerveux"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"F","findDifficulty":"Extremely Hard","form":"Paste","prep":"injection","season":"","cost":"75gp","notes":"<p>This paste is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in freshwater banks and shores.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains extremely hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is administered by injection.</p><p>Level 10 nerve poison made from adder venom and Curulot. It can cause flaccid paralysis for 1–100 rounds or kill in five rounds.</p>","addictionFactor":0,"effects":[],"table":"","level":10},"_id":"Tlx9fuZJ0BIkz1Lu"}
{"name":"Agaath","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/fruit/berry-leaf-pink.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-agaath","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"e-G-2-U","sourceCost":"5gp","sourceCategory":"Renforts & Altérations","utilityGroups":["Renforts & Altérations"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"e","localeCode":"G","regionCode":"U","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Agaath","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-agaath","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"renforts-alterations","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Agaath","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette baie se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat de froid éternel, notamment dans les glaciers et champs de neige, et elle est surtout connue dans l’ensemble d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste facile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle se consomme directement.</p><p>La baie permet de respirer pendant douze heures dans une atmosphère ne contenant qu’environ un quart de l’oxygène normal. En consommer plus d’une fois tous les deux jours peut être mortel.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Agaath","system":{"notes":"<p>This berry is found chiefly in permanently frozen climates, especially in glaciers and snowfields, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains easy to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>The berry allows a person to breathe for twelve hours in an atmosphere containing only about one quarter of normal oxygen. Taking it more than once every two days can be fatal.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Renforts & Altérations"],"en":["Enhancements & Alterations"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["renforts-alterations"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"G","findDifficulty":"Easy","form":"Berry","prep":"ingest","season":"","cost":"5gp","notes":"<p>This berry is found chiefly in permanently frozen climates, especially in glaciers and snowfields, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains easy to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>The berry allows a person to breathe for twelve hours in an atmosphere containing only about one quarter of normal oxygen. Taking it more than once every two days can be fatal.</p>","addictionFactor":3,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"rika2tE96edzZOYw"}
{"name":"Akbutegé","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-akbutege","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"s-S-6-SW","sourceCost":"25gp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Récupération"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"s","localeCode":"S","regionCode":"SW","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Akbutegé","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-akbutege","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Akbutegé","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette feuille se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat semi-aride, notamment dans les prairies rases, et elle est surtout connue dans le Sud-Ouest d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste très difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle se consomme directement.</p><p>Rend 1 à 10 points de vie.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Akbutegé","system":{"notes":"<p>This leaf is found chiefly in semi-arid climates, especially in short-grass plains, and is best known in south-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains very hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>Restores 1–10 concussion hits.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"S","findDifficulty":"Very Hard","form":"Leaf","prep":"ingest","season":"","cost":"25gp","notes":"<p>This leaf is found chiefly in semi-arid climates, especially in short-grass plains, and is best known in south-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains very hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>Restores 1–10 concussion hits.</p>","addictionFactor":1,"effects":[{"effect":"heal-hits","formula":"1d10"}],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"MVmzsMCVzuE4T0bh"}
{"name":"Alambas (Spike)","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-alambas-spike","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"m-S-3-SW","sourceCost":"10gp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Brûlures & exposition"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"m","localeCode":"S","regionCode":"SW","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Alambas (Spike)","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-alambas-spike","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Alambas (Spike)","system":{"notes":"<p>On la rencontre aussi sous le nom de <strong>Épi (Spike)</strong>.</p><p>Cette herbe se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré doux, notamment dans les prairies rases, et elle est surtout connue dans le Sud-Ouest d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste assez aisée à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle s’emploie par application directe.</p><p>L’herbe doit être appliquée fraîche sur la peau. Une dose soigneusement étalée permet de traiter environ quatre pieds carrés de brûlures.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Alambas (Spike)","system":{"notes":"<p>It is also known as <strong>Spike</strong>.</p><p>This grass is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in short-grass plains, and is best known in south-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains fairly easy to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is used by direct application.</p><p>The herb must be applied fresh to the skin. One carefully spread dose can treat roughly four square feet of burns.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"S","findDifficulty":"Light","form":"Grass","prep":"apply","season":"","cost":"10gp","notes":"<p>It is also known as <strong>Spike</strong>.</p><p>This grass is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in short-grass plains, and is best known in south-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains fairly easy to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is used by direct application.</p><p>The herb must be applied fresh to the skin. One carefully spread dose can treat roughly four square feet of burns.</p>","addictionFactor":4,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"8rU8dF8z2x9neQoL"}
{"name":"Aldaka","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/nuts/chestnut-roasted-brown-white.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-aldaka","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"c-M-5","sourceCost":"102gp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Muscles, nerfs & organes"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"c","localeCode":"M","regionCode":null,"sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Aldaka","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-aldaka","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Aldaka","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette racine se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat froid, notamment dans les montagnes.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle doit être préparée en infusion ou décoction.</p><p>La décoction de cette racine peut restaurer la vue perdue à la suite d’une lésion organique.</p><p>Un usage répété peut créer une accoutumance.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Aldaka","system":{"notes":"<p>This root is found chiefly in cold climates, especially in mountains.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it must be prepared as an infusion or decoction.</p><p>A decoction of this root can restore sight lost through organic injury.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"M","findDifficulty":"Hard","form":"Root","prep":"brew","season":"","cost":"102gp","notes":"<p>This root is found chiefly in cold climates, especially in mountains.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it must be prepared as an infusion or decoction.</p><p>A decoction of this root can restore sight lost through organic injury.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>","addictionFactor":7,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"rRDzG6CjyDoW9Tqz"}
{"name":"Aloe (Heat-heal)","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-aloe-heat-heal","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"t-H-4-U","sourceCost":"5bp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Brûlures & exposition"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"t","localeCode":"H","regionCode":"U","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Aloe (Heat-heal)","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-aloe-heat-heal","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Aloe (Guérit-Brûlure / Heat-heal)","system":{"notes":"<p>On la rencontre aussi sous le nom de <strong>Guérit-Brûlure (Heat-heal)</strong>.</p><p>Cette feuille se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré frais, notamment dans les landes, broussailles et bruyères, et elle est surtout connue dans l’ensemble d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste de difficulté moyenne à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle s’emploie par application directe.</p><p>La pulpe des feuilles double la vitesse de guérison des brûlures et des petites coupures ; sur des lésions dues à la chaleur, elle restitue également environ cinq points de vie.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Aloe (Heat-heal)","system":{"notes":"<p>It is also known as <strong>Heat-heal</strong>.</p><p>This leaf is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in heaths, scrublands, and moors, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains of medium difficulty to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is used by direct application.</p><p>The pulp of the leaves doubles the healing rate of burns and minor cuts; on heat injuries it also restores about 5 concussion hits.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"H","findDifficulty":"Medium","form":"Leaf","prep":"apply","season":"","cost":"5bp","notes":"<p>It is also known as <strong>Heat-heal</strong>.</p><p>This leaf is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in heaths, scrublands, and moors, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains of medium difficulty to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is used by direct application.</p><p>The pulp of the leaves doubles the healing rate of burns and minor cuts; on heat injuries it also restores about 5 concussion hits.</p>","addictionFactor":0,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"AAik63GnZduYzCTG"}
{"name":"Ancalthur","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-ancalthur","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"c-F-6","sourceCost":"45gp","sourceCategory":"Poisons","utilityGroups":["Poisons","Musculaire"],"poisonType":"Musculaire","climateCode":"c","localeCode":"F","regionCode":null,"sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Ancalthur","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-ancalthur","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"poison-musculaires","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Ancalthur","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette herbe se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat froid, notamment dans les berges et rivages d’eau douce.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste très difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle est préparée sous forme liquide.</p><p>Poison musculaire de niveau 4. Il déforme la perception du temps et laisse la victime lourdement désordonnée pendant 2 à 4 heures, avec des pénalités pouvant atteindre −100.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Ancalthur","system":{"notes":"<p>This grass is found chiefly in cold climates, especially in freshwater banks and shores.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains very hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is prepared in liquid form.</p><p>Level 4 muscle poison. It distorts the victim’s sense of time and leaves them severely uncoordinated for 2–4 hours, with penalties reaching −100.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Musculaires"],"en":["Muscle"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["poison-musculaires"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"F","findDifficulty":"Very Hard","form":"Grass","prep":"liquid","season":"","cost":"45gp","notes":"<p>This grass is found chiefly in cold climates, especially in freshwater banks and shores.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains very hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is prepared in liquid form.</p><p>Level 4 muscle poison. It distorts the victim’s sense of time and leaves them severely uncoordinated for 2–4 hours, with penalties reaching −100.</p>","addictionFactor":0,"effects":[],"table":"","level":4},"_id":"UpSUoAmoJDDUGHuA"}
{"name":"Ankii","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/fruit/berry-leaf-pink.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-ankii","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"s-B-8-W","sourceCost":"100gp","sourceCategory":"Renforts & Altérations","utilityGroups":["Renforts & Altérations"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"s","localeCode":"B","regionCode":"W","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Ankii","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-ankii","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"renforts-alterations","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Ankii","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette baie se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat semi-aride, notamment dans les ravins et oueds, et elle est surtout connue dans l’Ouest d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste presque introuvable.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle se consomme directement.</p><p>La baie procure un sommeil exceptionnellement réparateur ; des usages répétés au cours de la même semaine épuisent cependant la Constitution.</p><p>Un usage répété peut créer une accoutumance.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Ankii","system":{"notes":"<p>This berry is found chiefly in semi-arid climates, especially in ravines and wadis, and is best known in western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains almost impossible to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>The berry induces exceptionally restorative sleep; repeated use during the same week, however, drains Constitution.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Renforts & Altérations"],"en":["Enhancements & Alterations"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["renforts-alterations"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"B","findDifficulty":"Sheer Folly","form":"Berry","prep":"ingest","season":"","cost":"100gp","notes":"<p>This berry is found chiefly in semi-arid climates, especially in ravines and wadis, and is best known in western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains almost impossible to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>The berry induces exceptionally restorative sleep; repeated use during the same week, however, drains Constitution.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>","addictionFactor":9,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"C3yxhj8FhnEJ79VL"}
{"name":"Arfandas (Keltakukka)","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-arfandas-keltakukka","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"m-F-6-SE","sourceCost":"2sp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Os & fractures"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"m","localeCode":"F","regionCode":"SE","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Arfandas (Keltakukka)","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-arfandas-keltakukka","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Arfandas (Keltakukka)","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette tige se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré doux, notamment dans les berges et rivages d’eau douce, et elle est surtout connue dans le Sud-Est d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste très difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle s’emploie par application directe.</p><p>La tige fraîche, pilée en cataplasme puis posée sur une fracture correctement réduite, double la vitesse naturelle de consolidation. Elle perd ses vertus en quelques heures.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Arfandas (Keltakukka)","system":{"notes":"<p>This stem is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in freshwater banks and shores, and is best known in south-eastern Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains very hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is used by direct application.</p><p>A fresh stalk, crushed into a poultice and placed on a properly set fracture, doubles the natural rate of knitting. It loses its potency within a few hours.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"F","findDifficulty":"Very Hard","form":"Stem","prep":"apply","season":"","cost":"2sp","notes":"<p>This stem is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in freshwater banks and shores, and is best known in south-eastern Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains very hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is used by direct application.</p><p>A fresh stalk, crushed into a poultice and placed on a properly set fracture, doubles the natural rate of knitting. It loses its potency within a few hours.</p>","addictionFactor":1,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"XjCQnEWpORzqoEoO"}
{"name":"Argsbargies (Cashdir)","type":"herb","img":"icons/commodities/flowers/flower-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-argsbargies-cashdir","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"a-Z-5-U","sourceCost":"38gp","sourceCategory":"Remèdes & Antidotes","utilityGroups":["Remèdes & Antidotes"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"a","localeCode":"Z","regionCode":"U","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Argsbargies (Cashdir)","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-argsbargies-cashdir","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"remedes-antidotes","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Argsbargies (Cashdir)","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette fleur se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat aride, notamment dans les déserts, et elle est surtout connue dans l’ensemble d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle se consomme directement.</p><p>Antidote de niveau 4 contre les poisons musculaires.</p><p>Un usage répété peut créer une accoutumance.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Argsbargies (Cashdir)","system":{"notes":"<p>This flower is found chiefly in arid climates, especially in deserts, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>Level 4 antidote for muscle poisons.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Remèdes & Antidotes"],"en":["Remedies & Antidotes"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["remedes-antidotes"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"Z","findDifficulty":"Hard","form":"Flower","prep":"ingest","season":"","cost":"38gp","notes":"<p>This flower is found chiefly in arid climates, especially in deserts, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>Level 4 antidote for muscle poisons.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>","addictionFactor":7,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"tBqK2eB2GxlqYPsV"}
{"name":"Arlan (White Slipper)","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-arlan-white-slipper","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"t-T-2-NW","sourceCost":"13sp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Récupération","Remèdes & Antidotes"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"t","localeCode":"T","regionCode":"NW","sourceVariants":[{"group":"Remèdes & Antidotes","code":"t-T-2-NW","form":"Root","prep":"ingest","cost":"13sp","af":1,"effect":"La racine moulue est jetée dans l’eau bouillante et ses vapeurs sont respirées. Elle décongestionne, accorde +20 aux Jets de Résistance contre les refroidissements et accélère fortement la récupération des maladies respiratoires. Les racines se conservent un an."}],"sourceName":"Arlan (White Slipper)","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-arlan-white-slipper","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Arlan (Pantoufle Blanche / White Slipper)","system":{"notes":"<p>On la rencontre aussi sous le nom de <strong>Sabot Blanc (White Slipper)</strong>.</p><p>Cette feuille se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré frais, notamment dans les hautes herbes, et elle est surtout connue dans le Nord-Ouest d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste facile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle s’emploie par application directe.</p><p>En cataplasme, les feuilles rendent 4 à 9 points de vie ; utilisées sans préparation, elles n’en rendent que 1 à 6. Gardées humides, elles restent actives un mois. La racine moulue est jetée dans l’eau bouillante et ses vapeurs sont respirées. Elle décongestionne, accorde +20 aux Jets de Résistance contre les refroidissements et accélère fortement la récupération des maladies respiratoires. Les racines se conservent un an.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Arlan (White Slipper)","system":{"notes":"<p>It is also known as <strong>White Slipper</strong>.</p><p>This leaf is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in tall grasslands, and is best known in north-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains easy to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is used by direct application.</p><p>As a poultice, the leaves restore 4–9 concussion hits; used without preparation they restore only 1–6. Kept moist, they remain potent for one month. The ground root is added to boiling water and the vapour inhaled. It clears congestion, grants +20 to Resistance Rolls against colds, and greatly speeds recovery from respiratory illnesses. The roots keep for one year.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"T","findDifficulty":"Easy","form":"Leaf","prep":"apply","season":"","cost":"13sp","notes":"<p>It is also known as <strong>White Slipper</strong>.</p><p>This leaf is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in tall grasslands, and is best known in north-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains easy to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is used by direct application.</p><p>As a poultice, the leaves restore 4–9 concussion hits; used without preparation they restore only 1–6. Kept moist, they remain potent for one month. The ground root is added to boiling water and the vapour inhaled. It clears congestion, grants +20 to Resistance Rolls against colds, and greatly speeds recovery from respiratory illnesses. The roots keep for one year.</p>","addictionFactor":1,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"cxFFknBDwWXBUhjK"}
{"name":"Arnuminas","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-arnuminas","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"m-S-2-NW","sourceCost":"6bp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Muscles, nerfs & organes"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"m","localeCode":"S","regionCode":"NW","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Arnuminas","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-arnuminas","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Arnuminas","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette feuille se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré doux, notamment dans les prairies rases, et elle est surtout connue dans le Nord-Ouest d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste facile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle s’emploie par application directe.</p><p>La feuille appliquée en cataplasme double la vitesse de guérison des entorses, ligaments déchirés et lésions du cartilage.</p><p>Un usage répété peut créer une accoutumance.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Arnuminas","system":{"notes":"<p>This leaf is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in short-grass plains, and is best known in north-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains easy to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is used by direct application.</p><p>Applied as a poultice, the leaf doubles the healing rate of sprains, torn ligaments, and cartilage injuries.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"S","findDifficulty":"Easy","form":"Leaf","prep":"apply","season":"","cost":"6bp","notes":"<p>This leaf is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in short-grass plains, and is best known in north-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains easy to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is used by direct application.</p><p>Applied as a poultice, the leaf doubles the healing rate of sprains, torn ligaments, and cartilage injuries.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>","addictionFactor":8,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"YY7W12vKxVZHombX"}
{"name":"Arpsusar","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-arpsusar","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"t-F-5-U","sourceCost":"30gp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Muscles, nerfs & organes"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"t","localeCode":"F","regionCode":"U","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Arpsusar","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-arpsusar","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Arpsusar","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette tige se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré frais, notamment dans les berges et rivages d’eau douce, et elle est surtout connue dans l’ensemble d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle doit être préparée en infusion ou décoction.</p><p>La décoction de tige favorise la réparation des muscles endommagés.</p><p>Des prises répétées peuvent entraîner une dépendance notable.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Arpsusar","system":{"notes":"<p>This stalk is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in freshwater banks and shores, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it must be prepared as an infusion or decoction.</p><p>A decoction of the stalk promotes the repair of damaged muscles.</p><p>Repeated doses can lead to significant dependence.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"F","findDifficulty":"Hard","form":"Stalk","prep":"brew","season":"","cost":"30gp","notes":"<p>This stalk is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in freshwater banks and shores, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it must be prepared as an infusion or decoction.</p><p>A decoction of the stalk promotes the repair of damaged muscles.</p><p>Repeated doses can lead to significant dependence.</p>","addictionFactor":15,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"WXzI4O5cxT3Ft9e3"}
{"name":"Árunya (Red Sleep, Orrain)","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/nuts/chestnut-roasted-brown-white.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-arunya-red-sleep-orrain","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"m-S-5-U","sourceCost":"2bp","sourceCategory":"Remèdes & Antidotes","utilityGroups":["Remèdes & Antidotes"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"m","localeCode":"S","regionCode":"U","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Árunya (Red Sleep, Orrain)","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-arunya-red-sleep-orrain","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"remedes-antidotes","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Árunya (Sommeil Rouge / Red Sleep, Orrain)","system":{"notes":"<p>On la rencontre aussi sous le nom de <strong>Sommeil Rouge (Red Sleep)</strong>.</p><p>Cette racine se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré doux, notamment dans les prairies rases, et elle est surtout connue dans l’ensemble d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle doit être préparée en infusion ou décoction.</p><p>Une préparation purifiée provoque rapidement le sommeil et l’inconscience ; une heure de ce repos équivaut à environ quatre heures de sommeil normal. Son usage répété plusieurs jours de suite est fortement addictif.</p><p>Son usage présente un risque très élevé d’accoutumance et doit rester exceptionnel.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Árunya (Red Sleep, Orrain)","system":{"notes":"<p>It is also known as <strong>Red Sleep</strong>.</p><p>This root is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in short-grass plains, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it must be prepared as an infusion or decoction.</p><p>A purified preparation rapidly induces sleep and unconsciousness; one hour of this rest is equivalent to about four hours of normal sleep. Repeated use for several consecutive days is highly addictive.</p><p>Its use carries a very high risk of addiction and should remain exceptional.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Remèdes & Antidotes"],"en":["Remedies & Antidotes"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["remedes-antidotes"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"S","findDifficulty":"Hard","form":"Root","prep":"brew","season":"","cost":"2bp","notes":"<p>It is also known as <strong>Red Sleep</strong>.</p><p>This root is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in short-grass plains, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it must be prepared as an infusion or decoction.</p><p>A purified preparation rapidly induces sleep and unconsciousness; one hour of this rest is equivalent to about four hours of normal sleep. Repeated use for several consecutive days is highly addictive.</p><p>Its use carries a very high risk of addiction and should remain exceptional.</p>","addictionFactor":50,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"SH9QZppar95Wf9c4"}
{"name":"Arunya","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/nuts/chestnut-roasted-brown-white.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-arunya","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"m-S-3-U","sourceCost":"4sp","sourceCategory":"Intoxicants","utilityGroups":["Intoxicants"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"m","localeCode":"S","regionCode":"U","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Arunya","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-arunya","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"intoxicants","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Arunya","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette racine se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré doux, notamment dans les prairies rases, et elle est surtout connue dans l’ensemble d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste assez aisée à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle doit être préparée en infusion ou décoction.</p><p>La décoction provoque rapidement sommeil et inconscience ; une heure de ce sommeil vaut environ quatre heures de repos ordinaire.</p><p>Son usage présente un risque très élevé d’accoutumance et doit rester exceptionnel.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Arunya","system":{"notes":"<p>This root is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in short-grass plains, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains fairly easy to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it must be prepared as an infusion or decoction.</p><p>The decoction rapidly induces sleep and unconsciousness; one hour of this sleep is equivalent to about four hours of ordinary rest.</p><p>Its use carries a very high risk of addiction and should remain exceptional.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Intoxicants"],"en":["Intoxicants"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["intoxicants"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"S","findDifficulty":"Light","form":"Root","prep":"brew","season":"","cost":"4sp","notes":"<p>This root is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in short-grass plains, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains fairly easy to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it must be prepared as an infusion or decoction.</p><p>The decoction rapidly induces sleep and unconsciousness; one hour of this sleep is equivalent to about four hours of ordinary rest.</p><p>Its use carries a very high risk of addiction and should remain exceptional.</p>","addictionFactor":50,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"dhNPjyTCGkw2D6v9"}
{"name":"Athelas (Kings Foil)","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-athelas-kings-foil","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"m-C-5-W","sourceCost":"300gp","sourceCategory":"Remèdes & Antidotes","utilityGroups":["Remèdes & Antidotes"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"m","localeCode":"C","regionCode":"W","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Athelas (Kings Foil)","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-athelas-kings-foil","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"remedes-antidotes","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Athelas (Feuille-du-Roi / Kings Foil)","system":{"notes":"<p>On la rencontre aussi sous le nom de <strong>Feuille des Rois (Kings Foil)</strong>.</p><p>Cette feuille se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré doux, notamment dans les forêts de conifères, et elle est surtout connue dans l’Ouest d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle doit être préparée en infusion ou décoction.</p><p>L’Athelas peut soutenir la guérison de presque toute affection tant que le patient vit encore, mais son efficacité dépend du talent du guérisseur. Entre les mains d’un roi légitime, ses vertus atteignent leur pleine puissance. Elle ne rend cependant pas la vie aux morts.</p><p>Des prises répétées peuvent entraîner une dépendance notable.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Athelas (Kings Foil)","system":{"notes":"<p>It is also known as <strong>Kings Foil</strong>.</p><p>This leaf is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in coniferous forests, and is best known in western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it must be prepared as an infusion or decoction.</p><p>Athelas can aid the healing of almost any affliction while the patient still lives, but its effectiveness depends on the healer’s skill. In the hands of a rightful king, its virtues reach their full power. It cannot, however, restore the dead to life.</p><p>Repeated doses can lead to significant dependence.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Remèdes & Antidotes"],"en":["Remedies & Antidotes"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["remedes-antidotes"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"C","findDifficulty":"Hard","form":"Leaf","prep":"brew","season":"","cost":"300gp","notes":"<p>It is also known as <strong>Kings Foil</strong>.</p><p>This leaf is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in coniferous forests, and is best known in western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it must be prepared as an infusion or decoction.</p><p>Athelas can aid the healing of almost any affliction while the patient still lives, but its effectiveness depends on the healer’s skill. In the hands of a rightful king, its virtues reach their full power. It cannot, however, restore the dead to life.</p><p>Repeated doses can lead to significant dependence.</p>","addictionFactor":20,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"ajijlBgQnIkisiur"}
{"name":"Atigax (Allsee)","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/nuts/chestnut-roasted-brown-white.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-atigax-allsee","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"f-H-4-NW","sourceCost":"40gp","sourceCategory":"Renforts & Altérations","utilityGroups":["Renforts & Altérations"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"f","localeCode":"H","regionCode":"NW","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Atigax (Allsee)","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-atigax-allsee","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"renforts-alterations","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Atigax (Voit-Tout / Allsee)","system":{"notes":"<p>On la rencontre aussi sous le nom de <strong>Voit-Tout (Allsee)</strong>.</p><p>Cette racine se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat glacial, notamment dans les landes, broussailles et bruyères, et elle est surtout connue dans le Nord-Ouest d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste de difficulté moyenne à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle doit être préparée en infusion ou décoction.</p><p>La racine brûlée puis réduite en poudre est mêlée à de l’eau bouillante. La préparation protège les yeux contre l’éblouissement pendant environ neuf heures. Elle est aussi connue sous les noms Firegaze, Punasalvia et Metsästäjän Ystävä.</p><p>Un usage répété peut créer une accoutumance.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Atigax (Allsee)","system":{"notes":"<p>It is also known as <strong>Allsee</strong>.</p><p>This root is found chiefly in frigid climates, especially in heaths, scrublands, and moors, and is best known in north-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains of medium difficulty to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it must be prepared as an infusion or decoction.</p><p>The root is burned, ground into powder, and mixed with boiling water. The preparation protects the eyes from glare for about nine hours. It is also known as Firegaze, Punasalvia, and Metsästäjän Ystävä.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Renforts & Altérations"],"en":["Enhancements & Alterations"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["renforts-alterations"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"H","findDifficulty":"Medium","form":"Root","prep":"brew","season":"","cost":"40gp","notes":"<p>It is also known as <strong>Allsee</strong>.</p><p>This root is found chiefly in frigid climates, especially in heaths, scrublands, and moors, and is best known in north-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains of medium difficulty to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it must be prepared as an infusion or decoction.</p><p>The root is burned, ground into powder, and mixed with boiling water. The preparation protects the eyes from glare for about nine hours. It is also known as Firegaze, Punasalvia, and Metsästäjän Ystävä.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>","addictionFactor":12,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"0QIgsAUlFYADu1Pe"}
{"name":"Attanar","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-attanar","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"t-F-4-U","sourceCost":"8gp","sourceCategory":"Remèdes & Antidotes","utilityGroups":["Remèdes & Antidotes"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"t","localeCode":"F","regionCode":"U","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Attanar","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-attanar","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"remedes-antidotes","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Attanar","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette mousse se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré frais, notamment dans les berges et rivages d’eau douce, et elle est surtout connue dans l’ensemble d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste de difficulté moyenne à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle s’emploie par application directe.</p><p>Cette mousse appliquée en remède fait tomber les fièvres.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Attanar","system":{"notes":"<p>This moss is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in freshwater banks and shores, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains of medium difficulty to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is used by direct application.</p><p>Applied as a remedy, this moss reduces fevers.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Remèdes & Antidotes"],"en":["Remedies & Antidotes"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["remedes-antidotes"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"F","findDifficulty":"Medium","form":"Moss","prep":"apply","season":"","cost":"8gp","notes":"<p>This moss is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in freshwater banks and shores, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains of medium difficulty to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is used by direct application.</p><p>Applied as a remedy, this moss reduces fevers.</p>","addictionFactor":1,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"ef0XDkAxJ7kvS84r"}
{"name":"Balák (Boneboon)","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-balak-boneboon","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"h-O-5-SW","sourceCost":"45gp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Os & fractures"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"h","localeCode":"O","regionCode":"SW","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Balák (Boneboon)","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-balak-boneboon","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Balák (Don-des-Os / Boneboon)","system":{"notes":"<p>On la rencontre aussi sous le nom de <strong>Don-des-Os (Boneboon)</strong>.</p><p>Ce roseau se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat chaud et humide, notamment dans les côtes marines et rivages salés, et elle est surtout connue dans le Sud-Ouest d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle doit être préparée en infusion ou décoction.</p><p>Cette préparation peut réparer un os brisé en multiples fragments. Le membre doit rester parfaitement immobile pendant huit heures ; le traitement provoque souvent une constipation durable.</p><p>Un usage répété peut créer une accoutumance.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Balák (Boneboon)","system":{"notes":"<p>It is also known as <strong>Boneboon</strong>.</p><p>This reed is found chiefly in hot and humid climates, especially in sea coasts and saltwater shores, and is best known in south-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it must be prepared as an infusion or decoction.</p><p>This preparation can repair a bone shattered into multiple fragments. The limb must remain perfectly still for eight hours; the treatment often causes prolonged constipation.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"O","findDifficulty":"Hard","form":"Reed","prep":"brew","season":"","cost":"45gp","notes":"<p>It is also known as <strong>Boneboon</strong>.</p><p>This reed is found chiefly in hot and humid climates, especially in sea coasts and saltwater shores, and is best known in south-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it must be prepared as an infusion or decoction.</p><p>This preparation can repair a bone shattered into multiple fragments. The limb must remain perfectly still for eight hours; the treatment often causes prolonged constipation.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>","addictionFactor":12,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"UokdIHAwFR2KbhU5"}
{"name":"Baldfoot (Splort, Carahsá)","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/fruit/berry-leaf-pink.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-baldfoot-splort-carahsa","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"m-D-5-E","sourceCost":"2gp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Récupération"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"m","localeCode":"D","regionCode":"E","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Baldfoot (Splort, Carahsá)","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-baldfoot-splort-carahsa","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Pied-Chauve (Baldfoot / Splort, Carahsá)","system":{"notes":"<p>On la rencontre aussi sous le nom de <strong>Splort</strong>, <strong>Carahsá</strong>.</p><p>Cette baie se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré doux, notamment dans les forêts de feuillus ou mixtes, et elle est surtout connue dans l’Est d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle se consomme directement.</p><p>Une baie rend immédiatement 1 à 10 points de vie. Il ne faut pas en consommer plus d’une toutes les deux heures sous peine de vertiges sévères.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Baldfoot (Splort, Carahsá)","system":{"notes":"<p>It is also known as <strong>Splort</strong>.</p><p>This berry is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in deciduous or mixed forests, and is best known in eastern Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>One berry immediately restores 1–10 concussion hits. More than one every two hours causes severe dizziness.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"D","findDifficulty":"Hard","form":"Berry","prep":"ingest","season":"","cost":"2gp","notes":"<p>It is also known as <strong>Splort</strong>.</p><p>This berry is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in deciduous or mixed forests, and is best known in eastern Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>One berry immediately restores 1–10 concussion hits. More than one every two hours causes severe dizziness.</p>","addictionFactor":1,"effects":[{"effect":"heal-hits","formula":"1d10"}],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"IyX1Xw31avbRrSVI"}
{"name":"Belan (Blood-nut, Scass)","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/nuts/chestnut-roasted-brown-white.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-belan-blood-nut-scass","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"h-O-5-SE","sourceCost":"40gp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Hémorragies & circulation"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"h","localeCode":"O","regionCode":"SE","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Belan (Blood-nut, Scass)","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-belan-blood-nut-scass","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Belan (Noix-de-Sang / Blood-nut, Scass)","system":{"notes":"<p>On la rencontre aussi sous le nom de <strong>Noix-de-Sang (Blood-nut)</strong>.</p><p>Cette noix se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat chaud et humide, notamment dans les côtes marines et rivages salés, et elle est surtout connue dans le Sud-Est d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle se consomme directement.</p><p>La noix arrête toute hémorragie en 1 à 10 rounds. Le patient doit ensuite éviter tout effort pendant environ une heure ; la préparation se conserve trois mois.</p><p>Un usage répété peut créer une accoutumance.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Belan (Blood-nut, Scass)","system":{"notes":"<p>It is also known as <strong>Blood-nut</strong>.</p><p>This nut is found chiefly in hot and humid climates, especially in sea coasts and saltwater shores, and is best known in south-eastern Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>The nut stops all bleeding in 1–10 rounds. The patient must then avoid exertion for about one hour; the preparation keeps for three months.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"O","findDifficulty":"Hard","form":"Nut","prep":"ingest","season":"","cost":"40gp","notes":"<p>It is also known as <strong>Blood-nut</strong>.</p><p>This nut is found chiefly in hot and humid climates, especially in sea coasts and saltwater shores, and is best known in south-eastern Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>The nut stops all bleeding in 1–10 rounds. The patient must then avoid exertion for about one hour; the preparation keeps for three months.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>","addictionFactor":5,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"6UXA2fgpKNnrRbi2"}
{"name":"Belramba","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-belramba","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"s-C-6-M","sourceCost":"60gp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Muscles, nerfs & organes"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"s","localeCode":"C","regionCode":"M","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Belramba","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-belramba","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Belramba","system":{"notes":"<p>Ce lichen se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat semi-aride, notamment dans les forêts de conifères, et elle est surtout connue dans le centre d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste très difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle doit être préparée en infusion ou décoction.</p><p>Cette décoction favorise la réparation des lésions nerveuses.</p><p>Des prises répétées peuvent entraîner une dépendance notable.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Belramba","system":{"notes":"<p>This lichen is found chiefly in semi-arid climates, especially in coniferous forests, and is best known in central Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains very hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it must be prepared as an infusion or decoction.</p><p>This decoction promotes the repair of nerve damage.</p><p>Repeated doses can lead to significant dependence.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"C","findDifficulty":"Very Hard","form":"Lichen","prep":"brew","season":"","cost":"60gp","notes":"<p>This lichen is found chiefly in semi-arid climates, especially in coniferous forests, and is best known in central Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains very hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it must be prepared as an infusion or decoction.</p><p>This decoction promotes the repair of nerve damage.</p><p>Repeated doses can lead to significant dependence.</p>","addictionFactor":20,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"Ec69BCKXT535otgB"}
{"name":"Berterin","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-berterin","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"m-D-3","sourceCost":"19gp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Muscles, nerfs & organes"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"m","localeCode":"D","regionCode":null,"sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Berterin","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-berterin","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Berterin","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette mousse se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré doux, notamment dans les forêts de feuillus ou mixtes.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste assez aisée à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle doit être préparée en infusion ou décoction.</p><p>Cette mousse permet de préserver pendant environ une journée une matière organique allant jusqu’à la taille d’un corps humain.</p><p>Des prises répétées peuvent entraîner une dépendance notable.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Berterin","system":{"notes":"<p>This moss is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in deciduous or mixed forests.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains fairly easy to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it must be prepared as an infusion or decoction.</p><p>This moss can preserve organic matter up to the size of a human body for about one day.</p><p>Repeated doses can lead to significant dependence.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"D","findDifficulty":"Light","form":"Moss","prep":"brew","season":"","cost":"19gp","notes":"<p>This moss is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in deciduous or mixed forests.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains fairly easy to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it must be prepared as an infusion or decoction.</p><p>This moss can preserve organic matter up to the size of a human body for about one day.</p><p>Repeated doses can lead to significant dependence.</p>","addictionFactor":20,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"DYi4V3QCS1fLUge6"}
{"name":"Black Vine (Vision Maker)","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-black-vine-vision-maker","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"c-C-9-NW","sourceCost":"205gp","sourceCategory":"Intoxicants","utilityGroups":["Intoxicants"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"c","localeCode":"C","regionCode":"NW","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Black Vine (Vision Maker)","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-black-vine-vision-maker","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"intoxicants","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Liane Noire (Black Vine / Faiseuse-de-Visions / Vision Maker)","system":{"notes":"<p>On la rencontre aussi sous le nom de <strong>Faiseur de Visions (Vision Maker)</strong>.</p><p>Cette feuille se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat froid, notamment dans les forêts de conifères, et elle est surtout connue dans le Nord-Ouest d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste d’une rareté légendaire.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle s’emploie par application directe.</p><p>Cette plante de la Vieille Forêt, d’Yeffelwood et d’Eryn Vorn produit une euphorie intense de quelques minutes. Lorsque l’effet retombe, l’utilisateur risque de sombrer dans un sommeil délirant.</p><p>Un usage répété peut créer une accoutumance.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Black Vine (Vision Maker)","system":{"notes":"<p>It is also known as <strong>Vision Maker</strong>.</p><p>This leaf is found chiefly in cold climates, especially in coniferous forests, and is best known in north-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains of legendary rarity.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is used by direct application.</p><p>This plant from the Old Forest, Yeffelwood, and Eryn Vorn produces intense euphoria lasting a few minutes. When the effect wears off, the user risks falling into a delirious sleep.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Intoxicants"],"en":["Intoxicants"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["intoxicants"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"C","findDifficulty":"Absurd","form":"Leaf","prep":"apply","season":"","cost":"205gp","notes":"<p>It is also known as <strong>Vision Maker</strong>.</p><p>This leaf is found chiefly in cold climates, especially in coniferous forests, and is best known in north-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains of legendary rarity.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is used by direct application.</p><p>This plant from the Old Forest, Yeffelwood, and Eryn Vorn produces intense euphoria lasting a few minutes. When the effect wears off, the user risks falling into a delirious sleep.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>","addictionFactor":10,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"1IritLQPz8PCw8wg"}
{"name":"Blade Hemlock","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-blade-hemlock","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"m-F-6","sourceCost":"58gp","sourceCategory":"Poisons","utilityGroups":["Poisons","Musculaire"],"poisonType":"Musculaire","climateCode":"m","localeCode":"F","regionCode":null,"sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Blade Hemlock","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-blade-hemlock","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"poison-musculaires","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Ciguë-Lame (Blade Hemlock)","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette pâte se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré doux, notamment dans les berges et rivages d’eau douce.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste très difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle est introduite par injection.</p><p>Poison musculaire de niveau 6 préparé avec de la ciguë et du Curulot. Un échec modéré provoque une incapacité de plusieurs heures ; un échec plus sévère entraîne la mort en quelques rounds.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Blade Hemlock","system":{"notes":"<p>This paste is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in freshwater banks and shores.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains very hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is injected.</p><p>Level 6 muscle poison prepared from hemlock and Curulot. A moderate failure causes incapacity for several hours; a more severe failure causes death within a few rounds.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Musculaires"],"en":["Muscle"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["poison-musculaires"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"F","findDifficulty":"Very Hard","form":"Paste","prep":"inject","season":"","cost":"58gp","notes":"<p>This paste is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in freshwater banks and shores.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains very hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is injected.</p><p>Level 6 muscle poison prepared from hemlock and Curulot. A moderate failure causes incapacity for several hours; a more severe failure causes death within a few rounds.</p>","addictionFactor":0,"effects":[],"table":"","level":6},"_id":"kKjOMKjfGeisMoRN"}
{"name":"Blue pine nuts","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/nuts/chestnut-roasted-brown-white.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-blue-pine-nuts","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"t-C-2-NW","sourceCost":"1cp","sourceCategory":"Nourriture","utilityGroups":["Nourriture"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"t","localeCode":"C","regionCode":"NW","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Blue pine nuts","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-blue-pine-nuts","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"nourriture","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Pignons de Pin Bleu (Blue pine nuts)","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette graine se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré frais, notamment dans les forêts de conifères, et elle est surtout connue dans le Nord-Ouest d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste facile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle se consomme directement.</p><p>Cinq graines suffisent à nourrir une personne pour un repas. Chaque cône en contient généralement six ; leur saveur acide devient plus agréable après torréfaction.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Blue pine nuts","system":{"notes":"<p>This seed is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in coniferous forests, and is best known in north-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains easy to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>Five seeds are enough to feed one person for a meal. Each cone usually contains six; their sour flavour becomes more pleasant after roasting.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Nourriture"],"en":["Food"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["nourriture"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"C","findDifficulty":"Easy","form":"Seed","prep":"ingest","season":"","cost":"1cp","notes":"<p>This seed is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in coniferous forests, and is best known in north-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains easy to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>Five seeds are enough to feed one person for a meal. Each cone usually contains six; their sour flavour becomes more pleasant after roasting.</p>","addictionFactor":0,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"I4m3H12F1uzKqO8L"}
{"name":"Bluedrake (Bluetongue)","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-bluedrake-bluetongue","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"t-F-7-NW","sourceCost":"50gp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Brûlures & exposition"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"t","localeCode":"F","regionCode":"NW","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Bluedrake (Bluetongue)","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-bluedrake-bluetongue","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Bluedrake (Langue Bleue / Bluetongue)","system":{"notes":"<p>Ce nectar se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré frais, notamment dans les berges et rivages d’eau douce, et elle est surtout connue dans le Nord-Ouest d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste extrêmement difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle s’emploie par application directe.</p><p>Versé sur une brûlure puis laissé en place durant six heures, ce nectar engourdit la douleur et favorise la guérison. Il se conserve jusqu’à neuf mois.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Bluedrake (Bluetongue)","system":{"notes":"<p>This nectar is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in freshwater banks and shores, and is best known in north-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains extremely hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is used by direct application.</p><p>Poured over a burn and left in place for six hours, this nectar numbs the pain and promotes healing. It keeps for up to nine months.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"F","findDifficulty":"Extremely Hard","form":"Nectar","prep":"apply","season":"","cost":"50gp","notes":"<p>This nectar is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in freshwater banks and shores, and is best known in north-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains extremely hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is used by direct application.</p><p>Poured over a burn and left in place for six hours, this nectar numbs the pain and promotes healing. It keeps for up to nine months.</p>","addictionFactor":0,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"KoMQWf0XNwP5x3VC"}
{"name":"Boneset","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/nuts/chestnut-roasted-brown-white.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-boneset","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"t-M-4-W","sourceCost":"14gp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Os & fractures"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"t","localeCode":"M","regionCode":"W","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Boneset","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-boneset","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Ressoude-Os (Boneset)","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette racine se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré frais, notamment dans les montagnes, et elle est surtout connue dans l’Ouest d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste de difficulté moyenne à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle se consomme directement.</p><p>La racine, surtout connue dans les vallées méridionales des Montagnes Blanches, triple la vitesse de guérison des fractures.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Boneset","system":{"notes":"<p>This root is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in mountains, and is best known in western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains of medium difficulty to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>The root, best known in the southern valleys of the White Mountains, triples the healing rate of fractures.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"M","findDifficulty":"Medium","form":"Root","prep":"ingest","season":"","cost":"14gp","notes":"<p>This root is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in mountains, and is best known in western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains of medium difficulty to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>The root, best known in the southern valleys of the White Mountains, triples the healing rate of fractures.</p>","addictionFactor":1,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"5Pnuz6B5lLGAeqtd"}
{"name":"Boskone (Da’Nella)","type":"herb","img":"icons/commodities/flowers/flower-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-boskone-danella","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"t-H-8-NW","sourceCost":"78gp","sourceCategory":"Renforts & Altérations","utilityGroups":["Renforts & Altérations"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"t","localeCode":"H","regionCode":"NW","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Boskone (Da’Nella)","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-boskone-danella","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"renforts-alterations","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Boskone (Da’Nella)","system":{"notes":"<p>Ces fleurs se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré frais, notamment dans les landes, broussailles et bruyères, et elle est surtout connue dans le Nord-Ouest d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste presque introuvable.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle se consomme directement.</p><p>Ces fleurs de la Vieille Forêt et d’Eryn Vorn sont séchées, moulues puis inhalées. Durant 10 à 20 rounds, l’utilisateur perçoit la présence des êtres pensants proches et une idée générale de leurs actions ; une violente migraine suit souvent l’effet.</p><p>Des prises répétées peuvent entraîner une dépendance notable.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Boskone (Da’Nella)","system":{"notes":"<p>This flowers is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in heaths, scrublands, and moors, and is best known in north-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains almost impossible to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>These flowers from the Old Forest and Eryn Vorn are dried, ground, and inhaled. For 10–20 rounds, the user senses the presence of nearby thinking beings and gains a general impression of their actions; a violent headache often follows.</p><p>Repeated doses can lead to significant dependence.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Renforts & Altérations"],"en":["Enhancements & Alterations"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["renforts-alterations"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"H","findDifficulty":"Sheer Folly","form":"Flowers","prep":"ingest","season":"","cost":"78gp","notes":"<p>This flowers is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in heaths, scrublands, and moors, and is best known in north-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains almost impossible to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>These flowers from the Old Forest and Eryn Vorn are dried, ground, and inhaled. For 10–20 rounds, the user senses the presence of nearby thinking beings and gains a general impression of their actions; a violent headache often follows.</p><p>Repeated doses can lead to significant dependence.</p>","addictionFactor":18,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"16sMQWgTr29EWVnv"}
{"name":"Bramblerose","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/fruit/berry-leaf-pink.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-bramblerose","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"m-F-4-SE","sourceCost":"4gp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Récupération","Nourriture"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"m","localeCode":"F","regionCode":"SE","sourceVariants":[{"group":"Nourriture","code":"m-F-4-SE","form":"Fruit","prep":"ingest","cost":"4gp","af":1,"effect":"Deux fruits suffisent à soutenir un homme pendant une journée. Les graines, en revanche, provoquent de fortes douleurs intestinales."}],"sourceName":"Bramblerose","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-bramblerose","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Bramblerose","system":{"notes":"<p>Ce fruit se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré doux, notamment dans les berges et rivages d’eau douce, et elle est surtout connue dans le Sud-Est d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste de difficulté moyenne à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle se consomme directement.</p><p>La chair du fruit rend 4 à 10 points de vie ; ses graines provoquent de violentes douleurs intestinales. Deux fruits peuvent aussi nourrir un homme pendant une journée. Deux fruits suffisent à soutenir un homme pendant une journée. Les graines, en revanche, provoquent de fortes douleurs intestinales.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Bramblerose","system":{"notes":"<p>This fruit is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in freshwater banks and shores, and is best known in south-eastern Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains of medium difficulty to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>The flesh of the fruit restores 4–10 concussion hits; its seeds cause violent intestinal pain. Two fruits can also feed a man for one day. Two fruits provide enough nourishment to sustain a man for a full day. The seeds, however, cause severe intestinal pain.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"F","findDifficulty":"Medium","form":"Fruit","prep":"ingest","season":"","cost":"4gp","notes":"<p>This fruit is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in freshwater banks and shores, and is best known in south-eastern Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains of medium difficulty to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>The flesh of the fruit restores 4–10 concussion hits; its seeds cause violent intestinal pain. Two fruits can also feed a man for one day. Two fruits provide enough nourishment to sustain a man for a full day. The seeds, however, cause severe intestinal pain.</p>","addictionFactor":1,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"OJP96iqG4WFDfLGX"}
{"name":"Breldiar","type":"herb","img":"icons/commodities/flowers/flower-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-breldiar","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"m-V-4-U","sourceCost":"25gp","sourceCategory":"Renforts & Altérations","utilityGroups":["Renforts & Altérations"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"m","localeCode":"V","regionCode":"U","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Breldiar","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-breldiar","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"renforts-alterations","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Breldiar","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette fleur se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré doux, notamment dans les terrains volcaniques, et elle est surtout connue dans l’ensemble d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste de difficulté moyenne à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle se consomme directement.</p><p>La fleur provoque une euphorie qui gêne les manœuvres et le combat rapproché d’environ 30 points, mais améliore d’environ 50 les tirs et certains usages de la magie pendant une heure.</p><p>Un usage répété peut créer une accoutumance.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Breldiar","system":{"notes":"<p>This flower is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in volcanic terrain, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains of medium difficulty to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>The flower causes euphoria that imposes about −30 on maneuvers and melee combat, while granting about +50 to missile attacks and certain uses of magic for one hour.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Renforts & Altérations"],"en":["Enhancements & Alterations"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["renforts-alterations"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"V","findDifficulty":"Medium","form":"Flower","prep":"ingest","season":"","cost":"25gp","notes":"<p>This flower is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in volcanic terrain, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains of medium difficulty to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>The flower causes euphoria that imposes about −30 on maneuvers and melee combat, while granting about +50 to missile attacks and certain uses of magic for one hour.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>","addictionFactor":7,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"IgihXhGtqMJGTkyH"}
{"name":"Bright Blue Eyes","type":"herb","img":"icons/commodities/flowers/flower-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-bright-blue-eyes","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"m-S-7-W","sourceCost":"15gp","sourceCategory":"Renforts & Altérations","utilityGroups":["Renforts & Altérations"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"m","localeCode":"S","regionCode":"W","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Bright Blue Eyes","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-bright-blue-eyes","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"renforts-alterations","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Yeux Bleu Vif (Bright Blue Eyes)","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette fleur se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré doux, notamment dans les prairies rases, et elle est surtout connue dans l’Ouest d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste extrêmement difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle doit être préparée en infusion ou décoction.</p><p>L’infusion triple la portée visuelle, améliore la Perception d’environ +25 et donne une faible vision infrarouge pendant trois heures. Une seconde utilisation est réputée mortelle.</p><p>Des prises répétées peuvent entraîner une dépendance notable.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Bright Blue Eyes","system":{"notes":"<p>This flower is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in short-grass plains, and is best known in western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains extremely hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it must be prepared as an infusion or decoction.</p><p>The infusion triples visual range, improves Perception by about +25, and grants limited infrared vision for three hours. A second use is reputed to be fatal.</p><p>Repeated doses can lead to significant dependence.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Renforts & Altérations"],"en":["Enhancements & Alterations"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["renforts-alterations"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"S","findDifficulty":"Extremely Hard","form":"Flower","prep":"brew","season":"","cost":"15gp","notes":"<p>This flower is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in short-grass plains, and is best known in western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains extremely hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it must be prepared as an infusion or decoction.</p><p>The infusion triples visual range, improves Perception by about +25, and grants limited infrared vision for three hours. A second use is reputed to be fatal.</p><p>Repeated doses can lead to significant dependence.</p>","addictionFactor":25,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"DzxCGUgdeK1aJtIh"}
{"name":"Brorkwilb","type":"herb","img":"icons/commodities/flowers/flower-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-brorkwilb","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"m-V-4-U","sourceCost":"9gp","sourceCategory":"Intoxicants","utilityGroups":["Intoxicants"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"m","localeCode":"V","regionCode":"U","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Brorkwilb","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-brorkwilb","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"intoxicants","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Brorkwilb","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette fleur se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré doux, notamment dans les terrains volcaniques, et elle est surtout connue dans l’ensemble d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste de difficulté moyenne à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle se consomme directement.</p><p>La fleur est euphorisante et peut permettre de partager les rêves d’un membre de sa famille qui dort au même moment.</p><p>Son usage présente un risque très élevé d’accoutumance et doit rester exceptionnel.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Brorkwilb","system":{"notes":"<p>This flower is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in volcanic terrain, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains of medium difficulty to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>The flower is euphoric and may allow the user to share the dreams of a family member sleeping at the same time.</p><p>Its use carries a very high risk of addiction and should remain exceptional.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Intoxicants"],"en":["Intoxicants"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["intoxicants"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"V","findDifficulty":"Medium","form":"Flower","prep":"ingest","season":"","cost":"9gp","notes":"<p>This flower is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in volcanic terrain, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains of medium difficulty to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>The flower is euphoric and may allow the user to share the dreams of a family member sleeping at the same time.</p><p>Its use carries a very high risk of addiction and should remain exceptional.</p>","addictionFactor":45,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"Lwkb6NIJeLy2Ket4"}
{"name":"Carcalen","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-carcalen","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"t-U-8-NW","sourceCost":"100gp","sourceCategory":"Poisons","utilityGroups":["Poisons","Nerveux"],"poisonType":"Nerveux","climateCode":"t","localeCode":"U","regionCode":"NW","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Carcalen","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-carcalen","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"poison-nerveux","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Carcalen","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette mousse se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré frais, notamment dans les milieux souterrains, et elle est surtout connue dans le Nord-Ouest d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste presque introuvable.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle est préparée sous forme liquide.</p><p>Poison nerveux de niveau 4 apparenté au Gorfang. Il peut priver la victime de la sensation et de l’usage des extrémités, détruire les nerfs ou, dans les cas extrêmes, les dissoudre et provoquer la mort.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Carcalen","system":{"notes":"<p>This moss is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in underground environments, and is best known in north-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains almost impossible to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is prepared in liquid form.</p><p>Level 4 nerve poison related to Gorfang. It can rob the victim of sensation and use of the extremities, destroy nerves, or, in extreme cases, dissolve them and cause death.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Nerveux"],"en":["Nerve"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["poison-nerveux"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"U","findDifficulty":"Sheer Folly","form":"Moss","prep":"liquid","season":"","cost":"100gp","notes":"<p>This moss is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in underground environments, and is best known in north-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains almost impossible to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is prepared in liquid form.</p><p>Level 4 nerve poison related to Gorfang. It can rob the victim of sensation and use of the extremities, destroy nerves, or, in extreme cases, dissolve them and cause death.</p>","addictionFactor":0,"effects":[],"table":"","level":4},"_id":"LompoKWK6qojjDw8"}
{"name":"Carefree Mustard","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/nuts/chestnut-roasted-brown-white.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-carefree-mustard","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"m-C-8-W","sourceCost":"10gp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Récupération"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"m","localeCode":"C","regionCode":"W","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Carefree Mustard","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-carefree-mustard","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Moutarde Insouciante (Carefree Mustard)","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette graine se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré doux, notamment dans les forêts de conifères, et elle est surtout connue dans l’Ouest d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste presque introuvable.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle s’emploie par application directe.</p><p>Les graines préparées et appliquées avec soin rendent 3 à 30 points de vie en environ une heure.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Carefree Mustard","system":{"notes":"<p>This seed is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in coniferous forests, and is best known in western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains almost impossible to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is used by direct application.</p><p>Prepared seeds, carefully applied, restore 3–30 concussion hits in about one hour.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"C","findDifficulty":"Sheer Folly","form":"Seed","prep":"apply","season":"","cost":"10gp","notes":"<p>This seed is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in coniferous forests, and is best known in western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains almost impossible to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is used by direct application.</p><p>Prepared seeds, carefully applied, restore 3–30 concussion hits in about one hour.</p>","addictionFactor":1,"effects":[{"effect":"heal-hits","formula":"3d10"}],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"cCz4QqVW2x18lg20"}
{"name":"Carlong (Busis, Bonis)","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-carlong-busis-bonis","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"t-S-7-U","sourceCost":"110gp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Os & fractures"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"t","localeCode":"S","regionCode":"U","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Carlong (Busis, Bonis)","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-carlong-busis-bonis","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Carlong (Busis, Bonis)","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette tige se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré frais, notamment dans les prairies rases, et elle est surtout connue dans l’ensemble d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste extrêmement difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle doit être préparée en infusion ou décoction.</p><p>La décoction aide à ressouder les fractures éclatées, à condition d’immobiliser totalement l’os pendant douze heures. On la nomme aussi Bursthelas.</p><p>Des prises répétées peuvent entraîner une dépendance notable.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Carlong (Busis, Bonis)","system":{"notes":"<p>This stalk is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in short-grass plains, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains extremely hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it must be prepared as an infusion or decoction.</p><p>The decoction helps knit shattered fractures provided the bone is kept completely immobile for twelve hours. It is also called Bursthelas.</p><p>Repeated doses can lead to significant dependence.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"S","findDifficulty":"Extremely Hard","form":"Stalk","prep":"brew","season":"","cost":"110gp","notes":"<p>This stalk is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in short-grass plains, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains extremely hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it must be prepared as an infusion or decoction.</p><p>The decoction helps knit shattered fractures provided the bone is kept completely immobile for twelve hours. It is also called Bursthelas.</p><p>Repeated doses can lead to significant dependence.</p>","addictionFactor":22,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"hCtfBbg9GLf1nU2l"}
{"name":"Carnerem","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-carnerem","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"t-S-5-M","sourceCost":"40gp","sourceCategory":"Remèdes & Antidotes","utilityGroups":["Remèdes & Antidotes"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"t","localeCode":"S","regionCode":"M","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Carnerem","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-carnerem","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"remedes-antidotes","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Carnerem","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette feuille se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré frais, notamment dans les prairies rases, et elle est surtout connue dans le centre d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle s’emploie par application directe.</p><p>La feuille suspend les effets d’un poison pendant environ vingt-quatre heures. Elle ne neutralise pas la toxine : elle ne fait qu’en retarder les conséquences.</p><p>Un usage répété peut créer une accoutumance.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Carnerem","system":{"notes":"<p>This leaf is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in short-grass plains, and is best known in central Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is used by direct application.</p><p>The leaf suspends the effects of a poison for about twenty-four hours. It does not neutralize the toxin; it merely delays its consequences.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Remèdes & Antidotes"],"en":["Remedies & Antidotes"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["remedes-antidotes"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"S","findDifficulty":"Hard","form":"Leaf","prep":"apply","season":"","cost":"40gp","notes":"<p>This leaf is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in short-grass plains, and is best known in central Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is used by direct application.</p><p>The leaf suspends the effects of a poison for about twenty-four hours. It does not neutralize the toxin; it merely delays its consequences.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>","addictionFactor":8,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"IHRI60ayN7A4uark"}
{"name":"Carpet Moss","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-carpet-moss","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"t-U-2-NW","sourceCost":"4sp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Os & fractures"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"t","localeCode":"U","regionCode":"NW","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Carpet Moss","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-carpet-moss","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Mousse-Tapis (Carpet Moss)","system":{"notes":"<p>Ce lichen se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré frais, notamment dans les milieux souterrains, et elle est surtout connue dans le Nord-Ouest d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste facile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle s’emploie par application directe.</p><p>Appliqué autour d’un os correctement remis en place, ce lichen facilite la réduction et double la vitesse de guérison. Il peut se conserver environ un an.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Carpet Moss","system":{"notes":"<p>This lichen is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in underground environments, and is best known in north-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains easy to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is used by direct application.</p><p>Applied around a correctly reset bone, this lichen helps the reduction and doubles the healing rate. It can be kept for about a year.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"U","findDifficulty":"Easy","form":"Lichen","prep":"apply","season":"","cost":"4sp","notes":"<p>This lichen is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in underground environments, and is best known in north-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains easy to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is used by direct application.</p><p>Applied around a correctly reset bone, this lichen helps the reduction and doubles the healing rate. It can be kept for about a year.</p>","addictionFactor":1,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"Z3X3oKfx3WIZZVnH"}
{"name":"Chap-beechnuts","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/nuts/chestnut-roasted-brown-white.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-chap-beechnuts","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"m-D-4-NW","sourceCost":"1bp","sourceCategory":"Nourriture","utilityGroups":["Nourriture"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"m","localeCode":"D","regionCode":"NW","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Chap-beechnuts","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-chap-beechnuts","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"nourriture","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Chap-beechnuts","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette noix se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré doux, notamment dans les forêts de feuillus ou mixtes, et elle est surtout connue dans le Nord-Ouest d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste de difficulté moyenne à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle se consomme directement.</p><p>Cinq faînes assurent à une personne l’équivalent d’une journée de nourriture.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Chap-beechnuts","system":{"notes":"<p>This nut is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in deciduous or mixed forests, and is best known in north-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains of medium difficulty to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>Five beechnuts provide one person with the equivalent of a day’s food.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Nourriture"],"en":["Food"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["nourriture"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"D","findDifficulty":"Medium","form":"Nut","prep":"ingest","season":"","cost":"1bp","notes":"<p>This nut is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in deciduous or mixed forests, and is best known in north-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains of medium difficulty to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>Five beechnuts provide one person with the equivalent of a day’s food.</p>","addictionFactor":0,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"UlMaQDUUa1enKfwz"}
{"name":"Charash (Iron Leaf)","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-charash-iron-leaf","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"c-A-6-NE","sourceCost":"4gp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Brûlures & exposition"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"c","localeCode":"A","regionCode":"NE","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Charash (Iron Leaf)","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-charash-iron-leaf","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Charash (Feuille de Fer / Iron Leaf)","system":{"notes":"<p>On la rencontre aussi sous le nom de <strong>Feuille de Fer (Iron Leaf)</strong>.</p><p>Cette feuille se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat froid, notamment dans les hautes zones alpines, et elle est surtout connue dans le Nord-Est d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste très difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle s’emploie par application directe.</p><p>Réduite en poudre et appliquée en cataplasme, cette feuille peut guérir des brûlures même sévères.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Charash (Iron Leaf)","system":{"notes":"<p>It is also known as <strong>Iron Leaf</strong>.</p><p>This leaf is found chiefly in cold climates, especially in high alpine zones, and is best known in north-eastern Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains very hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is used by direct application.</p><p>Ground into powder and applied as a poultice, this leaf can heal even severe burns.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"A","findDifficulty":"Very Hard","form":"Leaf","prep":"apply","season":"","cost":"4gp","notes":"<p>It is also known as <strong>Iron Leaf</strong>.</p><p>This leaf is found chiefly in cold climates, especially in high alpine zones, and is best known in north-eastern Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains very hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is used by direct application.</p><p>Ground into powder and applied as a poultice, this leaf can heal even severe burns.</p>","addictionFactor":0,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"b4rLIp3oe4b2xuS8"}
{"name":"Chékyûv (Blue Rub)","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-chekyuv-blue-rub","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"m-F-2-E","sourceCost":"1sp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Hémorragies & circulation"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"m","localeCode":"F","regionCode":"E","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Chékyûv (Blue Rub)","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-chekyuv-blue-rub","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Chékyûv (Baume Bleu / Blue Rub)","system":{"notes":"<p>On la rencontre aussi sous le nom de <strong>Baume Bleu (Blue Rub)</strong>.</p><p>Ce lichen se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré doux, notamment dans les berges et rivages d’eau douce, et elle est surtout connue dans l’Est d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste facile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle s’emploie par application directe.</p><p>Frotté directement sur une plaie, ce lichen réduit l’hémorragie d’environ deux points par round, au prix d’une forte léthargie pendant une heure.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Chékyûv (Blue Rub)","system":{"notes":"<p>It is also known as <strong>Blue Rub</strong>.</p><p>This lichen is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in freshwater banks and shores, and is best known in eastern Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains easy to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is used by direct application.</p><p>Rubbed directly onto a wound, this lichen reduces bleeding by about 2 hits per round, at the cost of severe lethargy for one hour.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"F","findDifficulty":"Easy","form":"Lichen","prep":"apply","season":"","cost":"1sp","notes":"<p>It is also known as <strong>Blue Rub</strong>.</p><p>This lichen is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in freshwater banks and shores, and is best known in eastern Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains easy to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is used by direct application.</p><p>Rubbed directly onto a wound, this lichen reduces bleeding by about 2 hits per round, at the cost of severe lethargy for one hour.</p>","addictionFactor":1,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"UludnCENb3jns2er"}
{"name":"Chrumë","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-chrume","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"t-U-4-W","sourceCost":"15sp","sourceCategory":"Intoxicants","utilityGroups":["Intoxicants"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"t","localeCode":"U","regionCode":"W","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Chrumë","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-chrume","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"intoxicants","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Chrumë","system":{"notes":"<p>Ce champignon se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré frais, notamment dans les milieux souterrains, et elle est surtout connue dans l’Ouest d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste de difficulté moyenne à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle se consomme directement.</p><p>Ce champignon euphorisant et stimulant affaiblit Agilité et Rapidité d’environ 20, tout en renforçant Constitution et Présence d’environ 20 pendant plusieurs heures. L’utilisateur devient facilement fasciné par des détails insignifiants.</p><p>Un usage répété peut créer une accoutumance.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Chrumë","system":{"notes":"<p>This mushroom is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in underground environments, and is best known in western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains of medium difficulty to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>This euphoric stimulant mushroom reduces Agility and Quickness by about 20 while increasing Constitution and Presence by about 20 for several hours. The user becomes easily fascinated by insignificant details.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Intoxicants"],"en":["Intoxicants"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["intoxicants"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"U","findDifficulty":"Medium","form":"Mushroom","prep":"ingest","season":"","cost":"15sp","notes":"<p>This mushroom is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in underground environments, and is best known in western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains of medium difficulty to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>This euphoric stimulant mushroom reduces Agility and Quickness by about 20 while increasing Constitution and Presence by about 20 for several hours. The user becomes easily fascinated by insignificant details.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>","addictionFactor":10,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"FvdwRx2AGezAdXwk"}
{"name":"Coraco (Ralasta)","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/fruit/berry-leaf-pink.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-coraco-ralasta","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"s-D-2-SW","sourceCost":"85gp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Récupération"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"s","localeCode":"D","regionCode":"SW","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Coraco (Ralasta)","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-coraco-ralasta","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Coraco (Ralasta)","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette baie se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat semi-aride, notamment dans les forêts de feuillus ou mixtes, et elle est surtout connue dans le Sud-Ouest d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste facile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle se consomme directement.</p><p>Cette baie du Suza Sumar donne un jus concentré : huit onces rendent 2 à 20 points de vie. Il faut environ deux grands seaux de baies pour une dose, qui se conserve six mois.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Coraco (Ralasta)","system":{"notes":"<p>This berry is found chiefly in semi-arid climates, especially in deciduous or mixed forests, and is best known in south-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains easy to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>This berry from the Suza Sumar yields a concentrated juice: eight ounces restore 2–20 concussion hits. Roughly two large buckets of berries are needed for one dose, which keeps for six months.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"D","findDifficulty":"Easy","form":"Berry","prep":"ingest","season":"","cost":"85gp","notes":"<p>This berry is found chiefly in semi-arid climates, especially in deciduous or mixed forests, and is best known in south-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains easy to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>This berry from the Suza Sumar yields a concentrated juice: eight ounces restore 2–20 concussion hits. Roughly two large buckets of berries are needed for one dose, which keeps for six months.</p>","addictionFactor":0,"effects":[{"effect":"heal-hits","formula":"2d10"}],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"iGZC482NiiWC6wKE"}
{"name":"Culkas (Lesser Aloe)","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-culkas-lesser-aloe","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"s-Z-4-M","sourceCost":"35gp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Brûlures & exposition"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"s","localeCode":"Z","regionCode":"M","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Culkas (Lesser Aloe)","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-culkas-lesser-aloe","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Culkas (Petit Aloès / Lesser Aloe)","system":{"notes":"<p>On la rencontre aussi sous le nom de <strong>Petit Aloès (Lesser Aloe)</strong>.</p><p>Cette feuille se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat semi-aride, notamment dans les déserts, et elle est surtout connue dans le centre d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste de difficulté moyenne à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle s’emploie par application directe.</p><p>La chair de la feuille, appliquée directement, peut traiter environ dix pieds carrés de brûlures.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Culkas (Lesser Aloe)","system":{"notes":"<p>It is also known as <strong>Lesser Aloe</strong>.</p><p>This leaf is found chiefly in semi-arid climates, especially in deserts, and is best known in central Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains of medium difficulty to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is used by direct application.</p><p>The flesh of the leaf, applied directly, can treat about ten square feet of burns.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"Z","findDifficulty":"Medium","form":"Leaf","prep":"apply","season":"","cost":"35gp","notes":"<p>It is also known as <strong>Lesser Aloe</strong>.</p><p>This leaf is found chiefly in semi-arid climates, especially in deserts, and is best known in central Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains of medium difficulty to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is used by direct application.</p><p>The flesh of the leaf, applied directly, can treat about ten square feet of burns.</p>","addictionFactor":0,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"wyZhwqlPqfEVTHhD"}
{"name":"Curfalaka","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/fruit/berry-leaf-pink.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-curfalaka","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"h-J-7-SW","sourceCost":"40gp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Muscles, nerfs & organes"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"h","localeCode":"J","regionCode":"SW","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Curfalaka","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-curfalaka","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Curfalaka","system":{"notes":"<p>Ce fruit se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat chaud et humide, notamment dans les jungles et forêts pluviales, et elle est surtout connue dans le Sud-Ouest d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste extrêmement difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle se consomme directement.</p><p>Le fruit accélère la guérison des blessures musculaires.</p><p>Un usage répété peut créer une accoutumance.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Curfalaka","system":{"notes":"<p>This fruit is found chiefly in hot and humid climates, especially in jungles and rainforests, and is best known in south-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains extremely hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>The fruit speeds the healing of muscle injuries.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"J","findDifficulty":"Extremely Hard","form":"Fruit","prep":"ingest","season":"","cost":"40gp","notes":"<p>This fruit is found chiefly in hot and humid climates, especially in jungles and rainforests, and is best known in south-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains extremely hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>The fruit speeds the healing of muscle injuries.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>","addictionFactor":6,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"ILJ4WMV1sF3JyxWS"}
{"name":"Cusamar","type":"herb","img":"icons/commodities/flowers/flower-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-cusamar","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"c-H-8-N","sourceCost":"30gp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Récupération"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"c","localeCode":"H","regionCode":"N","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Cusamar","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-cusamar","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Cusamar","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette fleur se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat froid, notamment dans les landes, broussailles et bruyères, et elle est surtout connue dans le Nord d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste presque introuvable.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle se consomme directement.</p><p>La fleur rend 15 à 60 points de vie.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Cusamar","system":{"notes":"<p>This flower is found chiefly in cold climates, especially in heaths, scrublands, and moors, and is best known in northern Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains almost impossible to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>The flower restores 15–60 concussion hits.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"H","findDifficulty":"Sheer Folly","form":"Flower","prep":"ingest","season":"","cost":"30gp","notes":"<p>This flower is found chiefly in cold climates, especially in heaths, scrublands, and moors, and is best known in northern Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains almost impossible to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>The flower restores 15–60 concussion hits.</p>","addictionFactor":3,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"Tp8XxPvVFMD6kWMK"}
{"name":"Dagmather","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-dagmather","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"s-S-5-U","sourceCost":"28gp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Muscles, nerfs & organes"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"s","localeCode":"S","regionCode":"U","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Dagmather","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-dagmather","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Dagmather","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette épine se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat semi-aride, notamment dans les prairies rases, et elle est surtout connue dans l’ensemble d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle doit être préparée en infusion ou décoction.</p><p>La préparation tirée des épines favorise la réparation du cartilage.</p><p>Un usage répété peut créer une accoutumance.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Dagmather","system":{"notes":"<p>This spine is found chiefly in semi-arid climates, especially in short-grass plains, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it must be prepared as an infusion or decoction.</p><p>A preparation made from the thorns promotes cartilage repair.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"S","findDifficulty":"Hard","form":"Spine","prep":"brew","season":"","cost":"28gp","notes":"<p>This spine is found chiefly in semi-arid climates, especially in short-grass plains, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it must be prepared as an infusion or decoction.</p><p>A preparation made from the thorns promotes cartilage repair.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>","addictionFactor":12,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"goSmaNdab2DgRtS2"}
{"name":"Darsurion","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-darsurion","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"c-M-5-U","sourceCost":"35bp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Récupération"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"c","localeCode":"M","regionCode":"U","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Darsurion","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-darsurion","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Darsurion","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette feuille se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat froid, notamment dans les montagnes, et elle est surtout connue dans l’ensemble d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle s’emploie par application directe.</p><p>Appliquée sur une blessure, la feuille rend 1 à 6 points de vie.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Darsurion","system":{"notes":"<p>This leaf is found chiefly in cold climates, especially in mountains, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is used by direct application.</p><p>Applied to a wound, the leaf restores 1–6 concussion hits.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"M","findDifficulty":"Hard","form":"Leaf","prep":"apply","season":"","cost":"35bp","notes":"<p>This leaf is found chiefly in cold climates, especially in mountains, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is used by direct application.</p><p>Applied to a wound, the leaf restores 1–6 concussion hits.</p>","addictionFactor":1,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"TNmDOc0ofnItBdNa"}
{"name":"Degík (Life-vine)","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-degik-life-vine","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"h-O-5-U","sourceCost":"100gp","sourceCategory":"Préservation & Survie","utilityGroups":["Préservation & Survie"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"h","localeCode":"O","regionCode":"U","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Degík (Life-vine)","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-degik-life-vine","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"preservation-survie","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Degík (Liane-de-Vie / Life-vine)","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette feuille se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat chaud et humide, notamment dans les côtes marines et rivages salés, et elle est surtout connue dans l’ensemble d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle se consomme directement.</p><p>La feuille stabilise pendant environ une journée un patient au bord de la mort, ce qui laisse aux guérisseurs le temps d’agir.</p><p>Un usage répété peut créer une accoutumance.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Degík (Life-vine)","system":{"notes":"<p>This leaf is found chiefly in hot and humid climates, especially in sea coasts and saltwater shores, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>The leaf stabilizes a patient on the verge of death for about one day, giving healers time to act.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Préservation & Survie"],"en":["Preservation & Survival"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["preservation-survie"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"O","findDifficulty":"Hard","form":"Leaf","prep":"ingest","season":"","cost":"100gp","notes":"<p>This leaf is found chiefly in hot and humid climates, especially in sea coasts and saltwater shores, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>The leaf stabilizes a patient on the verge of death for about one day, giving healers time to act.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>","addictionFactor":10,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"TLLwNdcsvTmvYJGu"}
{"name":"Delrean (Delrian)","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-delrean-delrian","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"c-C-2-U","sourceCost":"3sp","sourceCategory":"Remèdes & Antidotes","utilityGroups":["Remèdes & Antidotes"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"c","localeCode":"C","regionCode":"U","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Delrean (Delrian)","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-delrean-delrian","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"remedes-antidotes","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Delrean (Delrian)","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette feuille se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat froid, notamment dans les forêts de conifères, et elle est surtout connue dans l’ensemble d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste facile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle s’emploie par application directe.</p><p>Frottées sur la peau, ces feuilles à l’odeur repoussante tiennent la plupart des insectes à une dizaine de pieds de distance.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Delrean (Delrian)","system":{"notes":"<p>This leaf is found chiefly in cold climates, especially in coniferous forests, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains easy to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is used by direct application.</p><p>Rubbed on the skin, these foul-smelling leaves keep most insects about ten feet away.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Remèdes & Antidotes"],"en":["Remedies & Antidotes"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["remedes-antidotes"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"C","findDifficulty":"Easy","form":"Leaf","prep":"apply","season":"","cost":"3sp","notes":"<p>This leaf is found chiefly in cold climates, especially in coniferous forests, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains easy to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is used by direct application.</p><p>Rubbed on the skin, these foul-smelling leaves keep most insects about ten feet away.</p>","addictionFactor":1,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"8H5Yb1200CkfFWKo"}
{"name":"Dráf (Seawort)","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-draf-seawort","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"s-O-2-W","sourceCost":"5sp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Récupération"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"s","localeCode":"O","regionCode":"W","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Dráf (Seawort)","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-draf-seawort","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Dráf (Herbe-de-Mer / Seawort)","system":{"notes":"<p>On la rencontre aussi sous le nom de <strong>Herbe-de-Mer (Seawort)</strong>.</p><p>Cette feuille se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat semi-aride, notamment dans les côtes marines et rivages salés, et elle est surtout connue dans l’Ouest d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste facile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle se consomme directement.</p><p>La feuille rend 1 à 10 points de vie au cours de l’heure suivante, à condition de rester au repos. Chaque dose supplémentaire est deux fois moins efficace. Elle se garde trois jours.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Dráf (Seawort)","system":{"notes":"<p>It is also known as <strong>Seawort</strong>.</p><p>This leaf is found chiefly in semi-arid climates, especially in sea coasts and saltwater shores, and is best known in western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains easy to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>The leaf restores 1–10 concussion hits over the following hour, provided the patient rests. Each additional dose is only half as effective. It keeps for three days.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"O","findDifficulty":"Easy","form":"Leaf","prep":"ingest","season":"","cost":"5sp","notes":"<p>It is also known as <strong>Seawort</strong>.</p><p>This leaf is found chiefly in semi-arid climates, especially in sea coasts and saltwater shores, and is best known in western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains easy to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>The leaf restores 1–10 concussion hits over the following hour, provided the patient rests. Each additional dose is only half as effective. It keeps for three days.</p>","addictionFactor":1,"effects":[{"effect":"heal-hits","formula":"1d10"}],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"jIO299bUDHxylxQH"}
{"name":"Dragon Grass","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/nuts/chestnut-roasted-brown-white.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-dragon-grass","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"c-O-2-U","sourceCost":"3sp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Brûlures & exposition"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"c","localeCode":"O","regionCode":"U","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Dragon Grass","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-dragon-grass","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Herbe-Dragon (Dragon Grass)","system":{"notes":"<p>Ces graines se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat froid, notamment dans les côtes marines et rivages salés, et elle est surtout connue dans l’ensemble d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste facile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle s’emploie par application directe.</p><p>Les graines moulues et répandues sur la peau brûlée calment la douleur pendant environ douze heures. Elles se conservent une année.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Dragon Grass","system":{"notes":"<p>This seeds is found chiefly in cold climates, especially in sea coasts and saltwater shores, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains easy to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is used by direct application.</p><p>The seeds are ground and scattered over burned skin, relieving pain for about twelve hours. They keep for one year.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"O","findDifficulty":"Easy","form":"Seeds","prep":"apply","season":"","cost":"3sp","notes":"<p>This seeds is found chiefly in cold climates, especially in sea coasts and saltwater shores, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains easy to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is used by direct application.</p><p>The seeds are ground and scattered over burned skin, relieving pain for about twelve hours. They keep for one year.</p>","addictionFactor":0,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"0ljQFSZ3qjIGNe88"}
{"name":"Dynallca","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-dynallca","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"h-F-3","sourceCost":"14gp","sourceCategory":"Poisons","utilityGroups":["Poisons","Musculaire"],"poisonType":"Musculaire","climateCode":"h","localeCode":"F","regionCode":null,"sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Dynallca","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-dynallca","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"poison-musculaires","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Dynallca","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette feuille se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat chaud et humide, notamment dans les berges et rivages d’eau douce.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste assez aisée à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle est préparée sous forme de pâte.</p><p>Poison musculaire de niveau 3B. Cette pâte fauve attaque l’audition, inflige 1 à 10 points de vie et peut aller jusqu’à détruire l’ouïe.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Dynallca","system":{"notes":"<p>This leaf is found chiefly in hot and humid climates, especially in freshwater banks and shores.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains fairly easy to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is prepared as a paste.</p><p>Level 3B muscle poison. This tan paste attacks hearing, inflicts 1–10 concussion hits, and can ultimately destroy the victim’s hearing.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Musculaires"],"en":["Muscle"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["poison-musculaires"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"F","findDifficulty":"Light","form":"Leaf","prep":"paste","season":"","cost":"14gp","notes":"<p>This leaf is found chiefly in hot and humid climates, especially in freshwater banks and shores.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains fairly easy to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is prepared as a paste.</p><p>Level 3B muscle poison. This tan paste attacks hearing, inflicts 1–10 concussion hits, and can ultimately destroy the victim’s hearing.</p>","addictionFactor":3,"effects":[],"table":"","level":3},"_id":"HP4uoCXx546Q95fG"}
{"name":"Ebur","type":"herb","img":"icons/commodities/flowers/flower-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-ebur","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"m-O-4-W","sourceCost":"22gp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Muscles, nerfs & organes"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"m","localeCode":"O","regionCode":"W","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Ebur","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-ebur","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Ebur","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette fleur se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré doux, notamment dans les côtes marines et rivages salés, et elle est surtout connue dans l’Ouest d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste de difficulté moyenne à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle se consomme directement.</p><p>La fleur est utilisée pour accélérer la récupération des entorses.</p><p>Des prises répétées peuvent entraîner une dépendance notable.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Ebur","system":{"notes":"<p>This flower is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in sea coasts and saltwater shores, and is best known in western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains of medium difficulty to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>The flower is used to speed recovery from sprains.</p><p>Repeated doses can lead to significant dependence.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"O","findDifficulty":"Medium","form":"Flower","prep":"ingest","season":"","cost":"22gp","notes":"<p>This flower is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in sea coasts and saltwater shores, and is best known in western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains of medium difficulty to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>The flower is used to speed recovery from sprains.</p><p>Repeated doses can lead to significant dependence.</p>","addictionFactor":18,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"kGLGBZEAv6H5vsQb"}
{"name":"Ecásse","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-ecasse","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"m-H-6-N","sourceCost":"20gp","sourceCategory":"Intoxicants","utilityGroups":["Intoxicants"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"m","localeCode":"H","regionCode":"N","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Ecásse","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-ecasse","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"intoxicants","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Ecásse","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette gousse se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré doux, notamment dans les landes, broussailles et bruyères, et elle est surtout connue dans le Nord d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste très difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle doit être préparée en infusion ou décoction.</p><p>Ce puissant stimulant hallucinogène protège temporairement contre certaines attaques et maladies mentales, mais plonge l’utilisateur dans une confiance délirante envers tous ceux qu’il voit, suivie d’un long contrecoup douloureux.</p><p>Des prises répétées peuvent entraîner une dépendance notable.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Ecásse","system":{"notes":"<p>This clove is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in heaths, scrublands, and moors, and is best known in northern Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains very hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it must be prepared as an infusion or decoction.</p><p>This powerful hallucinogenic stimulant temporarily protects against certain mental attacks and illnesses, but plunges the user into delusional trust of everyone they see, followed by a long and painful after-effect.</p><p>Repeated doses can lead to significant dependence.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Intoxicants"],"en":["Intoxicants"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["intoxicants"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"H","findDifficulty":"Very Hard","form":"Clove","prep":"brew","season":"","cost":"20gp","notes":"<p>This clove is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in heaths, scrublands, and moors, and is best known in northern Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains very hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it must be prepared as an infusion or decoction.</p><p>This powerful hallucinogenic stimulant temporarily protects against certain mental attacks and illnesses, but plunges the user into delusional trust of everyone they see, followed by a long and painful after-effect.</p><p>Repeated doses can lead to significant dependence.</p>","addictionFactor":25,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"0vE6ftX4TNMRZlKc"}
{"name":"Eddij (Goldenroot)","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/fruit/berry-leaf-pink.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-eddij-goldenroot","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"h-D-8-S","sourceCost":"560gp","sourceCategory":"Préservation & Survie","utilityGroups":["Préservation & Survie"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"h","localeCode":"D","regionCode":"S","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Eddij (Goldenroot)","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-eddij-goldenroot","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"preservation-survie","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Eddij (Racine Dorée / Goldenroot)","system":{"notes":"<p>On la rencontre aussi sous le nom de <strong>Racine Dorée (Goldenroot)</strong>.</p><p>Cette baie se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat chaud et humide, notamment dans les forêts de feuillus ou mixtes, et elle est surtout connue dans le Sud d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste presque introuvable.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle s’emploie par application directe.</p><p>Le jus de cette baie, appliqué aux yeux juste avant une mort imminente, peut maintenir la vie quelques heures supplémentaires.</p><p>Un usage répété peut créer une accoutumance.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Eddij (Goldenroot)","system":{"notes":"<p>It is also known as <strong>Goldenroot</strong>.</p><p>This berry is found chiefly in hot and humid climates, especially in deciduous or mixed forests, and is best known in southern Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains almost impossible to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is used by direct application.</p><p>The juice of this berry, applied to the eyes immediately before imminent death, can sustain life for several additional hours.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Préservation & Survie"],"en":["Preservation & Survival"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["preservation-survie"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"D","findDifficulty":"Sheer Folly","form":"Berry","prep":"apply","season":"","cost":"560gp","notes":"<p>It is also known as <strong>Goldenroot</strong>.</p><p>This berry is found chiefly in hot and humid climates, especially in deciduous or mixed forests, and is best known in southern Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains almost impossible to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is used by direct application.</p><p>The juice of this berry, applied to the eyes immediately before imminent death, can sustain life for several additional hours.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>","addictionFactor":12,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"BwUTWRuBaX0hWLUr"}
{"name":"Edram (Bonehae)","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-edram-bonehae","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"c-F-6-N","sourceCost":"33gp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Os & fractures"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"c","localeCode":"F","regionCode":"N","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Edram (Bonehae)","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-edram-bonehae","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Edram (Bonehae)","system":{"notes":"<p>On la rencontre aussi sous le nom de <strong>Guérit-Os (Bonehae)</strong>.</p><p>Cette mousse se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat froid, notamment dans les berges et rivages d’eau douce, et elle est surtout connue dans le Nord d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste très difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle se consomme directement.</p><p>Consommée très fraîche, idéalement dans la minute suivant la préparation, cette mousse peut ressouder un os en environ deux heures si celui-ci est bien réduit et maintenu immobile.</p><p>Un usage répété peut créer une accoutumance.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Edram (Bonehae)","system":{"notes":"<p>It is also known as <strong>Bonehae</strong>.</p><p>This moss is found chiefly in cold climates, especially in freshwater banks and shores, and is best known in northern Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains very hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>Consumed very fresh, ideally within one minute of preparation, this moss can knit a bone in about two hours if it has been correctly set and kept immobile.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"F","findDifficulty":"Very Hard","form":"Moss","prep":"ingest","season":"","cost":"33gp","notes":"<p>It is also known as <strong>Bonehae</strong>.</p><p>This moss is found chiefly in cold climates, especially in freshwater banks and shores, and is best known in northern Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains very hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>Consumed very fresh, ideally within one minute of preparation, this moss can knit a bone in about two hours if it has been correctly set and kept immobile.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>","addictionFactor":10,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"6dGcTQT7VZjFkMFs"}
{"name":"Elben’s Basket","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/nuts/chestnut-roasted-brown-white.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-elbens-basket","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"t-S-8-NW","sourceCost":"10gp","sourceCategory":"Renforts & Altérations","utilityGroups":["Renforts & Altérations"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"t","localeCode":"S","regionCode":"NW","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Elben’s Basket","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-elbens-basket","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"renforts-alterations","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Panier d’Elben (Elben’s Basket)","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette racine se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré frais, notamment dans les prairies rases, et elle est surtout connue dans le Nord-Ouest d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste presque introuvable.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle doit être préparée en infusion ou décoction.</p><p>Ce stimulant cardiaque permet un bref sursaut de vitesse une fois par heure. Une dose excessive impose une journée entière de repos ; plus de deux doses simultanées peuvent provoquer un arrêt cardiaque.</p><p>Des prises répétées peuvent entraîner une dépendance notable.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Elben’s Basket","system":{"notes":"<p>This root is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in short-grass plains, and is best known in north-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains almost impossible to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it must be prepared as an infusion or decoction.</p><p>This cardiac stimulant allows a brief burst of speed once per hour. An excessive dose requires a full day of rest; more than two doses at once can cause cardiac arrest.</p><p>Repeated doses can lead to significant dependence.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Renforts & Altérations"],"en":["Enhancements & Alterations"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["renforts-alterations"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"S","findDifficulty":"Sheer Folly","form":"Root","prep":"brew","season":"","cost":"10gp","notes":"<p>This root is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in short-grass plains, and is best known in north-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains almost impossible to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it must be prepared as an infusion or decoction.</p><p>This cardiac stimulant allows a brief burst of speed once per hour. An excessive dose requires a full day of rest; more than two doses at once can cause cardiac arrest.</p><p>Repeated doses can lead to significant dependence.</p>","addictionFactor":15,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"VJLvFIqDhT87czy6"}
{"name":"Eldanna","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-eldanna","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"c-O-4-N","sourceCost":"99gp","sourceCategory":"Remèdes & Antidotes","utilityGroups":["Remèdes & Antidotes"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"c","localeCode":"O","regionCode":"N","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Eldanna","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-eldanna","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"remedes-antidotes","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Eldanna","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette feuille se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat froid, notamment dans les côtes marines et rivages salés, et elle est surtout connue dans le Nord d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste de difficulté moyenne à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle doit être préparée en infusion ou décoction.</p><p>Antidote de niveau 9 contre les poisons de réduction. Il peut également inverser la malédiction dite « Laideur d’Orn ».</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Eldanna","system":{"notes":"<p>This leaf is found chiefly in cold climates, especially in sea coasts and saltwater shores, and is best known in northern Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains of medium difficulty to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it must be prepared as an infusion or decoction.</p><p>Level 9 antidote for Reduction poisons. It can also reverse the curse known as “Ugliness of Orn.”</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Remèdes & Antidotes"],"en":["Remedies & Antidotes"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["remedes-antidotes"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"O","findDifficulty":"Medium","form":"Leaf","prep":"brew","season":"","cost":"99gp","notes":"<p>This leaf is found chiefly in cold climates, especially in sea coasts and saltwater shores, and is best known in northern Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains of medium difficulty to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it must be prepared as an infusion or decoction.</p><p>Level 9 antidote for Reduction poisons. It can also reverse the curse known as “Ugliness of Orn.”</p>","addictionFactor":2,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"PGvubbDDna7dcnpj"}
{"name":"Elendil’s Basket","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/nuts/chestnut-roasted-brown-white.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-elendils-basket","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"f-H-7-N","sourceCost":"8gp","sourceCategory":"Renforts & Altérations","utilityGroups":["Renforts & Altérations"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"f","localeCode":"H","regionCode":"N","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Elendil’s Basket","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-elendils-basket","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"renforts-alterations","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Elendil’s Basket","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette racine se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat glacial, notamment dans les landes, broussailles et bruyères, et elle est surtout connue dans le Nord d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste extrêmement difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle doit être préparée en infusion ou décoction.</p><p>La décoction purifie l’eau et ralentit environ dix fois la progression des poisons pendant douze heures.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Elendil’s Basket","system":{"notes":"<p>This root is found chiefly in frigid climates, especially in heaths, scrublands, and moors, and is best known in northern Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains extremely hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it must be prepared as an infusion or decoction.</p><p>The decoction purifies water and slows the progression of poisons by roughly a factor of ten for twelve hours.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Renforts & Altérations"],"en":["Enhancements & Alterations"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["renforts-alterations"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"H","findDifficulty":"Extremely Hard","form":"Root","prep":"brew","season":"","cost":"8gp","notes":"<p>This root is found chiefly in frigid climates, especially in heaths, scrublands, and moors, and is best known in northern Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains extremely hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it must be prepared as an infusion or decoction.</p><p>The decoction purifies water and slows the progression of poisons by roughly a factor of ten for twelve hours.</p>","addictionFactor":0,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"lOIHFUk1SthY7e52"}
{"name":"Faghiu","type":"herb","img":"icons/commodities/flowers/flower-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-faghiu","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"f-M-9-NW","sourceCost":"330gp","sourceCategory":"Renforts & Altérations","utilityGroups":["Renforts & Altérations"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"f","localeCode":"M","regionCode":"NW","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Faghiu","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-faghiu","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"renforts-alterations","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Faghiu","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette fleur se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat glacial, notamment dans les montagnes, et elle est surtout connue dans le Nord-Ouest d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste d’une rareté légendaire.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle doit être préparée en infusion ou décoction.</p><p>La potion pousse sa victime à servir ou aimer celui qui la lui a donnée pendant 1 à 100 jours, sans pour autant l’amener à se faire volontairement du mal.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Faghiu","system":{"notes":"<p>This flower is found chiefly in frigid climates, especially in mountains, and is best known in north-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains of legendary rarity.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it must be prepared as an infusion or decoction.</p><p>The potion compels its victim to serve or love the person who gave it to them for 1–100 days, though it will not make the victim willingly harm themself.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Renforts & Altérations"],"en":["Enhancements & Alterations"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["renforts-alterations"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"M","findDifficulty":"Absurd","form":"Flower","prep":"brew","season":"","cost":"330gp","notes":"<p>This flower is found chiefly in frigid climates, especially in mountains, and is best known in north-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains of legendary rarity.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it must be prepared as an infusion or decoction.</p><p>The potion compels its victim to serve or love the person who gave it to them for 1–100 days, though it will not make the victim willingly harm themself.</p>","addictionFactor":0,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"V1voCGjGviagI9lD"}
{"name":"Falsereg","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-falsereg","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"c-G-7-N","sourceCost":"90gp","sourceCategory":"Poisons","utilityGroups":["Poisons","Conversion"],"poisonType":"Conversion","climateCode":"c","localeCode":"G","regionCode":"N","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Falsereg","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-falsereg","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"poison-conversion","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Falsereg","system":{"notes":"<p>Ce sang se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat froid, notamment dans les glaciers et champs de neige, et elle est surtout connue dans le Nord d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste extrêmement difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle est préparée sous forme de pâte.</p><p>Poison de conversion de niveau 1 préparé à partir de sang de poisson. Il fait peler la peau pendant des semaines et, dans les cas graves, provoque des saignements par les pores lors des efforts.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Falsereg","system":{"notes":"<p>This blood is found chiefly in cold climates, especially in glaciers and snowfields, and is best known in northern Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains extremely hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is prepared as a paste.</p><p>Level 1 conversion poison prepared from fish blood. It causes the skin to peel continuously for weeks and, in severe cases, causes bleeding through the pores during exertion.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Conversion"],"en":["Conversion"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["poison-conversion"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"G","findDifficulty":"Extremely Hard","form":"Blood","prep":"paste","season":"","cost":"90gp","notes":"<p>This blood is found chiefly in cold climates, especially in glaciers and snowfields, and is best known in northern Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains extremely hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is prepared as a paste.</p><p>Level 1 conversion poison prepared from fish blood. It causes the skin to peel continuously for weeks and, in severe cases, causes bleeding through the pores during exertion.</p>","addictionFactor":0,"effects":[],"table":"","level":1},"_id":"X4tmcxV9sQJPDnon"}
{"name":"Febfendu","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/nuts/chestnut-roasted-brown-white.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-febfendu","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"c-F-4-W","sourceCost":"90gp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Muscles, nerfs & organes"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"c","localeCode":"F","regionCode":"W","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Febfendu","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-febfendu","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Febfendu","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette racine se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat froid, notamment dans les berges et rivages d’eau douce, et elle est surtout connue dans l’Ouest d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste de difficulté moyenne à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle doit être préparée en infusion ou décoction.</p><p>La décoction est utilisée pour restaurer l’ouïe perdue à la suite d’une lésion organique.</p><p>Des prises répétées peuvent entraîner une dépendance notable.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Febfendu","system":{"notes":"<p>This root is found chiefly in cold climates, especially in freshwater banks and shores, and is best known in western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains of medium difficulty to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it must be prepared as an infusion or decoction.</p><p>The decoction is used to restore hearing lost through organic injury.</p><p>Repeated doses can lead to significant dependence.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"F","findDifficulty":"Medium","form":"Root","prep":"brew","season":"","cost":"90gp","notes":"<p>This root is found chiefly in cold climates, especially in freshwater banks and shores, and is best known in western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains of medium difficulty to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it must be prepared as an infusion or decoction.</p><p>The decoction is used to restore hearing lost through organic injury.</p><p>Repeated doses can lead to significant dependence.</p>","addictionFactor":24,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"3qnagaYeoMScaHh3"}
{"name":"Feduilas","type":"herb","img":"icons/commodities/flowers/flower-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-feduilas","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"m-D-5-NW","sourceCost":"11sp","sourceCategory":"Intoxicants","utilityGroups":["Intoxicants"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"m","localeCode":"D","regionCode":"NW","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Feduilas","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-feduilas","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"intoxicants","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Feduilas","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette fleur se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré doux, notamment dans les forêts de feuillus ou mixtes, et elle est surtout connue dans le Nord-Ouest d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle se consomme directement.</p><p>Fumée comme relaxant, cette fleur accorde environ +20 aux résistances contre les attaques mentales et d’Essence pendant 1 à 5 heures, mais réduit Agilité et Rapidité d’environ 10.</p><p>Des prises répétées peuvent entraîner une dépendance notable.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Feduilas","system":{"notes":"<p>This flower is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in deciduous or mixed forests, and is best known in north-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>Smoked as a relaxant, this flower grants about +20 to Resistance Rolls against Mentalism and Essence attacks for 1–5 hours, but reduces Agility and Quickness by about 10.</p><p>Repeated doses can lead to significant dependence.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Intoxicants"],"en":["Intoxicants"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["intoxicants"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"D","findDifficulty":"Hard","form":"Flower","prep":"ingest","season":"","cost":"11sp","notes":"<p>This flower is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in deciduous or mixed forests, and is best known in north-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>Smoked as a relaxant, this flower grants about +20 to Resistance Rolls against Mentalism and Essence attacks for 1–5 hours, but reduces Agility and Quickness by about 10.</p><p>Repeated doses can lead to significant dependence.</p>","addictionFactor":15,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"GqbcjsRRPgPT6reJ"}
{"name":"Felmather","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-felmather","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"m-O-5-U","sourceCost":"105gp","sourceCategory":"Remèdes & Antidotes","utilityGroups":["Remèdes & Antidotes"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"m","localeCode":"O","regionCode":"U","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Felmather","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-felmather","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"remedes-antidotes","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Felmather","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette feuille se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré doux, notamment dans les côtes marines et rivages salés, et elle est surtout connue dans l’ensemble d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle se consomme directement.</p><p>La feuille permet d’appeler mentalement un ami connu, qu’il soit bête ou personne, dans un rayon d’environ 300 pieds par niveau. Elle peut aussi aider à sortir d’un coma.</p><p>Des prises répétées peuvent entraîner une dépendance notable.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Felmather","system":{"notes":"<p>This leaf is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in sea coasts and saltwater shores, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>The leaf allows the user to mentally call a known friend, whether beast or person, within a range of about 300 feet per level. It can also help bring someone out of a coma.</p><p>Repeated doses can lead to significant dependence.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Remèdes & Antidotes"],"en":["Remedies & Antidotes"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["remedes-antidotes"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"O","findDifficulty":"Hard","form":"Leaf","prep":"ingest","season":"","cost":"105gp","notes":"<p>This leaf is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in sea coasts and saltwater shores, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>The leaf allows the user to mentally call a known friend, whether beast or person, within a range of about 300 feet per level. It can also help bring someone out of a coma.</p><p>Repeated doses can lead to significant dependence.</p>","addictionFactor":15,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"SjCn6NFswFlJOdEo"}
{"name":"Firebreath (Tongue-toaster)","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/fruit/berry-leaf-pink.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-firebreath-tongue-toaster","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"m-S-4-SE","sourceCost":"4gp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Hémorragies & circulation"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"m","localeCode":"S","regionCode":"SE","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Firebreath (Tongue-toaster)","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-firebreath-tongue-toaster","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Souffle-de-Feu (Firebreath / Grille-Langue / Tongue-toaster)","system":{"notes":"<p>On la rencontre aussi sous le nom de <strong>Grille-Langue (Tongue-toaster)</strong>.</p><p>Ce fruit se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré doux, notamment dans les prairies rases, et elle est surtout connue dans le Sud-Est d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste de difficulté moyenne à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle s’emploie par application directe.</p><p>La pulpe fraîche arrête immédiatement le saignement et permet de récupérer 1 à 10 points de vie. Le fruit doit être utilisé peu après la cueillette.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Firebreath (Tongue-toaster)","system":{"notes":"<p>It is also known as <strong>Tongue-toaster</strong>.</p><p>This fruit is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in short-grass plains, and is best known in south-eastern Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains of medium difficulty to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is used by direct application.</p><p>The fresh pulp stops bleeding immediately and restores 1–10 concussion hits. The fruit must be used soon after picking.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"S","findDifficulty":"Medium","form":"Fruit","prep":"apply","season":"","cost":"4gp","notes":"<p>It is also known as <strong>Tongue-toaster</strong>.</p><p>This fruit is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in short-grass plains, and is best known in south-eastern Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains of medium difficulty to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is used by direct application.</p><p>The fresh pulp stops bleeding immediately and restores 1–10 concussion hits. The fruit must be used soon after picking.</p>","addictionFactor":0,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"uj5HHstal6feBCZr"}
{"name":"Fishfeather (Seaplume)","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-fishfeather-seaplume","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"t-F-4-U","sourceCost":"3gp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Récupération"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"t","localeCode":"F","regionCode":"U","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Fishfeather (Seaplume)","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-fishfeather-seaplume","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Plume-de-Poisson (Fishfeather / Plume-de-Mer / Seaplume)","system":{"notes":"<p>On la rencontre aussi sous le nom de <strong>Plume-de-Mer (Seaplume)</strong>.</p><p>Cette feuille se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré frais, notamment dans les berges et rivages d’eau douce, et elle est surtout connue dans l’ensemble d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste de difficulté moyenne à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle se consomme directement.</p><p>Une feuille rend 1 à 4 points de vie et conserve ses vertus un mois si elle reste humide.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Fishfeather (Seaplume)","system":{"notes":"<p>It is also known as <strong>Seaplume</strong>.</p><p>This leaf is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in freshwater banks and shores, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains of medium difficulty to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>One leaf restores 1–4 concussion hits and retains its potency for one month if kept moist.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"F","findDifficulty":"Medium","form":"Leaf","prep":"ingest","season":"","cost":"3gp","notes":"<p>It is also known as <strong>Seaplume</strong>.</p><p>This leaf is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in freshwater banks and shores, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains of medium difficulty to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>One leaf restores 1–4 concussion hits and retains its potency for one month if kept moist.</p>","addictionFactor":3,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"btyWD2Pw8evykGwH"}
{"name":"Flameroot","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-flameroot","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"t-U-4-U","sourceCost":"26gp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Récupération"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"t","localeCode":"U","regionCode":"U","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Flameroot","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-flameroot","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Racine-de-Flamme (Flameroot)","system":{"notes":"<p>Ce champignon se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré frais, notamment dans les milieux souterrains, et elle est surtout connue dans l’ensemble d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste de difficulté moyenne à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle doit être préparée en infusion ou décoction.</p><p>La décoction double la vitesse naturelle de récupération des points de vie.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Flameroot","system":{"notes":"<p>This fungus is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in underground environments, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains of medium difficulty to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it must be prepared as an infusion or decoction.</p><p>The decoction doubles the natural recovery rate of concussion hits.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"U","findDifficulty":"Medium","form":"Fungus","prep":"brew","season":"","cost":"26gp","notes":"<p>This fungus is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in underground environments, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains of medium difficulty to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it must be prepared as an infusion or decoction.</p><p>The decoction doubles the natural recovery rate of concussion hits.</p>","addictionFactor":4,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"VIbQAFTZzOlUzRW7"}
{"name":"Flúr Rort","type":"herb","img":"icons/commodities/flowers/flower-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-flur-rort","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"c-H-6-NW","sourceCost":"21gp","sourceCategory":"Remèdes & Antidotes","utilityGroups":["Remèdes & Antidotes"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"c","localeCode":"H","regionCode":"NW","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Flúr Rort","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-flur-rort","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"remedes-antidotes","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Flúr Rort","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette fleur se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat froid, notamment dans les landes, broussailles et bruyères, et elle est surtout connue dans le Nord-Ouest d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste très difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle est préparée sous forme liquide.</p><p>Antidote de niveau 12 contre les poisons nerveux.</p><p>Un usage répété peut créer une accoutumance.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Flúr Rort","system":{"notes":"<p>This flower is found chiefly in cold climates, especially in heaths, scrublands, and moors, and is best known in north-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains very hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is prepared in liquid form.</p><p>Level 12 antidote for nerve poisons.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Remèdes & Antidotes"],"en":["Remedies & Antidotes"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["remedes-antidotes"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"H","findDifficulty":"Very Hard","form":"Flower","prep":"liquid","season":"","cost":"21gp","notes":"<p>This flower is found chiefly in cold climates, especially in heaths, scrublands, and moors, and is best known in north-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains very hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is prepared in liquid form.</p><p>Level 12 antidote for nerve poisons.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>","addictionFactor":8,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"cxqbzYEzn06mRN8b"}
{"name":"Foxrose (Redthorn)","type":"herb","img":"icons/commodities/flowers/flower-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-foxrose-redthorn","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"m-F-6-W","sourceCost":"5gp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Récupération"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"m","localeCode":"F","regionCode":"W","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Foxrose (Redthorn)","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-foxrose-redthorn","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Rose-de-Renard (Foxrose / Épine Rouge / Redthorn)","system":{"notes":"<p>On la rencontre aussi sous le nom de <strong>Épine Rouge (Redthorn)</strong>.</p><p>Ce pétale se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré doux, notamment dans les berges et rivages d’eau douce, et elle est surtout connue dans l’Ouest d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste très difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle se consomme directement.</p><p>Les pétales rendent 2 à 12 points de vie.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Foxrose (Redthorn)","system":{"notes":"<p>It is also known as <strong>Redthorn</strong>.</p><p>This petal is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in freshwater banks and shores, and is best known in western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains very hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>The petals restore 2–12 concussion hits.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"F","findDifficulty":"Very Hard","form":"Petal","prep":"ingest","season":"","cost":"5gp","notes":"<p>It is also known as <strong>Redthorn</strong>.</p><p>This petal is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in freshwater banks and shores, and is best known in western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains very hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>The petals restore 2–12 concussion hits.</p>","addictionFactor":2,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"TCFNGi3QgjOG91rr"}
{"name":"Furry Oak Acorn","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/nuts/chestnut-roasted-brown-white.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-furry-oak-acorn","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"m-D-5-NW","sourceCost":"5bp/lb","sourceCategory":"Nourriture","utilityGroups":["Nourriture"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"m","localeCode":"D","regionCode":"NW","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Furry Oak Acorn","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-furry-oak-acorn","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"nourriture","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Gland de Chêne Velu (Furry Oak Acorn)","system":{"notes":"<p>Ce gland se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré doux, notamment dans les forêts de feuillus ou mixtes, et elle est surtout connue dans le Nord-Ouest d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle se consomme directement.</p><p>Les glands du chêne velu constituent une nourriture simple mais nourrissante.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Furry Oak Acorn","system":{"notes":"<p>This acorn is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in deciduous or mixed forests, and is best known in north-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>The acorns of the Furry Oak are simple but nourishing food.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Nourriture"],"en":["Food"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["nourriture"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"D","findDifficulty":"Hard","form":"Acorn","prep":"ingest","season":"","cost":"5bp/lb","notes":"<p>This acorn is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in deciduous or mixed forests, and is best known in north-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>The acorns of the Furry Oak are simple but nourishing food.</p>","addictionFactor":0,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"dana6GgcQaQYFbO6"}
{"name":"Galenaana","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-galenaana","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"c-A-6","sourceCost":"179gp","sourceCategory":"Poisons","utilityGroups":["Poisons","Respiratoire"],"poisonType":"Respiratoire","climateCode":"c","localeCode":"A","regionCode":null,"sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Galenaana","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-galenaana","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"poison-respiratoires","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Galenaana","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette feuille se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat froid, notamment dans les hautes zones alpines.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste très difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle est réduite en poudre.</p><p>Poison respiratoire de niveau 9D sous forme de poudre verte. Les effets peuvent être sévères ; les Elfes restent exposés aux formes les plus extrêmes.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Galenaana","system":{"notes":"<p>This leaf is found chiefly in cold climates, especially in high alpine zones.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains very hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is ground into powder.</p><p>Level 9D respiratory poison in the form of a green powder. Its effects can be severe; Elves remain vulnerable to the most extreme effects.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Respiratoires"],"en":["Respiratory"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["poison-respiratoires"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"A","findDifficulty":"Very Hard","form":"Leaf","prep":"powder","season":"","cost":"179gp","notes":"<p>This leaf is found chiefly in cold climates, especially in high alpine zones.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains very hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is ground into powder.</p><p>Level 9D respiratory poison in the form of a green powder. Its effects can be severe; Elves remain vulnerable to the most extreme effects.</p>","addictionFactor":0,"effects":[],"table":"","level":9},"_id":"U5x9nTQBAvYcEjrq"}
{"name":"Garíg (Tookash, Garack)","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-garig-tookash-garack","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"a-Z-3-U","sourceCost":"55gp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Récupération"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"a","localeCode":"Z","regionCode":"U","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Garíg (Tookash, Garack)","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-garig-tookash-garack","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Garíg (Tookash, Garack)","system":{"notes":"<p>Ce cactus se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat aride, notamment dans les déserts, et elle est surtout connue dans l’ensemble d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste assez aisée à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle se consomme directement.</p><p>Un morceau gros comme un pouce rend environ 30 points de vie. Fraîche, la plante dégage une odeur si infecte qu’on la consomme rarement de bon gré ; elle est aussi nommée Sheloboon.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Garíg (Tookash, Garack)","system":{"notes":"<p>This cactus is found chiefly in arid climates, especially in deserts, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains fairly easy to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>A thumb-sized piece restores about 30 concussion hits. Fresh, the plant gives off such a foul smell that it is rarely eaten willingly; it is also called Sheloboon.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"Z","findDifficulty":"Light","form":"Cactus","prep":"ingest","season":"","cost":"55gp","notes":"<p>This cactus is found chiefly in arid climates, especially in deserts, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains fairly easy to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>A thumb-sized piece restores about 30 concussion hits. Fresh, the plant gives off such a foul smell that it is rarely eaten willingly; it is also called Sheloboon.</p>","addictionFactor":3,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"07HjiANvZpHnr8Id"}
{"name":"Gefnul (Earthash)","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-gefnul-earthash","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"e-V-5-N","sourceCost":"90gp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Récupération"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"e","localeCode":"V","regionCode":"N","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Gefnul (Earthash)","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-gefnul-earthash","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Gefnul (Cendre-de-Terre / Earthash)","system":{"notes":"<p>On la rencontre aussi sous le nom de <strong>Frêne-de-Terre (Earthash)</strong>.</p><p>Ce lichen se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat de froid éternel, notamment dans les terrains volcaniques, et elle est surtout connue dans le Nord d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle se consomme directement.</p><p>Une plaque de lichen grande comme une main rend jusqu’à 90 points de vie sur vingt-quatre heures. Elle se conserve un mois après récolte.</p><p>Un usage répété peut créer une accoutumance.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Gefnul (Earthash)","system":{"notes":"<p>It is also known as <strong>Earthash</strong>.</p><p>This lichen is found chiefly in permanently frozen climates, especially in volcanic terrain, and is best known in northern Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>A hand-sized patch of lichen restores up to 90 concussion hits over twenty-four hours. It keeps for one month after gathering.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"V","findDifficulty":"Hard","form":"Lichen","prep":"ingest","season":"","cost":"90gp","notes":"<p>It is also known as <strong>Earthash</strong>.</p><p>This lichen is found chiefly in permanently frozen climates, especially in volcanic terrain, and is best known in northern Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>A hand-sized patch of lichen restores up to 90 concussion hits over twenty-four hours. It keeps for one month after gathering.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>","addictionFactor":10,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"psfpw4qWpsaOCKfD"}
{"name":"Golden Cress (Gold Chute)","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-golden-cress-gold-chute","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"m-F-4-W","sourceCost":"9sp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Hémorragies & circulation"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"m","localeCode":"F","regionCode":"W","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Golden Cress (Gold Chute)","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-golden-cress-gold-chute","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Cresson Doré (Golden Cress / Chute-d’Or / Gold Chute)","system":{"notes":"<p>On la rencontre aussi sous le nom de <strong>Chute d’Or (Gold Chute)</strong>.</p><p>Cette herbe se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré doux, notamment dans les berges et rivages d’eau douce, et elle est surtout connue dans l’Ouest d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste de difficulté moyenne à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle s’emploie par application directe.</p><p>Séchée, moulue puis mêlée à du suif, cette plante forme un onguent qui referme les plaies sanglantes et rend 1 à 5 points de vie en quelques rounds.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Golden Cress (Gold Chute)","system":{"notes":"<p>It is also known as <strong>Gold Chute</strong>.</p><p>This herb is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in freshwater banks and shores, and is best known in western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains of medium difficulty to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is used by direct application.</p><p>Dried, ground, and mixed with tallow, this plant forms an ointment that closes bleeding wounds and restores 1–5 concussion hits within a few rounds.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"F","findDifficulty":"Medium","form":"Herb","prep":"apply","season":"","cost":"9sp","notes":"<p>It is also known as <strong>Gold Chute</strong>.</p><p>This herb is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in freshwater banks and shores, and is best known in western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains of medium difficulty to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is used by direct application.</p><p>Dried, ground, and mixed with tallow, this plant forms an ointment that closes bleeding wounds and restores 1–5 concussion hits within a few rounds.</p>","addictionFactor":0,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"V7JxdYYGGB3S8Sdg"}
{"name":"Gorfang","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-gorfang","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"t-U-8-NW","sourceCost":"210gp","sourceCategory":"Poisons","utilityGroups":["Poisons","Nerveux"],"poisonType":"Nerveux","climateCode":"t","localeCode":"U","regionCode":"NW","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Gorfang","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-gorfang","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"poison-nerveux","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Gorfang","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette mousse se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré frais, notamment dans les milieux souterrains, et elle est surtout connue dans le Nord-Ouest d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste presque introuvable.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle est préparée sous forme liquide.</p><p>Poison nerveux de niveau 3. Il peut supprimer sensation et motricité dans plusieurs extrémités ; un échec grave dissout les nerfs et entraîne la mort.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Gorfang","system":{"notes":"<p>This moss is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in underground environments, and is best known in north-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains almost impossible to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is prepared in liquid form.</p><p>Level 3 nerve poison. It can remove sensation and motor control from several extremities; a severe failure dissolves the nerves and causes death.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Nerveux"],"en":["Nerve"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["poison-nerveux"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"U","findDifficulty":"Sheer Folly","form":"Moss","prep":"liquid","season":"","cost":"210gp","notes":"<p>This moss is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in underground environments, and is best known in north-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains almost impossible to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is prepared in liquid form.</p><p>Level 3 nerve poison. It can remove sensation and motor control from several extremities; a severe failure dissolves the nerves and causes death.</p>","addictionFactor":1,"effects":[],"table":"","level":3},"_id":"s74W2H0rFZk5h5Rj"}
{"name":"Gort","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-gort","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"h-J-4-U","sourceCost":"10gp","sourceCategory":"Intoxicants","utilityGroups":["Intoxicants"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"h","localeCode":"J","regionCode":"U","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Gort","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-gort","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"intoxicants","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Gort","system":{"notes":"<p>Ces feuilles se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat chaud et humide, notamment dans les jungles et forêts pluviales, et elle est surtout connue dans l’ensemble d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste de difficulté moyenne à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle est inhalée sous forme de poudre ou de vapeur.</p><p>Les feuilles inhalées produisent un mélange d’euphorie, de stimulation et d’hallucinations. La substance est recherchée comme drogue et présente un risque d’accoutumance important.</p><p>Des prises répétées peuvent entraîner une dépendance notable.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Gort","system":{"notes":"<p>This leaves is found chiefly in hot and humid climates, especially in jungles and rainforests, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains of medium difficulty to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is inhaled.</p><p>Inhaled leaves produce a mixture of euphoria, stimulation, and hallucinations. The substance is sought after as a drug and carries a significant risk of addiction.</p><p>Repeated doses can lead to significant dependence.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Intoxicants"],"en":["Intoxicants"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["intoxicants"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"J","findDifficulty":"Medium","form":"Leaves","prep":"inhale","season":"","cost":"10gp","notes":"<p>This leaves is found chiefly in hot and humid climates, especially in jungles and rainforests, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains of medium difficulty to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is inhaled.</p><p>Inhaled leaves produce a mixture of euphoria, stimulation, and hallucinations. The substance is sought after as a drug and carries a significant risk of addiction.</p><p>Repeated doses can lead to significant dependence.</p>","addictionFactor":20,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"bEO1WUbIMJK8QoE3"}
{"name":"Grapeleaf Magnolia","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-grapeleaf-magnolia","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"m-D-3-NW","sourceCost":"7gp","sourceCategory":"Renforts & Altérations","utilityGroups":["Renforts & Altérations"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"m","localeCode":"D","regionCode":"NW","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Grapeleaf Magnolia","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-grapeleaf-magnolia","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"renforts-alterations","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Magnolia à Feuilles de Vigne (Grapeleaf Magnolia)","system":{"notes":"<p>Ce nectar se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré doux, notamment dans les forêts de feuillus ou mixtes, et elle est surtout connue dans le Nord-Ouest d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste assez aisée à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle se consomme directement.</p><p>Le nectar plonge l’utilisateur dans une ivresse onirique pendant environ deux heures, avec de fortes pénalités à l’action, tout en fournissant l’équivalent d’une journée de nourriture.</p><p>Des prises répétées peuvent entraîner une dépendance notable.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Grapeleaf Magnolia","system":{"notes":"<p>This nectar is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in deciduous or mixed forests, and is best known in north-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains fairly easy to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>The nectar plunges the user into a dreamlike intoxication for about two hours, imposing severe action penalties while also providing the equivalent of one day’s food.</p><p>Repeated doses can lead to significant dependence.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Renforts & Altérations"],"en":["Enhancements & Alterations"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["renforts-alterations"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"D","findDifficulty":"Light","form":"Nectar","prep":"ingest","season":"","cost":"7gp","notes":"<p>This nectar is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in deciduous or mixed forests, and is best known in north-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains fairly easy to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>The nectar plunges the user into a dreamlike intoxication for about two hours, imposing severe action penalties while also providing the equivalent of one day’s food.</p><p>Repeated doses can lead to significant dependence.</p>","addictionFactor":18,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"EC4o3J35H8vo5BDU"}
{"name":"Gulfbrake","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-gulfbrake","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"m-O-7-U","sourceCost":"20gp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Os & fractures"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"m","localeCode":"O","regionCode":"U","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Gulfbrake","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-gulfbrake","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Gulfbrake","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette algue se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré doux, notamment dans les côtes marines et rivages salés, et elle est surtout connue dans l’ensemble d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste extrêmement difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle s’emploie par application directe.</p><p>Cette algue marine est chauffée dans une eau brûlante mais non bouillante puis enroulée autour de la fracture comme un plâtre. Elle multiplie par cinq la vitesse de consolidation et peut être séchée pour un stockage prolongé.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Gulfbrake","system":{"notes":"<p>This algae is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in sea coasts and saltwater shores, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains extremely hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is used by direct application.</p><p>This seaweed is heated in scalding but not boiling water and then wrapped around the fracture like a cast. It increases the rate of knitting fivefold and can be dried for long-term storage.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"O","findDifficulty":"Extremely Hard","form":"Algae","prep":"apply","season":"","cost":"20gp","notes":"<p>This algae is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in sea coasts and saltwater shores, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains extremely hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is used by direct application.</p><p>This seaweed is heated in scalding but not boiling water and then wrapped around the fracture like a cast. It increases the rate of knitting fivefold and can be dried for long-term storage.</p>","addictionFactor":0,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"IHmaBRtocMC8maIU"}
{"name":"Gwinwin Rynd","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-gwinwin-rynd","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"t-U-8-NW","sourceCost":"84gp","sourceCategory":"Poisons","utilityGroups":["Poisons","Nerveux"],"poisonType":"Nerveux","climateCode":"t","localeCode":"U","regionCode":"NW","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Gwinwin Rynd","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-gwinwin-rynd","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"poison-nerveux","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Gwinwin Rynd","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette chauve-souris se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré frais, notamment dans les milieux souterrains, et elle est surtout connue dans le Nord-Ouest d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste presque introuvable.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle est préparée sous forme liquide.</p><p>Poison nerveux de niveau 2 tiré de la sécrétion linguale d’une chauve-souris. Au contact, il paralyse la zone touchée ; ingéré, il peut provoquer une paralysie totale prolongée ou la mort immédiate.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Gwinwin Rynd","system":{"notes":"<p>This bat is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in underground environments, and is best known in north-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains almost impossible to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is prepared in liquid form.</p><p>Level 2 nerve poison derived from the tongue secretion of a bat. On contact it paralyzes the affected area; ingested, it can cause prolonged total paralysis or immediate death.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Nerveux"],"en":["Nerve"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["poison-nerveux"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"U","findDifficulty":"Sheer Folly","form":"Bat","prep":"liquid","season":"","cost":"84gp","notes":"<p>This bat is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in underground environments, and is best known in north-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains almost impossible to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is prepared in liquid form.</p><p>Level 2 nerve poison derived from the tongue secretion of a bat. On contact it paralyzes the affected area; ingested, it can cause prolonged total paralysis or immediate death.</p>","addictionFactor":0,"effects":[],"table":"","level":2},"_id":"ZQbAu0F33PagZhNb"}
{"name":"Gylvir","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-gylvir","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"m-O-6-U","sourceCost":"45gp","sourceCategory":"Renforts & Altérations","utilityGroups":["Renforts & Altérations"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"m","localeCode":"O","regionCode":"U","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Gylvir","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-gylvir","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"renforts-alterations","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Gylvir","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette algue se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré doux, notamment dans les côtes marines et rivages salés, et elle est surtout connue dans l’ensemble d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste très difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle se consomme directement.</p><p>L’algue permet de respirer sous l’eau — et uniquement sous l’eau — pendant environ quatre heures.</p><p>Des prises répétées peuvent entraîner une dépendance notable.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Gylvir","system":{"notes":"<p>This algae is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in sea coasts and saltwater shores, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains very hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>The algae allows the user to breathe underwater—and only underwater—for about four hours.</p><p>Repeated doses can lead to significant dependence.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Renforts & Altérations"],"en":["Enhancements & Alterations"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["renforts-alterations"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"O","findDifficulty":"Very Hard","form":"Algae","prep":"ingest","season":"","cost":"45gp","notes":"<p>This algae is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in sea coasts and saltwater shores, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains very hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>The algae allows the user to breathe underwater—and only underwater—for about four hours.</p><p>Repeated doses can lead to significant dependence.</p>","addictionFactor":20,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"ZpXibDMPdhqKR4ew"}
{"name":"Hart’s Glory (Harp-bloom)","type":"herb","img":"icons/commodities/flowers/flower-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-harts-glory-harp-bloom","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"m-S-4-SE","sourceCost":"4gp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Récupération"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"m","localeCode":"S","regionCode":"SE","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Hart’s Glory (Harp-bloom)","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-harts-glory-harp-bloom","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Gloire-du-Cerf (Hart’s Glory / Harp-bloom)","system":{"notes":"<p>On la rencontre aussi sous le nom de <strong>Fleur-de-Harpe (Harp-bloom)</strong>.</p><p>Ce pétale se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré doux, notamment dans les prairies rases, et elle est surtout connue dans le Sud-Est d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste de difficulté moyenne à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle se consomme directement.</p><p>Les pétales rendent 2 à 8 points de vie. Gardés humides, ils restent actifs deux semaines ; séchés, ils ne rendent plus que 1 à 2 points.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Hart’s Glory (Harp-bloom)","system":{"notes":"<p>It is also known as <strong>Harp-bloom</strong>.</p><p>This petal is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in short-grass plains, and is best known in south-eastern Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains of medium difficulty to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>The petals restore 2–8 concussion hits. Kept moist, they remain potent for two weeks; dried, they restore only 1–2.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"S","findDifficulty":"Medium","form":"Petal","prep":"ingest","season":"","cost":"4gp","notes":"<p>It is also known as <strong>Harp-bloom</strong>.</p><p>This petal is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in short-grass plains, and is best known in south-eastern Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains of medium difficulty to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>The petals restore 2–8 concussion hits. Kept moist, they remain potent for two weeks; dried, they restore only 1–2.</p>","addictionFactor":1,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"WiyWMN6nhYzRnwHK"}
{"name":"Harwite (Chelas)","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-harwite-chelas","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"m-D-2-W","sourceCost":"1sp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Récupération"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"m","localeCode":"D","regionCode":"W","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Harwite (Chelas)","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-harwite-chelas","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Harwite (Chelas)","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette mousse se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré doux, notamment dans les forêts de feuillus ou mixtes, et elle est surtout connue dans l’Ouest d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste facile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle se consomme directement.</p><p>Cette mousse, connue surtout dans la forêt de Fangorn, rend 10 à 50 points de vie.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Harwite (Chelas)","system":{"notes":"<p>This moss is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in deciduous or mixed forests, and is best known in western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains easy to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>This moss, best known in Fangorn Forest, restores 10–50 concussion hits.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"D","findDifficulty":"Easy","form":"Moss","prep":"ingest","season":"","cost":"1sp","notes":"<p>This moss is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in deciduous or mixed forests, and is best known in western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains easy to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>This moss, best known in Fangorn Forest, restores 10–50 concussion hits.</p>","addictionFactor":0,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"QC7maN9srDMcvpyJ"}
{"name":"Hiam Moss","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-hiam-moss","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"c-C-6-NW","sourceCost":"9gp","sourceCategory":"Renforts & Altérations","utilityGroups":["Renforts & Altérations"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"c","localeCode":"C","regionCode":"NW","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Hiam Moss","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-hiam-moss","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"renforts-alterations","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Mousse de Hiam (Hiam Moss)","system":{"notes":"<p>Ce champignon se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat froid, notamment dans les forêts de conifères, et elle est surtout connue dans le Nord-Ouest d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste très difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle doit être préparée en infusion ou décoction.</p><p>La préparation maintient éveillé et soutenu pendant vingt-quatre heures. Au-delà de quatre jours consécutifs, l’épuisement exige une longue récupération ; la première prise comporte également un faible risque mortel.</p><p>Un usage répété peut créer une accoutumance.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Hiam Moss","system":{"notes":"<p>This fungus is found chiefly in cold climates, especially in coniferous forests, and is best known in north-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains very hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it must be prepared as an infusion or decoction.</p><p>The preparation keeps the user awake and sustained for twenty-four hours. After more than four consecutive days, exhaustion requires a long recovery; the first dose also carries a small risk of death.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Renforts & Altérations"],"en":["Enhancements & Alterations"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["renforts-alterations"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"C","findDifficulty":"Very Hard","form":"Fungus","prep":"brew","season":"","cost":"9gp","notes":"<p>This fungus is found chiefly in cold climates, especially in coniferous forests, and is best known in north-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains very hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it must be prepared as an infusion or decoction.</p><p>The preparation keeps the user awake and sustained for twenty-four hours. After more than four consecutive days, exhaustion requires a long recovery; the first dose also carries a small risk of death.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>","addictionFactor":8,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"TohjUOrf3ozNMTpD"}
{"name":"Hopperfoot","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-hopperfoot","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"h-J-5-S","sourceCost":"45gp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Récupération"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"h","localeCode":"J","regionCode":"S","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Hopperfoot","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-hopperfoot","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Pied-Sauteur (Hopperfoot)","system":{"notes":"<p>Ce champignon se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat chaud et humide, notamment dans les jungles et forêts pluviales, et elle est surtout connue dans le Sud d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle se consomme directement.</p><p>Le champignon plonge son consommateur dans un profond sommeil de huit heures et lui rend 2 à 20 points de vie. Le sommeil s’accompagne souvent de flatulences incontrôlables.</p><p>Un usage répété peut créer une accoutumance.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Hopperfoot","system":{"notes":"<p>This mushroom is found chiefly in hot and humid climates, especially in jungles and rainforests, and is best known in southern Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>The mushroom puts its consumer into a deep eight-hour sleep and restores 2–20 concussion hits. The sleep is often accompanied by uncontrollable flatulence.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"J","findDifficulty":"Hard","form":"Mushroom","prep":"ingest","season":"","cost":"45gp","notes":"<p>This mushroom is found chiefly in hot and humid climates, especially in jungles and rainforests, and is best known in southern Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>The mushroom puts its consumer into a deep eight-hour sleep and restores 2–20 concussion hits. The sleep is often accompanied by uncontrollable flatulence.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>","addictionFactor":6,"effects":[{"effect":"heal-hits","formula":"2d10"}],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"1sd1BiMHw0CtF2oq"}
{"name":"Iauthalion (Yavis, Jargon)","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/fruit/berry-leaf-pink.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-iauthalion-yavis-jargon","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"m-O-5-W","sourceCost":"45gp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Récupération"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"m","localeCode":"O","regionCode":"W","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Iauthalion (Yavis, Jargon)","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-iauthalion-yavis-jargon","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Iauthalion (Yavis, Jargon)","system":{"notes":"<p>Ce fruit se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré doux, notamment dans les côtes marines et rivages salés, et elle est surtout connue dans l’Ouest d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle se consomme directement.</p><p>Le fruit rend immédiatement 5 à 50 points de vie. Il est également connu sous le nom de Yavethalion.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Iauthalion (Yavis, Jargon)","system":{"notes":"<p>This fruit is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in sea coasts and saltwater shores, and is best known in western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>The fruit immediately restores 5–50 concussion hits. It is also known as Yavethalion.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"O","findDifficulty":"Hard","form":"Fruit","prep":"ingest","season":"","cost":"45gp","notes":"<p>This fruit is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in sea coasts and saltwater shores, and is best known in western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>The fruit immediately restores 5–50 concussion hits. It is also known as Yavethalion.</p>","addictionFactor":4,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"FZNCouAQjas6eFIK"}
{"name":"Ironbine","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-ironbine","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"m-O-3-S","sourceCost":"3gp","sourceCategory":"Remèdes & Antidotes","utilityGroups":["Remèdes & Antidotes","Soins","Récupération"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"m","localeCode":"O","regionCode":"S","sourceVariants":[{"group":"Soins","code":"m-O-3-S","form":"Flower","prep":"ingest","cost":"3gp","af":5,"effect":"La fleur rend immédiatement 2 à 10 points de vie et se conserve environ une semaine après la cueillette."}],"sourceName":"Ironbine","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-ironbine","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"remedes-antidotes","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Liane de Fer (Ironbine)","system":{"notes":"<p>Ce bulbe se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré doux, notamment dans les côtes marines et rivages salés, et elle est surtout connue dans le Sud d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste assez aisée à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle est réduite en poudre.</p><p>Antidote de niveau 12 contre l’Acána. Sa poudre se conserve pendant des années ; la plante est aussi connue sous les noms de Deathsaver et Lifeblossom. La fleur rend immédiatement 2 à 10 points de vie et se conserve environ une semaine après la cueillette.</p><p>Un usage répété peut créer une accoutumance.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Ironbine","system":{"notes":"<p>This bulb is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in sea coasts and saltwater shores, and is best known in southern Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains fairly easy to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is ground into powder.</p><p>Level 12 antidote to Acána. Its powder keeps for years; the plant is also known as Deathsaver and Lifeblossom. The flower immediately restores 2–10 concussion hits and keeps for about one week after picking.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Remèdes & Antidotes"],"en":["Remedies & Antidotes"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["remedes-antidotes"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"O","findDifficulty":"Light","form":"Bulb","prep":"powder","season":"","cost":"3gp","notes":"<p>This bulb is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in sea coasts and saltwater shores, and is best known in southern Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains fairly easy to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is ground into powder.</p><p>Level 12 antidote to Acána. Its powder keeps for years; the plant is also known as Deathsaver and Lifeblossom. The flower immediately restores 2–10 concussion hits and keeps for about one week after picking.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>","addictionFactor":5,"effects":[],"table":"","level":12},"_id":"yEjP3GUWxRZVL1Dp"}
{"name":"Jegga","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-jegga","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"m-U-5","sourceCost":"92gp","sourceCategory":"Poisons","utilityGroups":["Poisons","Respiratoire"],"poisonType":"Respiratoire","climateCode":"m","localeCode":"U","regionCode":null,"sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Jegga","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-jegga","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"poison-respiratoires","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Jegga","system":{"notes":"<p>Ces chauves-souris se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré doux, notamment dans les milieux souterrains.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle est préparée sous forme de pâte.</p><p>Poison respiratoire de niveau 7B, pâte brune infligeant 1 à 100 points de vie en plus de ses effets respiratoires.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Jegga","system":{"notes":"<p>This bats is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in underground environments.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is prepared as a paste.</p><p>Level 7B respiratory poison, a brown paste that inflicts 1–100 concussion hits in addition to its respiratory effects.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Respiratoires"],"en":["Respiratory"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["poison-respiratoires"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"U","findDifficulty":"Hard","form":"Bats","prep":"paste","season":"","cost":"92gp","notes":"<p>This bats is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in underground environments.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is prepared as a paste.</p><p>Level 7B respiratory poison, a brown paste that inflicts 1–100 concussion hits in addition to its respiratory effects.</p>","addictionFactor":0,"effects":[],"table":"","level":7},"_id":"w5OP4YZhW7I0f1bQ"}
{"name":"Jitsu","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-jitsu","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"m-O-4","sourceCost":"34gp","sourceCategory":"Poisons","utilityGroups":["Poisons","Respiratoire"],"poisonType":"Respiratoire","climateCode":"m","localeCode":"O","regionCode":null,"sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Jitsu","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-jitsu","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"poison-respiratoires","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Jitsu","system":{"notes":"<p>Ces palourdes se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré doux, notamment dans les côtes marines et rivages salés.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste de difficulté moyenne à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle est préparée sous forme liquide.</p><p>Poison respiratoire de niveau 5B. Ce venin jaune inflige 5 à 50 points de vie et provoque des effets respiratoires généralement légers.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Jitsu","system":{"notes":"<p>This clams is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in sea coasts and saltwater shores.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains of medium difficulty to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is prepared in liquid form.</p><p>Level 5B respiratory poison. This yellow venom inflicts 5–50 concussion hits and generally causes light respiratory effects.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Respiratoires"],"en":["Respiratory"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["poison-respiratoires"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"O","findDifficulty":"Medium","form":"Clams","prep":"liquid","season":"","cost":"34gp","notes":"<p>This clams is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in sea coasts and saltwater shores.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains of medium difficulty to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is prepared in liquid form.</p><p>Level 5B respiratory poison. This yellow venom inflicts 5–50 concussion hits and generally causes light respiratory effects.</p>","addictionFactor":0,"effects":[],"table":"","level":5},"_id":"5K7UAcyVw30RH9cb"}
{"name":"Jojojopo (Frostheal)","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-jojojopo-frostheal","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"f-G-6-U","sourceCost":"27gp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Brûlures & exposition"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"f","localeCode":"G","regionCode":"U","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Jojojopo (Frostheal)","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-jojojopo-frostheal","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Jojojopo (Guérit-Gel / Frostheal)","system":{"notes":"<p>On la rencontre aussi sous le nom de <strong>Guérit-Gel (Frostheal)</strong>.</p><p>Cette feuille se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat glacial, notamment dans les glaciers et champs de neige, et elle est surtout connue dans l’ensemble d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste très difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle s’emploie par application directe.</p><p>Cette feuille soigne les gelures et permet de récupérer 2 à 20 points de vie perdus à cause du froid.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Jojojopo (Frostheal)","system":{"notes":"<p>It is also known as <strong>Frostheal</strong>.</p><p>This leaf is found chiefly in frigid climates, especially in glaciers and snowfields, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains very hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is used by direct application.</p><p>This leaf heals frostbite and restores 2–20 concussion hits lost to cold.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"G","findDifficulty":"Very Hard","form":"Leaf","prep":"apply","season":"","cost":"27gp","notes":"<p>It is also known as <strong>Frostheal</strong>.</p><p>This leaf is found chiefly in frigid climates, especially in glaciers and snowfields, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains very hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is used by direct application.</p><p>This leaf heals frostbite and restores 2–20 concussion hits lost to cold.</p>","addictionFactor":0,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"9w33M6P1qHeh0XGt"}
{"name":"Juth (Juthjuth)","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-juth-juthjuth","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"a-Z-5-U","sourceCost":"56gp","sourceCategory":"Poisons","utilityGroups":["Poisons","Nerveux"],"poisonType":"Nerveux","climateCode":"a","localeCode":"Z","regionCode":"U","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Juth (Juthjuth)","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-juth-juthjuth","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"poison-nerveux","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Juth (Juthjuth)","system":{"notes":"<p>Ce scorpion se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat aride, notamment dans les déserts, et elle est surtout connue dans l’ensemble d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle est préparée sous forme liquide.</p><p>Poison nerveux de niveau 2B. Ses effets peuvent aller jusqu’à une folie sévère se déclarant dans les semaines suivantes.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Juth (Juthjuth)","system":{"notes":"<p>This scorpion is found chiefly in arid climates, especially in deserts, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is prepared in liquid form.</p><p>Level 2B nerve poison. Its effects can culminate in severe insanity emerging during the following weeks.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Nerveux"],"en":["Nerve"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["poison-nerveux"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"Z","findDifficulty":"Hard","form":"Scorpion","prep":"liquid","season":"","cost":"56gp","notes":"<p>This scorpion is found chiefly in arid climates, especially in deserts, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is prepared in liquid form.</p><p>Level 2B nerve poison. Its effects can culminate in severe insanity emerging during the following weeks.</p>","addictionFactor":0,"effects":[],"table":"","level":2},"_id":"tSgV4epTvJGe7ORR"}
{"name":"Kaktu","type":"herb","img":"icons/commodities/flowers/flower-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-kaktu","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"s-S-7-S","sourceCost":"27gp","sourceCategory":"Poisons","utilityGroups":["Poisons","Musculaire"],"poisonType":"Musculaire","climateCode":"s","localeCode":"S","regionCode":"S","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Kaktu","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-kaktu","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"poison-musculaires","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Kaktu","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette fleur se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat semi-aride, notamment dans les prairies rases, et elle est surtout connue dans le Sud d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste extrêmement difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle est préparée sous forme liquide.</p><p>Poison musculaire de niveau 1A. Il peut provoquer une perte sévère d’Agilité dans un à quatre membres.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Kaktu","system":{"notes":"<p>This flower is found chiefly in semi-arid climates, especially in short-grass plains, and is best known in southern Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains extremely hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is prepared in liquid form.</p><p>Level 1A muscle poison. It can cause severe Agility loss in one to four limbs.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Musculaires"],"en":["Muscle"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["poison-musculaires"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"S","findDifficulty":"Extremely Hard","form":"Flower","prep":"liquid","season":"","cost":"27gp","notes":"<p>This flower is found chiefly in semi-arid climates, especially in short-grass plains, and is best known in southern Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains extremely hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is prepared in liquid form.</p><p>Level 1A muscle poison. It can cause severe Agility loss in one to four limbs.</p>","addictionFactor":3,"effects":[],"table":"","level":1},"_id":"bpFsqlggTNXMLynB"}
{"name":"Karfar","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-karfar","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"h-J-4","sourceCost":"142gp","sourceCategory":"Poisons","utilityGroups":["Poisons","Circulatoire"],"poisonType":"Circulatoire","climateCode":"h","localeCode":"J","regionCode":null,"sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Karfar","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-karfar","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"poison-circulatoires","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Karfar","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette feuille se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat chaud et humide, notamment dans les jungles et forêts pluviales.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste de difficulté moyenne à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle est préparée sous forme de pâte.</p><p>Poison circulatoire de niveau 7C. Sa pâte rougeâtre dérègle le cœur et agit généralement en 2 à 12 rounds.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Karfar","system":{"notes":"<p>This leaf is found chiefly in hot and humid climates, especially in jungles and rainforests.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains of medium difficulty to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is prepared as a paste.</p><p>Level 7C circulatory poison. Its reddish paste causes the heart to malfunction and generally takes effect in 2–12 rounds.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Circulatoires"],"en":["Circulatory"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["poison-circulatoires"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"J","findDifficulty":"Medium","form":"Leaf","prep":"paste","season":"","cost":"142gp","notes":"<p>This leaf is found chiefly in hot and humid climates, especially in jungles and rainforests.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains of medium difficulty to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is prepared as a paste.</p><p>Level 7C circulatory poison. Its reddish paste causes the heart to malfunction and generally takes effect in 2–12 rounds.</p>","addictionFactor":0,"effects":[],"table":"","level":7},"_id":"FgJSd9zKx6eoZREH"}
{"name":"Kargîjak","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/fruit/berry-leaf-pink.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-kargijak","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"a-V-2-W","sourceCost":"8gp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Récupération"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"a","localeCode":"V","regionCode":"W","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Kargîjak","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-kargijak","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Kargîjak","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette baie se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat aride, notamment dans les terrains volcaniques, et elle est surtout connue dans l’Ouest d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste facile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle est préparée sous forme de pâte.</p><p>Cette baie de Mordor, préparée en pâte, rend 20 points de vie et double la vitesse de guérison. Elle brûle la peau, étourdit 1 à 10 rounds et laisse presque toujours une cicatrice.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Kargîjak","system":{"notes":"<p>This berry is found chiefly in arid climates, especially in volcanic terrain, and is best known in western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains easy to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is prepared as a paste.</p><p>This berry from Mordor, prepared as a paste, restores 20 concussion hits and doubles the healing rate. It burns the skin, causes 1–10 rounds of stun, and almost always leaves a scar.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"V","findDifficulty":"Easy","form":"Berry","prep":"paste","season":"","cost":"8gp","notes":"<p>This berry is found chiefly in arid climates, especially in volcanic terrain, and is best known in western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains easy to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is prepared as a paste.</p><p>This berry from Mordor, prepared as a paste, restores 20 concussion hits and doubles the healing rate. It burns the skin, causes 1–10 rounds of stun, and almost always leaves a scar.</p>","addictionFactor":1,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"DAvTX3hS3kazPF71"}
{"name":"Kastaba","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-kastaba","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"h-D-5-S","sourceCost":"27gp","sourceCategory":"Poisons","utilityGroups":["Poisons","Musculaire"],"poisonType":"Musculaire","climateCode":"h","localeCode":"D","regionCode":"S","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Kastaba","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-kastaba","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"poison-musculaires","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Kastaba","system":{"notes":"<p>Ce crapaud se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat chaud et humide, notamment dans les forêts de feuillus ou mixtes, et elle est surtout connue dans le Sud d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle est préparée sous forme de pâte.</p><p>Toxine musculaire : un échec léger au Jet de Résistance entraîne la cécité, un échec plus grave le coma accompagné de cécité, et un échec sévère la mort.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Kastaba","system":{"notes":"<p>This toad is found chiefly in hot and humid climates, especially in deciduous or mixed forests, and is best known in southern Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is prepared as a paste.</p><p>Muscle toxin: a light Resistance Roll failure causes blindness, a more serious failure causes coma with blindness, and a severe failure causes death.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Musculaires"],"en":["Muscle"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["poison-musculaires"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"D","findDifficulty":"Hard","form":"Toad","prep":"paste","season":"","cost":"27gp","notes":"<p>This toad is found chiefly in hot and humid climates, especially in deciduous or mixed forests, and is best known in southern Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is prepared as a paste.</p><p>Muscle toxin: a light Resistance Roll failure causes blindness, a more serious failure causes coma with blindness, and a severe failure causes death.</p>","addictionFactor":1,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"ZjxGsRJocTD8doB7"}
{"name":"Kathkusa","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-kathkusa","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"f-W-3-N","sourceCost":"50gp","sourceCategory":"Renforts & Altérations","utilityGroups":["Renforts & Altérations"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"f","localeCode":"W","regionCode":"N","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Kathkusa","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-kathkusa","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"renforts-alterations","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Kathkusa","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette feuille se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat glacial, notamment dans les terres désolées, et elle est surtout connue dans le Nord d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste assez aisée à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle se consomme directement.</p><p>La feuille augmente brièvement la Force d’environ +10 et double les dégâts de concussion infligés pendant 1 à 10 rounds.</p><p>Son usage présente un risque très élevé d’accoutumance et doit rester exceptionnel.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Kathkusa","system":{"notes":"<p>This leaf is found chiefly in frigid climates, especially in wastelands, and is best known in northern Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains fairly easy to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>The leaf briefly increases Strength by about +10 and doubles concussion damage inflicted for 1–10 rounds.</p><p>Its use carries a very high risk of addiction and should remain exceptional.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Renforts & Altérations"],"en":["Enhancements & Alterations"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["renforts-alterations"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"W","findDifficulty":"Light","form":"Leaf","prep":"ingest","season":"","cost":"50gp","notes":"<p>This leaf is found chiefly in frigid climates, especially in wastelands, and is best known in northern Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains fairly easy to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>The leaf briefly increases Strength by about +10 and doubles concussion damage inflicted for 1–10 rounds.</p><p>Its use carries a very high risk of addiction and should remain exceptional.</p>","addictionFactor":35,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"V5ChA3QfZk0vktnW"}
{"name":"Kilmakur","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/nuts/chestnut-roasted-brown-white.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-kilmakur","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"h-S-7-SE","sourceCost":"65gp","sourceCategory":"Renforts & Altérations","utilityGroups":["Renforts & Altérations"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"h","localeCode":"S","regionCode":"SE","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Kilmakur","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-kilmakur","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"renforts-alterations","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Kilmakur","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette racine se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat chaud et humide, notamment dans les prairies rases, et elle est surtout connue dans le Sud-Est d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste extrêmement difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle doit être préparée en infusion ou décoction.</p><p>La décoction protège contre les flammes et la chaleur naturelles pendant 1 à 10 heures.</p><p>Son usage présente un risque très élevé d’accoutumance et doit rester exceptionnel.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Kilmakur","system":{"notes":"<p>This root is found chiefly in hot and humid climates, especially in short-grass plains, and is best known in south-eastern Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains extremely hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it must be prepared as an infusion or decoction.</p><p>The decoction protects against natural flame and heat for 1–10 hours.</p><p>Its use carries a very high risk of addiction and should remain exceptional.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Renforts & Altérations"],"en":["Enhancements & Alterations"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["renforts-alterations"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"S","findDifficulty":"Extremely Hard","form":"Root","prep":"brew","season":"","cost":"65gp","notes":"<p>This root is found chiefly in hot and humid climates, especially in short-grass plains, and is best known in south-eastern Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains extremely hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it must be prepared as an infusion or decoction.</p><p>The decoction protects against natural flame and heat for 1–10 hours.</p><p>Its use carries a very high risk of addiction and should remain exceptional.</p>","addictionFactor":33,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"VLmuac50WuffC3xc"}
{"name":"Klagul","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-klagul","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"s-S-3-U","sourceCost":"27gp","sourceCategory":"Renforts & Altérations","utilityGroups":["Renforts & Altérations"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"s","localeCode":"S","regionCode":"U","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Klagul","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-klagul","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"renforts-alterations","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Klagul","system":{"notes":"<p>Ce bourgeon se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat semi-aride, notamment dans les prairies rases, et elle est surtout connue dans l’ensemble d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste assez aisée à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle doit être préparée en infusion ou décoction.</p><p>La décoction donne une vision nocturne efficace jusqu’à environ cent pieds pendant six heures.</p><p>Un usage répété peut créer une accoutumance.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Klagul","system":{"notes":"<p>This bud is found chiefly in semi-arid climates, especially in short-grass plains, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains fairly easy to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it must be prepared as an infusion or decoction.</p><p>The decoction grants effective night vision to about one hundred feet for six hours.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Renforts & Altérations"],"en":["Enhancements & Alterations"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["renforts-alterations"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"S","findDifficulty":"Light","form":"Bud","prep":"brew","season":"","cost":"27gp","notes":"<p>This bud is found chiefly in semi-arid climates, especially in short-grass plains, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains fairly easy to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it must be prepared as an infusion or decoction.</p><p>The decoction grants effective night vision to about one hundred feet for six hours.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>","addictionFactor":7,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"0p5M3iVUnnytEDMg"}
{"name":"Kly","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/fruit/berry-leaf-pink.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-kly","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"s-H-5","sourceCost":"154gp","sourceCategory":"Poisons","utilityGroups":["Poisons","Respiratoire"],"poisonType":"Respiratoire","climateCode":"s","localeCode":"H","regionCode":null,"sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Kly","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-kly","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"poison-respiratoires","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Kly","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette baie se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat semi-aride, notamment dans les landes, broussailles et bruyères.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle est préparée sous forme de pâte.</p><p>Poison respiratoire de niveau 3F. Le jus brun peut infliger 3 à 300 points de vie, même si ses effets respiratoires généraux restent souvent limités.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Kly","system":{"notes":"<p>This berry is found chiefly in semi-arid climates, especially in heaths, scrublands, and moors.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is prepared as a paste.</p><p>Level 3F respiratory poison. The brown juice can inflict 3–300 concussion hits, although its general respiratory effects are often limited.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Respiratoires"],"en":["Respiratory"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["poison-respiratoires"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"H","findDifficulty":"Hard","form":"Berry","prep":"paste","season":"","cost":"154gp","notes":"<p>This berry is found chiefly in semi-arid climates, especially in heaths, scrublands, and moors.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is prepared as a paste.</p><p>Level 3F respiratory poison. The brown juice can inflict 3–300 concussion hits, although its general respiratory effects are often limited.</p>","addictionFactor":0,"effects":[],"table":"","level":3},"_id":"BultfbIXAk2PLsnE"}
{"name":"Klytun","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/nuts/chestnut-roasted-brown-white.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-klytun","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"s-B-4","sourceCost":"53gp","sourceCategory":"Poisons","utilityGroups":["Poisons","Circulatoire"],"poisonType":"Circulatoire","climateCode":"s","localeCode":"B","regionCode":null,"sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Klytun","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-klytun","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"poison-circulatoires","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Klytun","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette racine se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat semi-aride, notamment dans les ravins et oueds.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste de difficulté moyenne à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle est préparée sous forme de pâte.</p><p>Poison circulatoire de niveau 5A. Sa pâte dorée peut plonger la victime dans le coma pendant 1 à 10 jours.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Klytun","system":{"notes":"<p>This root is found chiefly in semi-arid climates, especially in ravines and wadis.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains of medium difficulty to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is prepared as a paste.</p><p>Level 5A circulatory poison. Its golden paste can place the victim in a coma for 1–10 days.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Circulatoires"],"en":["Circulatory"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["poison-circulatoires"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"B","findDifficulty":"Medium","form":"Root","prep":"paste","season":"","cost":"53gp","notes":"<p>This root is found chiefly in semi-arid climates, especially in ravines and wadis.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains of medium difficulty to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is prepared as a paste.</p><p>Level 5A circulatory poison. Its golden paste can place the victim in a coma for 1–10 days.</p>","addictionFactor":0,"effects":[],"table":"","level":5},"_id":"GhYsiTFSVztDwwmA"}
{"name":"Ladylock (Hanging Lily)","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-ladylock-hanging-lily","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"m-D-6-U","sourceCost":"4gp","sourceCategory":"Remèdes & Antidotes","utilityGroups":["Remèdes & Antidotes","Soins"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"m","localeCode":"D","regionCode":"U","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Ladylock (Hanging Lily)","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-ladylock-hanging-lily","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"remedes-antidotes","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Boucle-de-Dame (Ladylock / Lys Suspendu / Hanging Lily)","system":{"notes":"<p>On la rencontre aussi sous le nom de <strong>Lys Suspendu (Hanging Lily)</strong>.</p><p>Cette mousse se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré doux, notamment dans les forêts de feuillus ou mixtes, et elle est surtout connue dans l’ensemble d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste très difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle doit être préparée en infusion ou décoction.</p><p>Séchée, moulue puis infusée, cette mousse peut tirer du coma une victime du Saewedhil en deux à quatre heures.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Ladylock (Hanging Lily)","system":{"notes":"<p>It is also known as <strong>Hanging Lily</strong>.</p><p>This moss is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in deciduous or mixed forests, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains very hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it must be prepared as an infusion or decoction.</p><p>When dried, ground, and brewed as a tea, this moss can bring a victim of Saewedhil out of a coma within two to four hours.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Remèdes & Antidotes"],"en":["Remedies & Antidotes"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["remedes-antidotes"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"D","findDifficulty":"Very Hard","form":"Moss","prep":"brew","season":"","cost":"4gp","notes":"<p>It is also known as <strong>Hanging Lily</strong>.</p><p>This moss is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in deciduous or mixed forests, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains very hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it must be prepared as an infusion or decoction.</p><p>When dried, ground, and brewed as a tea, this moss can bring a victim of Saewedhil out of a coma within two to four hours.</p>","addictionFactor":0,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"AIwLxIdm4Haz1BML"}
{"name":"Latha (Lartha, Letha, Licka)","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-latha-lartha-letha-licka","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"c-F-4-N","sourceCost":"10sp","sourceCategory":"Renforts & Altérations","utilityGroups":["Renforts & Altérations"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"c","localeCode":"F","regionCode":"N","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Latha (Lartha, Letha, Licka)","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-latha-lartha-letha-licka","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"renforts-alterations","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Latha (Lartha, Letha, Licka)","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette tige se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat froid, notamment dans les berges et rivages d’eau douce, et elle est surtout connue dans le Nord d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste de difficulté moyenne à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle se consomme directement.</p><p>La tige renforce d’environ +10 les Jets de Résistance contre la maladie, soigne les refroidissements et rend 1 à 2 points de vie.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Latha (Lartha, Letha, Licka)","system":{"notes":"<p>This stem is found chiefly in cold climates, especially in freshwater banks and shores, and is best known in northern Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains of medium difficulty to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>The stalk grants about +10 to Resistance Rolls against disease, cures colds, and restores 1–2 concussion hits.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Renforts & Altérations"],"en":["Enhancements & Alterations"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["renforts-alterations"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"F","findDifficulty":"Medium","form":"Stem","prep":"ingest","season":"","cost":"10sp","notes":"<p>This stem is found chiefly in cold climates, especially in freshwater banks and shores, and is best known in northern Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains of medium difficulty to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>The stalk grants about +10 to Resistance Rolls against disease, cures colds, and restores 1–2 concussion hits.</p>","addictionFactor":4,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"dY94DP143nKz5jnq"}
{"name":"Laurelin","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-laurelin","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"m-O-9-NW","sourceCost":"999gp","sourceCategory":"Préservation & Survie","utilityGroups":["Préservation & Survie"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"m","localeCode":"O","regionCode":"NW","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Laurelin","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-laurelin","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"preservation-survie","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Laurelin","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette feuille se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré doux, notamment dans les côtes marines et rivages salés, et elle est surtout connue dans le Nord-Ouest d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste d’une rareté légendaire.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle se consomme directement.</p><p>Cette feuille légendaire peut rendre la vie à un Elfe mort depuis moins de vingt-huit jours.</p><p>Des prises répétées peuvent entraîner une dépendance notable.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Laurelin","system":{"notes":"<p>This leaf is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in sea coasts and saltwater shores, and is best known in north-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains of legendary rarity.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>This legendary leaf can restore to life an Elf who has been dead for fewer than twenty-eight days.</p><p>Repeated doses can lead to significant dependence.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Préservation & Survie"],"en":["Preservation & Survival"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["preservation-survie"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"O","findDifficulty":"Absurd","form":"Leaf","prep":"ingest","season":"","cost":"999gp","notes":"<p>This leaf is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in sea coasts and saltwater shores, and is best known in north-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains of legendary rarity.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>This legendary leaf can restore to life an Elf who has been dead for fewer than twenty-eight days.</p><p>Repeated doses can lead to significant dependence.</p>","addictionFactor":21,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"jN1PPQ3gDuA5xGiP"}
{"name":"Lemsang","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-lemsang","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"t-U-5-NW","sourceCost":"25sp","sourceCategory":"Nourriture","utilityGroups":["Nourriture"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"t","localeCode":"U","regionCode":"NW","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Lemsang","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-lemsang","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"nourriture","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Lemsang","system":{"notes":"<p>Ce champignon se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré frais, notamment dans les milieux souterrains, et elle est surtout connue dans le Nord-Ouest d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle se consomme directement.</p><p>Une livre de ce champignon constitue l’équivalent d’une semaine de rations conservées.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Lemsang","system":{"notes":"<p>This mushroom is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in underground environments, and is best known in north-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>One pound of this mushroom is equivalent to one week of preserved rations.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Nourriture"],"en":["Food"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["nourriture"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"U","findDifficulty":"Hard","form":"Mushroom","prep":"ingest","season":"","cost":"25sp","notes":"<p>This mushroom is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in underground environments, and is best known in north-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>One pound of this mushroom is equivalent to one week of preserved rations.</p>","addictionFactor":1,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"ym88XPOaMQDDtrCB"}
{"name":"Lestagí","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-lestagi","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"a-Z-8-M","sourceCost":"520gp","sourceCategory":"Renforts & Altérations","utilityGroups":["Renforts & Altérations"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"a","localeCode":"Z","regionCode":"M","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Lestagí","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-lestagi","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"renforts-alterations","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Lestagí","system":{"notes":"<p>Ce bourgeon se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat aride, notamment dans les déserts, et elle est surtout connue dans le centre d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste presque introuvable.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle se consomme directement.</p><p>Un bourgeon peut restaurer une perte de caractéristique qui n’est pas due à l’âge. Chaque dose ne peut agir que sur une seule caractéristique et les bourgeons restent actifs deux jours.</p><p>Son usage présente un risque très élevé d’accoutumance et doit rester exceptionnel.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Lestagí","system":{"notes":"<p>This bud is found chiefly in arid climates, especially in deserts, and is best known in central Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains almost impossible to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>One bud can restore stat loss not caused by age. Each dose can affect only one stat, and the buds remain potent for two days.</p><p>Its use carries a very high risk of addiction and should remain exceptional.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Renforts & Altérations"],"en":["Enhancements & Alterations"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["renforts-alterations"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"Z","findDifficulty":"Sheer Folly","form":"Bud","prep":"ingest","season":"","cost":"520gp","notes":"<p>This bud is found chiefly in arid climates, especially in deserts, and is best known in central Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains almost impossible to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>One bud can restore stat loss not caused by age. Each dose can affect only one stat, and the buds remain potent for two days.</p><p>Its use carries a very high risk of addiction and should remain exceptional.</p>","addictionFactor":45,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"OaxPMLaszQWy0FZE"}
{"name":"Lisgereg (Rorash, Anserkë)","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/nuts/chestnut-roasted-brown-white.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-lisgereg-rorash-anserke","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"h-O-6-S","sourceCost":"75gp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Hémorragies & circulation"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"h","localeCode":"O","regionCode":"S","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Lisgereg (Rorash, Anserkë)","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-lisgereg-rorash-anserke","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Lisgereg (Rorash, Anserkë)","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette racine se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat chaud et humide, notamment dans les côtes marines et rivages salés, et elle est surtout connue dans le Sud d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste très difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle s’emploie par application directe.</p><p>Les fibres de la racine produisent un gel hémostatique qui arrête généralement le saignement en trois rounds ; la zone doit ensuite rester au repos quelques minutes.</p><p>Un usage répété peut créer une accoutumance.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Lisgereg (Rorash, Anserkë)","system":{"notes":"<p>This root is found chiefly in hot and humid climates, especially in sea coasts and saltwater shores, and is best known in southern Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains very hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is used by direct application.</p><p>Fibres from the root produce a haemostatic gel that usually stops bleeding in three rounds; the affected area must then remain at rest for a few minutes.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"O","findDifficulty":"Very Hard","form":"Root","prep":"apply","season":"","cost":"75gp","notes":"<p>This root is found chiefly in hot and humid climates, especially in sea coasts and saltwater shores, and is best known in southern Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains very hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is used by direct application.</p><p>Fibres from the root produce a haemostatic gel that usually stops bleeding in three rounds; the affected area must then remain at rest for a few minutes.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>","addictionFactor":7,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"H8snjxC0aNblaMOW"}
{"name":"Little Dargon & Bear’s Tongue","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/nuts/chestnut-roasted-brown-white.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-little-dargon-bears-tongue","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"c-M-5-NW","sourceCost":"3gp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Brûlures & exposition"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"c","localeCode":"M","regionCode":"NW","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Little Dargon & Bear’s Tongue","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-little-dargon-bears-tongue","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Petit Dragon & Langue d’Ours (Little Dargon & Bear’s Tongue)","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette racine ou feuille se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat froid, notamment dans les montagnes, et elle est surtout connue dans le Nord-Ouest d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle s’emploie par application directe.</p><p>Sur les pentes septentrionales des Monts Brumeux, on prépare avec les feuilles et le jus des racines un cataplasme qui double la vitesse naturelle de guérison des brûlures.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Little Dargon & Bear’s Tongue","system":{"notes":"<p>This root/leaf is found chiefly in cold climates, especially in mountains, and is best known in north-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is used by direct application.</p><p>On the northern slopes of the Misty Mountains, the leaves and root juice are made into a poultice that doubles the natural healing rate of burns.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"M","findDifficulty":"Hard","form":"Root/Leaf","prep":"apply","season":"","cost":"3gp","notes":"<p>This root/leaf is found chiefly in cold climates, especially in mountains, and is best known in north-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is used by direct application.</p><p>On the northern slopes of the Misty Mountains, the leaves and root juice are made into a poultice that doubles the natural healing rate of burns.</p>","addictionFactor":0,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"UMJVCWH5aJNwa07Y"}
{"name":"Lord ’n’ Glory","type":"herb","img":"icons/commodities/flowers/flower-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-lord-n-glory","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"t-C-4-NE","sourceCost":"12gp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Récupération","Renforts & Altérations"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"t","localeCode":"C","regionCode":"NE","sourceVariants":[{"group":"Renforts & Altérations","code":"t-C-4-NE","form":"Flower","prep":"ingest","cost":"12gp","af":8,"effect":"Pressées, les fleurs donnent une huile aphrodisiaque qui provoque pendant plusieurs heures une forte excitation et des signes physiques évidents."}],"sourceName":"Lord ’n’ Glory","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-lord-n-glory","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Lord ’n’ Glory","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette fleur se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré frais, notamment dans les forêts de conifères, et elle est surtout connue dans le Nord-Est d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste de difficulté moyenne à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle se consomme directement.</p><p>Pressée, la fleur produit une huile qui rend 1 à 6 points de vie ; elle possède également des propriétés aphrodisiaques. Pressées, les fleurs donnent une huile aphrodisiaque qui provoque pendant plusieurs heures une forte excitation et des signes physiques évidents.</p><p>Un usage répété peut créer une accoutumance.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Lord ’n’ Glory","system":{"notes":"<p>This flower is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in coniferous forests, and is best known in north-eastern Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains of medium difficulty to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>Pressed, the flower yields an oil that restores 1–6 concussion hits and also has aphrodisiac properties. Pressed flowers produce an aphrodisiac oil that causes strong arousal and obvious physical signs for several hours.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"C","findDifficulty":"Medium","form":"Flower","prep":"ingest","season":"","cost":"12gp","notes":"<p>This flower is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in coniferous forests, and is best known in north-eastern Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains of medium difficulty to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>Pressed, the flower yields an oil that restores 1–6 concussion hits and also has aphrodisiac properties. Pressed flowers produce an aphrodisiac oil that causes strong arousal and obvious physical signs for several hours.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>","addictionFactor":8,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"6SHHxeAS6lEmH6BT"}
{"name":"Lothfelag","type":"herb","img":"icons/commodities/flowers/flower-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-lothfelag","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"t-U-7-W","sourceCost":"490gp","sourceCategory":"Préservation & Survie","utilityGroups":["Préservation & Survie","Poisons","Respiratoire"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"t","localeCode":"U","regionCode":"W","sourceVariants":[{"group":"Poisons","code":"t-U-7-W","form":"Resin","prep":"ingest","cost":"70gp","af":4,"effect":"Poison respiratoire de niveau 1. Un échec modéré plonge dans un sommeil impossible à interrompre pendant 1 à 10 heures ; un échec sévère entraîne un coma de 1 à 7 mois."}],"sourceName":"Lothfelag","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-lothfelag","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"preservation-survie","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Lothfelag","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette fleur se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré frais, notamment dans les milieux souterrains, et elle est surtout connue dans l’Ouest d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste extrêmement difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle se consomme directement.</p><p>Chez les Nains, la fleur peut maintenir la vie pendant des mois et, dans certains cas, rappeler à la vie un mort très récent. Chez les autres peuples, elle dissipe surtout blessures superficielles et étourdissement ; sa résine brute doit être soigneusement éliminée. Poison respiratoire de niveau 1. Un échec modéré plonge dans un sommeil impossible à interrompre pendant 1 à 10 heures ; un échec sévère entraîne un coma de 1 à 7 mois.</p><p>Des prises répétées peuvent entraîner une dépendance notable.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Lothfelag","system":{"notes":"<p>This flower is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in underground environments, and is best known in western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains extremely hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>Among Dwarves, the flower can sustain life for months and, in some cases, restore a very recently dead Dwarf to life. Among other peoples it mainly relieves superficial wounds and stun; its raw resin must be carefully removed. Level 1 respiratory poison. A moderate failure causes an unbreakable sleep lasting 1–10 hours; a severe failure causes a coma lasting 1–7 months.</p><p>Repeated doses can lead to significant dependence.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Préservation & Survie"],"en":["Preservation & Survival"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["preservation-survie"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"U","findDifficulty":"Extremely Hard","form":"Flower","prep":"ingest","season":"","cost":"490gp","notes":"<p>This flower is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in underground environments, and is best known in western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains extremely hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>Among Dwarves, the flower can sustain life for months and, in some cases, restore a very recently dead Dwarf to life. Among other peoples it mainly relieves superficial wounds and stun; its raw resin must be carefully removed. Level 1 respiratory poison. A moderate failure causes an unbreakable sleep lasting 1–10 hours; a severe failure causes a coma lasting 1–7 months.</p><p>Repeated doses can lead to significant dependence.</p>","addictionFactor":16,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"0JY678u1fl9fl4U6"}
{"name":"Luminous Vrak (Heylet)","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-luminous-vrak-heylet","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"t-U-4-U","sourceCost":"21gp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Hémorragies & circulation"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"t","localeCode":"U","regionCode":"U","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Luminous Vrak (Heylet)","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-luminous-vrak-heylet","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Vrak Lumineux (Luminous Vrak / Heylet)","system":{"notes":"<p>On la rencontre aussi sous le nom de <strong>Heylet</strong>.</p><p>Ce champignon se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré frais, notamment dans les milieux souterrains, et elle est surtout connue dans l’ensemble d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste de difficulté moyenne à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle s’emploie par application directe.</p><p>La matière prélevée sous les lamelles du champignon, appliquée sur la plaie, stoppe progressivement l’hémorragie en quelques minutes.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Luminous Vrak (Heylet)","system":{"notes":"<p>It is also known as <strong>Heylet</strong>.</p><p>This mushroom is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in underground environments, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains of medium difficulty to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is used by direct application.</p><p>Material scraped from beneath the mushroom’s gills and applied to a wound gradually stops the bleeding within a few minutes.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"U","findDifficulty":"Medium","form":"Mushroom","prep":"apply","season":"","cost":"21gp","notes":"<p>It is also known as <strong>Heylet</strong>.</p><p>This mushroom is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in underground environments, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains of medium difficulty to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is used by direct application.</p><p>Material scraped from beneath the mushroom’s gills and applied to a wound gradually stops the bleeding within a few minutes.</p>","addictionFactor":3,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"KoUMJhcb5mKPBdp9"}
{"name":"Lus","type":"herb","img":"icons/commodities/flowers/flower-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-lus","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"t-T-3-NW","sourceCost":"31gp","sourceCategory":"Poisons","utilityGroups":["Poisons","Circulatoire"],"poisonType":"Circulatoire","climateCode":"t","localeCode":"T","regionCode":"NW","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Lus","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-lus","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"poison-circulatoires","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Lus","system":{"notes":"<p>Ces fleurs se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré frais, notamment dans les hautes herbes, et elle est surtout connue dans le Nord-Ouest d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste assez aisée à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle est préparée sous forme de pâte.</p><p>Poison circulatoire de niveau 4, surtout connu en Saralainn. Selon la gravité de l’échec au Jet de Résistance, il provoque cécité temporaire ou durable, coma, voire mort.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Lus","system":{"notes":"<p>This flowers is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in tall grasslands, and is best known in north-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains fairly easy to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is prepared as a paste.</p><p>Level 4 circulatory poison, chiefly known in Saralainn. Depending on the severity of the failed Resistance Roll, it causes temporary or lasting blindness, coma, or death.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Circulatoires"],"en":["Circulatory"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["poison-circulatoires"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"T","findDifficulty":"Light","form":"Flowers","prep":"paste","season":"","cost":"31gp","notes":"<p>This flowers is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in tall grasslands, and is best known in north-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains fairly easy to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is prepared as a paste.</p><p>Level 4 circulatory poison, chiefly known in Saralainn. Depending on the severity of the failed Resistance Roll, it causes temporary or lasting blindness, coma, or death.</p>","addictionFactor":0,"effects":[],"table":"","level":4},"_id":"8xHzJUf7P1s3UNxd"}
{"name":"Madarch (Zûrumul)","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-madarch-zurumul","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"m-U-6-NW","sourceCost":"100gp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Hémorragies & circulation","Nourriture"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"m","localeCode":"U","regionCode":"NW","sourceVariants":[{"group":"Nourriture","code":"m-U-6-NW","form":"Mushroom","prep":"ingest","cost":"1gp","af":1,"effect":"Une livre de Madarch suffit à nourrir un homme pendant trois jours et se conserve plusieurs semaines."}],"sourceName":"Madarch (Zûrumul)","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-madarch-zurumul","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Madarch (Zûrumul)","system":{"notes":"<p>Ce champignon se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré doux, notamment dans les milieux souterrains, et elle est surtout connue dans le Nord-Ouest d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste très difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle est préparée sous forme liquide.</p><p>Le jus du champignon, dilué avec une quantité égale d’eau, donne une potion violacée qui réchauffe le corps et répare coupures et vaisseaux sanguins en moins de deux heures. Non dilué, il devient le dangereux Pelenaur. Une livre de Madarch suffit à nourrir un homme pendant trois jours et se conserve plusieurs semaines.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Madarch (Zûrumul)","system":{"notes":"<p>This mushroom is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in underground environments, and is best known in north-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains very hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is prepared in liquid form.</p><p>The mushroom’s juice, diluted with an equal quantity of water, produces a violet potion that warms the body and repairs cuts and blood vessels in less than two hours. Undiluted it becomes the dangerous Pelenaur. One pound of Madarch will feed a man for three days and keeps for several weeks.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"U","findDifficulty":"Very Hard","form":"Mushroom","prep":"liquid","season":"","cost":"100gp","notes":"<p>This mushroom is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in underground environments, and is best known in north-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains very hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is prepared in liquid form.</p><p>The mushroom’s juice, diluted with an equal quantity of water, produces a violet potion that warms the body and repairs cuts and blood vessels in less than two hours. Undiluted it becomes the dangerous Pelenaur. One pound of Madarch will feed a man for three days and keeps for several weeks.</p>","addictionFactor":1,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"F4f0BJ5FPwpjPcyC"}
{"name":"Mahal’s Gift (Reglen)","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-mahals-gift-reglen","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"t-M-3-U","sourceCost":"75gp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Récupération"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"t","localeCode":"M","regionCode":"U","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Mahal’s Gift (Reglen)","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-mahals-gift-reglen","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Don-de-Mahal (Mahal’s Gift / Reglen)","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette mousse se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré frais, notamment dans les montagnes, et elle est surtout connue dans l’ensemble d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste assez aisée à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle doit être préparée en infusion ou décoction.</p><p>La décoction rend environ 50 points de vie.</p><p>Un usage répété peut créer une accoutumance.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Mahal’s Gift (Reglen)","system":{"notes":"<p>This moss is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in mountains, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains fairly easy to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it must be prepared as an infusion or decoction.</p><p>The decoction restores about 50 concussion hits.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"M","findDifficulty":"Light","form":"Moss","prep":"brew","season":"","cost":"75gp","notes":"<p>This moss is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in mountains, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains fairly easy to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it must be prepared as an infusion or decoction.</p><p>The decoction restores about 50 concussion hits.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>","addictionFactor":7,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"KvyC3rNCLNGr1IqI"}
{"name":"Megillos","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-megillos","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"c-M-3-U","sourceCost":"12sp","sourceCategory":"Renforts & Altérations","utilityGroups":["Renforts & Altérations"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"c","localeCode":"M","regionCode":"U","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Megillos","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-megillos","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"renforts-alterations","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Megillos","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette feuille se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat froid, notamment dans les montagnes, et elle est surtout connue dans l’ensemble d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste assez aisée à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle se consomme directement.</p><p>La feuille double la portée de la vision et accorde environ +25 en Perception visuelle pendant dix minutes.</p><p>Des prises répétées peuvent entraîner une dépendance notable.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Megillos","system":{"notes":"<p>This leaf is found chiefly in cold climates, especially in mountains, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains fairly easy to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>The leaf doubles visual range and grants about +25 to visual Perception for ten minutes.</p><p>Repeated doses can lead to significant dependence.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Renforts & Altérations"],"en":["Enhancements & Alterations"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["renforts-alterations"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"M","findDifficulty":"Light","form":"Leaf","prep":"ingest","season":"","cost":"12sp","notes":"<p>This leaf is found chiefly in cold climates, especially in mountains, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains fairly easy to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>The leaf doubles visual range and grants about +25 to visual Perception for ten minutes.</p><p>Repeated doses can lead to significant dependence.</p>","addictionFactor":19,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"qx7AjiYL1H7n1tNL"}
{"name":"Melander","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-melander","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"c-F-3","sourceCost":"12sp","sourceCategory":"Remèdes & Antidotes","utilityGroups":["Remèdes & Antidotes"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"c","localeCode":"F","regionCode":null,"sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Melander","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-melander","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"remedes-antidotes","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Melander","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette mousse se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat froid, notamment dans les berges et rivages d’eau douce.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste assez aisée à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle doit être préparée en infusion ou décoction.</p><p>Une infusion de cette mousse accorde environ +10 aux Jets de Résistance contre les maladies pendant 1 à 10 jours.</p><p>Un usage répété peut créer une accoutumance.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Melander","system":{"notes":"<p>This moss is found chiefly in cold climates, especially in freshwater banks and shores.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains fairly easy to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it must be prepared as an infusion or decoction.</p><p>An infusion of this moss grants about +10 to Resistance Rolls against disease for 1–10 days.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Remèdes & Antidotes"],"en":["Remedies & Antidotes"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["remedes-antidotes"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"F","findDifficulty":"Light","form":"Moss","prep":"brew","season":"","cost":"12sp","notes":"<p>This moss is found chiefly in cold climates, especially in freshwater banks and shores.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains fairly easy to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it must be prepared as an infusion or decoction.</p><p>An infusion of this moss grants about +10 to Resistance Rolls against disease for 1–10 days.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>","addictionFactor":8,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"2vh2mNQhNRmss1mc"}
{"name":"Melem Loza (Balm Vine)","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-melem-loza-balm-vine","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"s-H-6-S","sourceCost":"60gp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Brûlures & exposition"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"s","localeCode":"H","regionCode":"S","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Melem Loza (Balm Vine)","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-melem-loza-balm-vine","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Melem Loza (Liane-Baume / Balm Vine)","system":{"notes":"<p>On la rencontre aussi sous le nom de <strong>Liane-Baume (Balm Vine)</strong>.</p><p>Cette tige se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat semi-aride, notamment dans les landes, broussailles et bruyères, et elle est surtout connue dans le Sud d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste très difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle s’emploie par application directe.</p><p>La sève de cette liane réduit de moitié les effets d’une brûlure du premier ou du deuxième degré. Elle ne se conserve que deux jours.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Melem Loza (Balm Vine)","system":{"notes":"<p>It is also known as <strong>Balm Vine</strong>.</p><p>This stem is found chiefly in semi-arid climates, especially in heaths, scrublands, and moors, and is best known in southern Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains very hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is used by direct application.</p><p>The sap of this vine halves the effects of a first- or second-degree burn. It keeps for only two days.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"H","findDifficulty":"Very Hard","form":"Stem","prep":"apply","season":"","cost":"60gp","notes":"<p>It is also known as <strong>Balm Vine</strong>.</p><p>This stem is found chiefly in semi-arid climates, especially in heaths, scrublands, and moors, and is best known in southern Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains very hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is used by direct application.</p><p>The sap of this vine halves the effects of a first- or second-degree burn. It keeps for only two days.</p>","addictionFactor":0,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"VRn1v8VtKsxaHXmY"}
{"name":"Menelar","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-menelar","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"f-C-5-N","sourceCost":"65gp","sourceCategory":"Remèdes & Antidotes","utilityGroups":["Remèdes & Antidotes"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"f","localeCode":"C","regionCode":"N","sourceVariants":[{"group":"Remèdes & Antidotes","code":"c-C-5-N","form":"Cone","prep":"brew","cost":"65gp","af":"?","effect":"La décoction des cônes est traditionnellement employée pour combattre les infections."}],"sourceName":"Menelar","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-menelar","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"remedes-antidotes","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Menelar","system":{"notes":"<p>Ce cône se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat glacial, notamment dans les forêts de conifères, et elle est surtout connue dans le Nord d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle doit être préparée en infusion ou décoction.</p><p>Antidote de niveau 7 contre les poisons circulatoires. La décoction des cônes est traditionnellement employée pour combattre les infections.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Menelar","system":{"notes":"<p>This cone is found chiefly in frigid climates, especially in coniferous forests, and is best known in northern Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it must be prepared as an infusion or decoction.</p><p>Level 7 antidote for circulatory poisons. A decoction of the cones is traditionally used to combat infection.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Remèdes & Antidotes"],"en":["Remedies & Antidotes"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["remedes-antidotes"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"C","findDifficulty":"Hard","form":"Cone","prep":"brew","season":"","cost":"65gp","notes":"<p>This cone is found chiefly in frigid climates, especially in coniferous forests, and is best known in northern Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it must be prepared as an infusion or decoction.</p><p>Level 7 antidote for circulatory poisons. A decoction of the cones is traditionally used to combat infection.</p>","addictionFactor":4,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"p1MKXXSEARe7xLOt"}
{"name":"Merrig (Maioc)","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-merrig-maioc","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"s-S-5-M","sourceCost":"2gp","sourceCategory":"Renforts & Altérations","utilityGroups":["Renforts & Altérations"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"s","localeCode":"S","regionCode":"M","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Merrig (Maioc)","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-merrig-maioc","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"renforts-alterations","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Merrig (Maioc)","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette épine se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat semi-aride, notamment dans les prairies rases, et elle est surtout connue dans le centre d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle doit être préparée en infusion ou décoction.</p><p>Une prise quotidienne pendant dix jours augmente l’Apparence et la Présence de 5 points. L’usage devient souvent addictif après deux semaines ; le sevrage entraîne une chute de Constitution ainsi qu’une perte d’Apparence et de Présence.</p><p>Des prises répétées peuvent entraîner une dépendance notable.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Merrig (Maioc)","system":{"notes":"<p>This thorn is found chiefly in semi-arid climates, especially in short-grass plains, and is best known in central Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it must be prepared as an infusion or decoction.</p><p>Daily use for ten days increases Appearance and Presence by 5 points. Use often becomes addictive after two weeks; withdrawal causes a drop in Constitution as well as losses to Appearance and Presence.</p><p>Repeated doses can lead to significant dependence.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Renforts & Altérations"],"en":["Enhancements & Alterations"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["renforts-alterations"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"S","findDifficulty":"Hard","form":"Thorn","prep":"brew","season":"","cost":"2gp","notes":"<p>This thorn is found chiefly in semi-arid climates, especially in short-grass plains, and is best known in central Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it must be prepared as an infusion or decoction.</p><p>Daily use for ten days increases Appearance and Presence by 5 points. Use often becomes addictive after two weeks; withdrawal causes a drop in Constitution as well as losses to Appearance and Presence.</p><p>Repeated doses can lead to significant dependence.</p>","addictionFactor":20,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"YvifF6iEIKubyoL2"}
{"name":"Mirenna","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/fruit/berry-leaf-pink.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-mirenna","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"c-M-3-U","sourceCost":"10gp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Récupération"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"c","localeCode":"M","regionCode":"U","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Mirenna","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-mirenna","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Mirenna","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette baie se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat froid, notamment dans les montagnes, et elle est surtout connue dans l’ensemble d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste assez aisée à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle se consomme directement.</p><p>La baie rend immédiatement 10 points de vie.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Mirenna","system":{"notes":"<p>This berry is found chiefly in cold climates, especially in mountains, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains fairly easy to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>The berry immediately restores 10 concussion hits.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"M","findDifficulty":"Light","form":"Berry","prep":"ingest","season":"","cost":"10gp","notes":"<p>This berry is found chiefly in cold climates, especially in mountains, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains fairly easy to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>The berry immediately restores 10 concussion hits.</p>","addictionFactor":1,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"4hxXLUBlYCdgvKqI"}
{"name":"Míretári’ Crown","type":"herb","img":"icons/commodities/flowers/flower-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-miretari-crown","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"t-A-8-U","sourceCost":"24gp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Hémorragies & circulation"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"t","localeCode":"A","regionCode":"U","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Míretári’ Crown","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-miretari-crown","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Couronne de Míretári (Míretári’ Crown)","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette fleur se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré frais, notamment dans les hautes zones alpines, et elle est surtout connue dans l’ensemble d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste presque introuvable.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle s’emploie par application directe.</p><p>Posée en travers d’une plaie pendant dix minutes, la fleur arrête le saignement sans refermer les chairs. On l’appelle aussi Bloodsuckers.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Míretári’ Crown","system":{"notes":"<p>This flower is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in high alpine zones, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains almost impossible to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is used by direct application.</p><p>Placed across a wound for ten minutes, the flower stops bleeding without closing the flesh. It is also called Bloodsuckers.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"A","findDifficulty":"Sheer Folly","form":"Flower","prep":"apply","season":"","cost":"24gp","notes":"<p>This flower is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in high alpine zones, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains almost impossible to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is used by direct application.</p><p>Placed across a wound for ten minutes, the flower stops bleeding without closing the flesh. It is also called Bloodsuckers.</p>","addictionFactor":0,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"qyPlnP1LtWsp2cVF"}
{"name":"Monk Hair (Seahair)","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-monk-hair-seahair","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"h-O-4-U","sourceCost":"12gp","sourceCategory":"Remèdes & Antidotes","utilityGroups":["Remèdes & Antidotes","Soins"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"h","localeCode":"O","regionCode":"U","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Monk Hair (Seahair)","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-monk-hair-seahair","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"remedes-antidotes","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Cheveux de Moine (Monk Hair / Cheveux de Mer / Seahair)","system":{"notes":"<p>On la rencontre aussi sous le nom de <strong>Cheveux de Mer (Seahair)</strong>.</p><p>Cette algue se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat chaud et humide, notamment dans les côtes marines et rivages salés, et elle est surtout connue dans l’ensemble d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste de difficulté moyenne à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle est réduite en poudre.</p><p>Antidote de niveau 12 contre le Karfar lorsqu’il est administré dans la minute suivant l’empoisonnement. La poudre peut aussi arrêter les hémorragies internes et externes sans refermer la plaie.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Monk Hair (Seahair)","system":{"notes":"<p>It is also known as <strong>Seahair</strong>.</p><p>This algae is found chiefly in hot and humid climates, especially in sea coasts and saltwater shores, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains of medium difficulty to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is ground into powder.</p><p>Level 12 antidote for Karfar if administered within one minute of poisoning. The powder can also stop internal and external bleeding without closing the wound.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Remèdes & Antidotes"],"en":["Remedies & Antidotes"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["remedes-antidotes"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"O","findDifficulty":"Medium","form":"Algae","prep":"powder","season":"","cost":"12gp","notes":"<p>It is also known as <strong>Seahair</strong>.</p><p>This algae is found chiefly in hot and humid climates, especially in sea coasts and saltwater shores, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains of medium difficulty to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is ground into powder.</p><p>Level 12 antidote for Karfar if administered within one minute of poisoning. The powder can also stop internal and external bleeding without closing the wound.</p>","addictionFactor":4,"effects":[],"table":"","level":12},"_id":"7uUwgcoX8dQLuOL6"}
{"name":"Mook","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/fruit/berry-leaf-pink.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-mook","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"m-D-3-S","sourceCost":"210gp","sourceCategory":"Remèdes & Antidotes","utilityGroups":["Remèdes & Antidotes"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"m","localeCode":"D","regionCode":"S","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Mook","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-mook","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"remedes-antidotes","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Mook","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette baie se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré doux, notamment dans les forêts de feuillus ou mixtes, et elle est surtout connue dans le Sud d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste assez aisée à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle se consomme directement.</p><p>Antidote de niveau 3 contre les poisons respiratoires. Les baies préparées conservent leurs propriétés pendant des années.</p><p>Un usage répété peut créer une accoutumance.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Mook","system":{"notes":"<p>This berry is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in deciduous or mixed forests, and is best known in southern Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains fairly easy to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>Level 3 antidote for respiratory poisons. Prepared berries retain their properties for years.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Remèdes & Antidotes"],"en":["Remedies & Antidotes"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["remedes-antidotes"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"D","findDifficulty":"Light","form":"Berry","prep":"ingest","season":"","cost":"210gp","notes":"<p>This berry is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in deciduous or mixed forests, and is best known in southern Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains fairly easy to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>Level 3 antidote for respiratory poisons. Prepared berries retain their properties for years.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>","addictionFactor":5,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"KEj67xq3xZKZDt91"}
{"name":"Moonthumb (Glow Worm)","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-moonthumb-glow-worm","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"t-U-7-NE","sourceCost":"12gp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Récupération"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"t","localeCode":"U","regionCode":"NE","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Moonthumb (Glow Worm)","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-moonthumb-glow-worm","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Pouce-de-Lune (Moonthumb / Ver Luisant / Glow Worm)","system":{"notes":"<p>On la rencontre aussi sous le nom de <strong>Ver Luisant (Glow Worm)</strong>.</p><p>Ce champignon se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré frais, notamment dans les milieux souterrains, et elle est surtout connue dans le Nord-Est d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste extrêmement difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle se consomme directement.</p><p>Ce champignon rend immédiatement 1 à 10 points de vie et conserve ses vertus même une fois séché.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Moonthumb (Glow Worm)","system":{"notes":"<p>It is also known as <strong>Glow Worm</strong>.</p><p>This fungus is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in underground environments, and is best known in north-eastern Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains extremely hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>This mushroom immediately restores 1–10 concussion hits and retains its potency even after drying.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"U","findDifficulty":"Extremely Hard","form":"Fungus","prep":"ingest","season":"","cost":"12gp","notes":"<p>It is also known as <strong>Glow Worm</strong>.</p><p>This fungus is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in underground environments, and is best known in north-eastern Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains extremely hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>This mushroom immediately restores 1–10 concussion hits and retains its potency even after drying.</p>","addictionFactor":4,"effects":[{"effect":"heal-hits","formula":"1d10"}],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"0v3ok3KIEz7IGO3R"}
{"name":"Mountainrod (Bonebinder)","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-mountainrod-bonebinder","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"m-M-3-U","sourceCost":"5gp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Os & fractures"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"m","localeCode":"M","regionCode":"U","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Mountainrod (Bonebinder)","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-mountainrod-bonebinder","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Tige des Montagnes (Mountainrod / Lie-Os / Bonebinder)","system":{"notes":"<p>On la rencontre aussi sous le nom de <strong>Lie-Os (Bonebinder)</strong>.</p><p>Ce roseau se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré doux, notamment dans les montagnes, et elle est surtout connue dans l’ensemble d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste assez aisée à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle doit être préparée en infusion ou décoction.</p><p>Une infusion de ce roseau multiplie par cinq la guérison des fractures pendant deux jours, à condition que l’os soit correctement réduit et immobilisé.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Mountainrod (Bonebinder)","system":{"notes":"<p>It is also known as <strong>Bonebinder</strong>.</p><p>This reed is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in mountains, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains fairly easy to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it must be prepared as an infusion or decoction.</p><p>An infusion of this reed increases fracture healing fivefold for two days, provided the bone has been correctly set and immobilized.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"M","findDifficulty":"Light","form":"Reed","prep":"brew","season":"","cost":"5gp","notes":"<p>It is also known as <strong>Bonebinder</strong>.</p><p>This reed is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in mountains, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains fairly easy to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it must be prepared as an infusion or decoction.</p><p>An infusion of this reed increases fracture healing fivefold for two days, provided the bone has been correctly set and immobilized.</p>","addictionFactor":3,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"glhceWViG9ucmueh"}
{"name":"Mur","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-mur","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"s-S-7-S","sourceCost":"80gp","sourceCategory":"Préservation & Survie","utilityGroups":["Préservation & Survie"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"s","localeCode":"S","regionCode":"S","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Mur","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-mur","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"preservation-survie","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Mur","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette résine se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat semi-aride, notamment dans les prairies rases, et elle est surtout connue dans le Sud d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste extrêmement difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle s’emploie par application directe.</p><p>Frottée sur une personne mourante, cette résine peut empêcher la mort pendant plusieurs heures.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Mur","system":{"notes":"<p>This resin is found chiefly in semi-arid climates, especially in short-grass plains, and is best known in southern Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains extremely hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is used by direct application.</p><p>Rubbed onto a dying person, this resin can prevent death for several hours.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Préservation & Survie"],"en":["Preservation & Survival"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["preservation-survie"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"S","findDifficulty":"Extremely Hard","form":"Resin","prep":"apply","season":"","cost":"80gp","notes":"<p>This resin is found chiefly in semi-arid climates, especially in short-grass plains, and is best known in southern Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains extremely hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is used by direct application.</p><p>Rubbed onto a dying person, this resin can prevent death for several hours.</p>","addictionFactor":0,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"ERH0lPNe6MMYZuiw"}
{"name":"Nehtelassë (Keihäänlehti)","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-nehtelasse-keihaanlehti","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"t-S-4-NW","sourceCost":"4sp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Récupération"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"t","localeCode":"S","regionCode":"NW","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Nehtelassë (Keihäänlehti)","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-nehtelasse-keihaanlehti","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Nehtelassë (Keihäänlehti)","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette feuille se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré frais, notamment dans les prairies rases, et elle est surtout connue dans le Nord-Ouest d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste de difficulté moyenne à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle s’emploie par application directe.</p><p>Frottée sur une plaie, la feuille rend 1 à 6 points de vie.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Nehtelassë (Keihäänlehti)","system":{"notes":"<p>This leaf is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in short-grass plains, and is best known in north-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains of medium difficulty to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is used by direct application.</p><p>Rubbed onto a wound, the leaf restores 1–6 concussion hits.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"S","findDifficulty":"Medium","form":"Leaf","prep":"apply","season":"","cost":"4sp","notes":"<p>This leaf is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in short-grass plains, and is best known in north-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains of medium difficulty to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is used by direct application.</p><p>Rubbed onto a wound, the leaf restores 1–6 concussion hits.</p>","addictionFactor":1,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"Jd9AS4pKffWiaFD1"}
{"name":"Nen Calgalen","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/nuts/chestnut-roasted-brown-white.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-nen-calgalen","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"t-U-7-NW","sourceCost":"35gp","sourceCategory":"Poisons","utilityGroups":["Poisons","Circulatoire"],"poisonType":"Circulatoire","climateCode":"t","localeCode":"U","regionCode":"NW","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Nen Calgalen","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-nen-calgalen","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"poison-circulatoires","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Nen Calgalen","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette racine se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré frais, notamment dans les milieux souterrains, et elle est surtout connue dans le Nord-Ouest d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste extrêmement difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle est préparée sous forme de pâte.</p><p>Poison circulatoire de niveau 2. La victime luit d’un vert malsain ; les effets vont d’un ralentissement marqué et de douleurs violentes à une destruction temporaire de la Constitution et des caractéristiques mentales, potentiellement mortelle.</p><p>Un usage répété peut créer une accoutumance.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Nen Calgalen","system":{"notes":"<p>This root is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in underground environments, and is best known in north-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains extremely hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is prepared as a paste.</p><p>Level 2 circulatory poison. The victim glows an unhealthy green; effects range from severe slowing and intense pain to temporary destruction of Constitution and mental stats, potentially causing death.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Circulatoires"],"en":["Circulatory"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["poison-circulatoires"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"U","findDifficulty":"Extremely Hard","form":"Root","prep":"paste","season":"","cost":"35gp","notes":"<p>This root is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in underground environments, and is best known in north-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains extremely hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is prepared as a paste.</p><p>Level 2 circulatory poison. The victim glows an unhealthy green; effects range from severe slowing and intense pain to temporary destruction of Constitution and mental stats, potentially causing death.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>","addictionFactor":6,"effects":[],"table":"","level":2},"_id":"BYJwkOUT7LfbOHEx"}
{"name":"Nightrod (Ebony Fingers)","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-nightrod-ebony-fingers","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"m-U-3-U","sourceCost":"15gp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Récupération"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"m","localeCode":"U","regionCode":"U","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Nightrod (Ebony Fingers)","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-nightrod-ebony-fingers","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Tige-de-Nuit (Nightrod / Doigts d’Ébène / Ebony Fingers)","system":{"notes":"<p>On la rencontre aussi sous le nom de <strong>Doigts d’Ébène (Ebony Fingers)</strong>.</p><p>Ce champignon se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré doux, notamment dans les milieux souterrains, et elle est surtout connue dans l’ensemble d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste assez aisée à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle se consomme directement.</p><p>Le champignon rend 1 à 2 points de vie.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Nightrod (Ebony Fingers)","system":{"notes":"<p>It is also known as <strong>Ebony Fingers</strong>.</p><p>This mushroom is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in underground environments, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains fairly easy to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>The mushroom restores 1–2 concussion hits.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"U","findDifficulty":"Light","form":"Mushroom","prep":"ingest","season":"","cost":"15gp","notes":"<p>It is also known as <strong>Ebony Fingers</strong>.</p><p>This mushroom is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in underground environments, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains fairly easy to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>The mushroom restores 1–2 concussion hits.</p>","addictionFactor":0,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"zr01zDOlUxPYH5Cc"}
{"name":"Nur-oiolosse","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-nur-oiolosse","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"f-F-8-U","sourceCost":"200gp","sourceCategory":"Préservation & Survie","utilityGroups":["Préservation & Survie"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"f","localeCode":"F","regionCode":"U","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Nur-oiolosse","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-nur-oiolosse","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"preservation-survie","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Nur-oiolosse","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette gousse se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat glacial, notamment dans les berges et rivages d’eau douce, et elle est surtout connue dans l’ensemble d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste presque introuvable.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle se consomme directement.</p><p>Cette gousse peut rendre la vie à un mort depuis moins d’un jour, mais le ressuscité mourra le lendemain s’il ne reçoit pas rapidement une noix de Sorul.</p><p>Un usage répété peut créer une accoutumance.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Nur-oiolosse","system":{"notes":"<p>This clove is found chiefly in frigid climates, especially in freshwater banks and shores, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains almost impossible to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>This clove can restore to life someone dead for less than one day, but the restored person will die the following day unless they quickly receive a Sorul Nut.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Préservation & Survie"],"en":["Preservation & Survival"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["preservation-survie"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"F","findDifficulty":"Sheer Folly","form":"Clove","prep":"ingest","season":"","cost":"200gp","notes":"<p>This clove is found chiefly in frigid climates, especially in freshwater banks and shores, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains almost impossible to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>This clove can restore to life someone dead for less than one day, but the restored person will die the following day unless they quickly receive a Sorul Nut.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>","addictionFactor":13,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"oYipL6VktLxQsmKs"}
{"name":"Oiolassë (Say-arana)","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-oiolasse-say-arana","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"f-F-8-U","sourceCost":"600gp","sourceCategory":"Préservation & Survie","utilityGroups":["Préservation & Survie"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"f","localeCode":"F","regionCode":"U","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Oiolassë (Say-arana)","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-oiolasse-say-arana","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"preservation-survie","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Oiolassë (Say-arana)","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette gousse se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat glacial, notamment dans les berges et rivages d’eau douce, et elle est surtout connue dans l’ensemble d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste presque introuvable.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle se consomme directement.</p><p>Chez les Elfes, cette gousse empêche l’aggravation des blessures pendant deux jours et permet aux soins d’agir avec leur pleine efficacité.</p><p>Des prises répétées peuvent entraîner une dépendance notable.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Oiolassë (Say-arana)","system":{"notes":"<p>This clove is found chiefly in frigid climates, especially in freshwater banks and shores, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains almost impossible to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>Among Elves, this clove prevents wounds from worsening for two days and allows healing to work at full effectiveness.</p><p>Repeated doses can lead to significant dependence.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Préservation & Survie"],"en":["Preservation & Survival"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["preservation-survie"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"F","findDifficulty":"Sheer Folly","form":"Clove","prep":"ingest","season":"","cost":"600gp","notes":"<p>This clove is found chiefly in frigid climates, especially in freshwater banks and shores, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains almost impossible to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>Among Elves, this clove prevents wounds from worsening for two days and allows healing to work at full effectiveness.</p><p>Repeated doses can lead to significant dependence.</p>","addictionFactor":22,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"3Hnl7a4wjHj6e4O3"}
{"name":"Olvar","type":"herb","img":"icons/commodities/flowers/flower-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-olvar","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"f-O-6-N","sourceCost":"200gp","sourceCategory":"Préservation & Survie","utilityGroups":["Préservation & Survie"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"f","localeCode":"O","regionCode":"N","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Olvar","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-olvar","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"preservation-survie","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Olvar","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette fleur se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat glacial, notamment dans les côtes marines et rivages salés, et elle est surtout connue dans le Nord d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste très difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle se consomme directement.</p><p>La fleur peut maintenir un mourant en vie pendant 2 à 20 jours.</p><p>Des prises répétées peuvent entraîner une dépendance notable.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Olvar","system":{"notes":"<p>This flower is found chiefly in frigid climates, especially in sea coasts and saltwater shores, and is best known in northern Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains very hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>The flower can keep a dying person alive for 2–20 days.</p><p>Repeated doses can lead to significant dependence.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Préservation & Survie"],"en":["Preservation & Survival"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["preservation-survie"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"O","findDifficulty":"Very Hard","form":"Flower","prep":"ingest","season":"","cost":"200gp","notes":"<p>This flower is found chiefly in frigid climates, especially in sea coasts and saltwater shores, and is best known in northern Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains very hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>The flower can keep a dying person alive for 2–20 days.</p><p>Repeated doses can lead to significant dependence.</p>","addictionFactor":20,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"Ob5dyf7yNnHilPPU"}
{"name":"Olvatári (Kelventari)","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-olvatari-kelventari","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"t-T-5-U","sourceCost":"5gp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Brûlures & exposition"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"t","localeCode":"T","regionCode":"U","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Olvatári (Kelventari)","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-olvatari-kelventari","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Olvatári (Kelventari)","system":{"notes":"<p>Ce jus se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré frais, notamment dans les hautes herbes, et elle est surtout connue dans l’ensemble d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle s’emploie par application directe.</p><p>Son jus soigne les brûlures, rend 1 à 10 points de vie perdus par la chaleur et limite fortement les cicatrices. Bien conservé, il reste actif jusqu’à deux ans.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Olvatári (Kelventari)","system":{"notes":"<p>This juice is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in tall grasslands, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is used by direct application.</p><p>Its juice heals burns, restores 1–10 concussion hits lost to heat, and greatly limits scarring. Properly stored, it remains effective for up to two years.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"T","findDifficulty":"Hard","form":"Juice","prep":"apply","season":"","cost":"5gp","notes":"<p>This juice is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in tall grasslands, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is used by direct application.</p><p>Its juice heals burns, restores 1–10 concussion hits lost to heat, and greatly limits scarring. Properly stored, it remains effective for up to two years.</p>","addictionFactor":0,"effects":[{"effect":"heal-hits","formula":"1d10"}],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"D2lYvB6oNr48XpWA"}
{"name":"Pargen (Geriche, Maranna)","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/fruit/berry-leaf-pink.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-pargen-geriche-maranna","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"h-J-8-S","sourceCost":"800gp","sourceCategory":"Préservation & Survie","utilityGroups":["Préservation & Survie"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"h","localeCode":"J","regionCode":"S","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Pargen (Geriche, Maranna)","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-pargen-geriche-maranna","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"preservation-survie","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Pargen (Geriche, Maranna)","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette baie se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat chaud et humide, notamment dans les jungles et forêts pluviales, et elle est surtout connue dans le Sud d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste presque introuvable.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle se consomme directement.</p><p>La baie empêche l’état d’un blessé de se détériorer pendant quatre jours et permet aux soins d’atteindre leur pleine efficacité. Elle se conserve plusieurs mois.</p><p>Des prises répétées peuvent entraîner une dépendance notable.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Pargen (Geriche, Maranna)","system":{"notes":"<p>This berry is found chiefly in hot and humid climates, especially in jungles and rainforests, and is best known in southern Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains almost impossible to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>The berry prevents an injured person’s condition from deteriorating for four days and allows healing to work at full effectiveness. It keeps for several months.</p><p>Repeated doses can lead to significant dependence.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Préservation & Survie"],"en":["Preservation & Survival"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["preservation-survie"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"J","findDifficulty":"Sheer Folly","form":"Berry","prep":"ingest","season":"","cost":"800gp","notes":"<p>This berry is found chiefly in hot and humid climates, especially in jungles and rainforests, and is best known in southern Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains almost impossible to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>The berry prevents an injured person’s condition from deteriorating for four days and allows healing to work at full effectiveness. It keeps for several months.</p><p>Repeated doses can lead to significant dependence.</p>","addictionFactor":25,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"1t8g4gS9vQwpV4BX"}
{"name":"Pathur","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/nuts/chestnut-roasted-brown-white.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-pathur","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"a-H-4-M","sourceCost":"35gp","sourceCategory":"Préservation & Survie","utilityGroups":["Préservation & Survie"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"a","localeCode":"H","regionCode":"M","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Pathur","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-pathur","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"preservation-survie","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Pathur","system":{"notes":"<p>Ce nodule se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat aride, notamment dans les landes, broussailles et bruyères, et elle est surtout connue dans le centre d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste de difficulté moyenne à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle se consomme directement.</p><p>Le nodule maintient un mourant en vie pendant environ une heure.</p><p>Un usage répété peut créer une accoutumance.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Pathur","system":{"notes":"<p>This nodule is found chiefly in arid climates, especially in heaths, scrublands, and moors, and is best known in central Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains of medium difficulty to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>The nodule keeps a dying person alive for about one hour.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Préservation & Survie"],"en":["Preservation & Survival"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["preservation-survie"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"H","findDifficulty":"Medium","form":"Nodule","prep":"ingest","season":"","cost":"35gp","notes":"<p>This nodule is found chiefly in arid climates, especially in heaths, scrublands, and moors, and is best known in central Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains of medium difficulty to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>The nodule keeps a dying person alive for about one hour.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>","addictionFactor":8,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"nCfgc504UouFtuHW"}
{"name":"Pelenaur (Madarch)","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-pelenaur-madarch","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"m-U-6-NW","sourceCost":"80gp","sourceCategory":"Poisons","utilityGroups":["Poisons","Circulatoire"],"poisonType":"Circulatoire","climateCode":"m","localeCode":"U","regionCode":"NW","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Pelenaur (Madarch)","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-pelenaur-madarch","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"poison-circulatoires","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Pelenaur (Madarch)","system":{"notes":"<p>Ce champignon se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré doux, notamment dans les milieux souterrains, et elle est surtout connue dans le Nord-Ouest d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste très difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle est préparée sous forme de pâte.</p><p>Poison circulatoire de niveau 2 obtenu à partir de Madarch non dilué. Les blessures non guéries peuvent se rouvrir et saigner deux fois plus vite ; un échec sévère peut faire éclater les vaisseaux sanguins et tuer.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Pelenaur (Madarch)","system":{"notes":"<p>This mushroom is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in underground environments, and is best known in north-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains very hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is prepared as a paste.</p><p>Level 2 circulatory poison made from undiluted Madarch. Unhealed wounds may reopen and bleed at twice the normal rate; a severe failure can rupture the blood vessels and kill.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Circulatoires"],"en":["Circulatory"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["poison-circulatoires"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"U","findDifficulty":"Very Hard","form":"Mushroom","prep":"paste","season":"","cost":"80gp","notes":"<p>This mushroom is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in underground environments, and is best known in north-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains very hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is prepared as a paste.</p><p>Level 2 circulatory poison made from undiluted Madarch. Unhealed wounds may reopen and bleed at twice the normal rate; a severe failure can rupture the blood vessels and kill.</p>","addictionFactor":3,"effects":[],"table":"","level":2},"_id":"cmvr7sXfMz0xEKmx"}
{"name":"Phacalus (Fatemaker)","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/nuts/chestnut-roasted-brown-white.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-phacalus-fatemaker","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"m-F-3-W","sourceCost":"35gp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Hémorragies & circulation","Renforts & Altérations"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"m","localeCode":"F","regionCode":"W","sourceVariants":[{"group":"Renforts & Altérations","code":"m-F-3-W","form":"Root","prep":"ingest","cost":"35gp","af":0,"effect":"Cette racine des marais du bassin du Gwathló, avalée entière, peut augmenter définitivement de 1 plusieurs caractéristiques mentales, jusqu’à 102. Le traitement reste extrêmement dangereux : coma, pertes durables de caractéristiques ou réaction allergique mortelle peuvent survenir."}],"sourceName":"Phacalus (Fatemaker)","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-phacalus-fatemaker","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Phacalus (Faiseur-de-Destin / Fatemaker)","system":{"notes":"<p>On la rencontre aussi sous le nom de <strong>Faiseur de Destin (Fatemaker)</strong>.</p><p>Cette racine se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré doux, notamment dans les berges et rivages d’eau douce, et elle est surtout connue dans l’Ouest d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste assez aisée à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle se consomme directement.</p><p>Une racine séchée au moins une semaine puis réduite en poudre peut être répandue sur une blessure pour en arrêter le saignement en cinq minutes. Avalée entière, elle possède des propriétés bien plus dangereuses et extraordinaires. Cette racine des marais du bassin du Gwathló, avalée entière, peut augmenter définitivement de 1 plusieurs caractéristiques mentales, jusqu’à 102. Le traitement reste extrêmement dangereux : coma, pertes durables de caractéristiques ou réaction allergique mortelle peuvent survenir.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Phacalus (Fatemaker)","system":{"notes":"<p>It is also known as <strong>Fatemaker</strong>.</p><p>This root is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in freshwater banks and shores, and is best known in western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains fairly easy to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>A root dried for at least a week and then powdered can be sprinkled on a wound to stop bleeding within five minutes. Swallowed whole, it has far more dangerous and extraordinary properties. This marsh root of the Gwathló Basin, swallowed whole, can permanently increase several mental stats by 1, up to 102. The treatment is extremely dangerous: coma, lasting stat loss, or a fatal allergic reaction may occur.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"F","findDifficulty":"Light","form":"Root","prep":"ingest","season":"","cost":"35gp","notes":"<p>It is also known as <strong>Fatemaker</strong>.</p><p>This root is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in freshwater banks and shores, and is best known in western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains fairly easy to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>A root dried for at least a week and then powdered can be sprinkled on a wound to stop bleeding within five minutes. Swallowed whole, it has far more dangerous and extraordinary properties. This marsh root of the Gwathló Basin, swallowed whole, can permanently increase several mental stats by 1, up to 102. The treatment is extremely dangerous: coma, lasting stat loss, or a fatal allergic reaction may occur.</p>","addictionFactor":0,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"cFztFMLbdPAx6WOE"}
{"name":"Plant-like Stone","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-plant-like-stone","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"m-U-6-U","sourceCost":"12gp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Hémorragies & circulation"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"m","localeCode":"U","regionCode":"U","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Plant-like Stone","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-plant-like-stone","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Pierre-Végétale (Plant-like Stone)","system":{"notes":"<p>Ce champignon se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré doux, notamment dans les milieux souterrains, et elle est surtout connue dans l’ensemble d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste très difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle s’emploie par application directe.</p><p>La sève blanc laiteux de ce champignon se solidifie sur la blessure : elle arrête l’hémorragie, scelle la plaie et contribue à la protéger contre l’infection.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Plant-like Stone","system":{"notes":"<p>This fungus is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in underground environments, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains very hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is used by direct application.</p><p>The milky-white sap of this fungus hardens over a wound, stopping the bleeding, sealing the injury, and helping protect it against infection.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"U","findDifficulty":"Very Hard","form":"Fungus","prep":"apply","season":"","cost":"12gp","notes":"<p>This fungus is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in underground environments, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains very hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is used by direct application.</p><p>The milky-white sap of this fungus hardens over a wound, stopping the bleeding, sealing the injury, and helping protect it against infection.</p>","addictionFactor":0,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"HCSiRWmDvoH2xxJh"}
{"name":"Pûra","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-pura","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"Woses-NW","sourceCost":"28gp","sourceCategory":"Poisons","utilityGroups":["Poisons","Conversion"],"poisonType":"Conversion","climateCode":null,"localeCode":null,"regionCode":null,"sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Pûra","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-pura","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"poison-conversion","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Pûra","system":{"notes":"<p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle est préparée sous forme de pâte.</p><p>Poison de conversion de niveau 2, traditionnellement associé aux Woses du Nord-Ouest.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Pûra","system":{"notes":"<p>To obtain its properties, it is prepared as a paste.</p><p>Level 2 conversion poison traditionally associated with the Woses of the North-West.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Conversion"],"en":["Conversion"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["poison-conversion"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"","findDifficulty":"","form":"Mixture","prep":"paste","season":"","cost":"28gp","notes":"<p>To obtain its properties, it is prepared as a paste.</p><p>Level 2 conversion poison traditionally associated with the Woses of the North-West.</p>","addictionFactor":0,"effects":[],"table":"","level":2},"_id":"3S6StQ8KAewhTGSt"}
{"name":"Quilmufur","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/nuts/chestnut-roasted-brown-white.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-quilmufur","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"m-C-7-U","sourceCost":"49gp","sourceCategory":"Remèdes & Antidotes","utilityGroups":["Remèdes & Antidotes"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"m","localeCode":"C","regionCode":"U","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Quilmufur","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-quilmufur","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"remedes-antidotes","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Quilmufur","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette racine se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré doux, notamment dans les forêts de conifères, et elle est surtout connue dans l’ensemble d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste extrêmement difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle doit être préparée en infusion ou décoction.</p><p>Antidote de niveau 8 contre les poisons de conversion.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Quilmufur","system":{"notes":"<p>This root is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in coniferous forests, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains extremely hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it must be prepared as an infusion or decoction.</p><p>Level 8 antidote for conversion poisons.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Remèdes & Antidotes"],"en":["Remedies & Antidotes"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["remedes-antidotes"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"C","findDifficulty":"Extremely Hard","form":"Root","prep":"brew","season":"","cost":"49gp","notes":"<p>This root is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in coniferous forests, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains extremely hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it must be prepared as an infusion or decoction.</p><p>Level 8 antidote for conversion poisons.</p>","addictionFactor":1,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"g5lIhRjB0YWjChAU"}
{"name":"Rewk (Sorriss)","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/nuts/chestnut-roasted-brown-white.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-rewk-sorriss","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"t-D-3-U","sourceCost":"9sp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Récupération"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"t","localeCode":"D","regionCode":"U","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Rewk (Sorriss)","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-rewk-sorriss","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Rewk (Sorriss)","system":{"notes":"<p>Ce nodule se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré frais, notamment dans les forêts de feuillus ou mixtes, et elle est surtout connue dans l’ensemble d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste assez aisée à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle doit être préparée en infusion ou décoction.</p><p>Après une heure d’infusion, le nodule rend 2 à 20 points de vie.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Rewk (Sorriss)","system":{"notes":"<p>This nodule is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in deciduous or mixed forests, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains fairly easy to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it must be prepared as an infusion or decoction.</p><p>After one hour of steeping, the nodule restores 2–20 concussion hits.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"D","findDifficulty":"Light","form":"Nodule","prep":"brew","season":"","cost":"9sp","notes":"<p>This nodule is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in deciduous or mixed forests, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains fairly easy to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it must be prepared as an infusion or decoction.</p><p>After one hour of steeping, the nodule restores 2–20 concussion hits.</p>","addictionFactor":1,"effects":[{"effect":"heal-hits","formula":"2d10"}],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"DXpUVI1XRI1mSX6S"}
{"name":"Rud-Tekma","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/fruit/berry-leaf-pink.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-rud-tekma","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"h-J-6-S","sourceCost":"23gp","sourceCategory":"Renforts & Altérations","utilityGroups":["Renforts & Altérations"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"h","localeCode":"J","regionCode":"S","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Rud-Tekma","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-rud-tekma","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"renforts-alterations","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Rud-Tekma","system":{"notes":"<p>Ce fruit se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat chaud et humide, notamment dans les jungles et forêts pluviales, et elle est surtout connue dans le Sud d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste très difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle se consomme directement.</p><p>Le fruit accorde environ +20 aux jets d’incantation mais impose −20 au combat rapproché et aux manœuvres pendant une heure ; les sorts dirigés peuvent parfois dévier vers la cible la plus proche.</p><p>Un usage répété peut créer une accoutumance.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Rud-Tekma","system":{"notes":"<p>This fruit is found chiefly in hot and humid climates, especially in jungles and rainforests, and is best known in southern Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains very hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>The fruit grants about +20 to spell-casting rolls but imposes −20 on melee combat and maneuvers for one hour; Directed Spells may occasionally veer toward the nearest target.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Renforts & Altérations"],"en":["Enhancements & Alterations"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["renforts-alterations"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"J","findDifficulty":"Very Hard","form":"Fruit","prep":"ingest","season":"","cost":"23gp","notes":"<p>This fruit is found chiefly in hot and humid climates, especially in jungles and rainforests, and is best known in southern Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains very hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>The fruit grants about +20 to spell-casting rolls but imposes −20 on melee combat and maneuvers for one hour; Directed Spells may occasionally veer toward the nearest target.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>","addictionFactor":10,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"nxZaAIXPiESjW4eL"}
{"name":"Rumareth","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-rumareth","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"m-D-6-U","sourceCost":"4gp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Hémorragies & circulation"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"m","localeCode":"D","regionCode":"U","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Rumareth","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-rumareth","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Rumareth","system":{"notes":"<p>Ces feuilles se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré doux, notamment dans les forêts de feuillus ou mixtes, et elle est surtout connue dans l’ensemble d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste très difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle s’emploie par application directe.</p><p>Les feuilles fraîches arrêtent les saignements légers, jusqu’à environ deux points par round. Elles conservent leur efficacité une semaine après la cueillette.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Rumareth","system":{"notes":"<p>This leaves is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in deciduous or mixed forests, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains very hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is used by direct application.</p><p>Fresh leaves stop light bleeding, up to about 2 hits per round. They remain effective for one week after picking.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"D","findDifficulty":"Very Hard","form":"Leaves","prep":"apply","season":"","cost":"4gp","notes":"<p>This leaves is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in deciduous or mixed forests, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains very hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is used by direct application.</p><p>Fresh leaves stop light bleeding, up to about 2 hits per round. They remain effective for one week after picking.</p>","addictionFactor":1,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"20tnMzNbcJa8Ghuk"}
{"name":"Rûthin","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-ruthin","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"f-U-7-NW","sourceCost":"88gp","sourceCategory":"Poisons","utilityGroups":["Poisons","Conversion"],"poisonType":"Conversion","climateCode":"f","localeCode":"U","regionCode":"NW","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Rûthin","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-ruthin","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"poison-conversion","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Rûthin","system":{"notes":"<p>Ce cristal se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat glacial, notamment dans les milieux souterrains, et elle est surtout connue dans le Nord-Ouest d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste extrêmement difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle est préparée sous forme liquide.</p><p>Poison de conversion de niveau 2. En cas d’échec au Jet de Résistance, le contenu de l’estomac se transforme en éclats de verre acérés et la mort survient en quelques rounds. Il est sans effet sur un estomac vide.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Rûthin","system":{"notes":"<p>This crystal is found chiefly in frigid climates, especially in underground environments, and is best known in north-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains extremely hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is prepared in liquid form.</p><p>Level 2 conversion poison. On a failed Resistance Roll, the contents of the stomach turn into jagged shards of glass and death follows within a few rounds. It has no effect on an empty stomach.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Conversion"],"en":["Conversion"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["poison-conversion"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"U","findDifficulty":"Extremely Hard","form":"Crystal","prep":"liquid","season":"","cost":"88gp","notes":"<p>This crystal is found chiefly in frigid climates, especially in underground environments, and is best known in north-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains extremely hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is prepared in liquid form.</p><p>Level 2 conversion poison. On a failed Resistance Roll, the contents of the stomach turn into jagged shards of glass and death follows within a few rounds. It has no effect on an empty stomach.</p>","addictionFactor":0,"effects":[],"table":"","level":2},"_id":"Qw9G8wWFa1DlN0Tk"}
{"name":"Sailcha","type":"herb","img":"icons/commodities/flowers/flower-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-sailcha","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"t-S-8-NW","sourceCost":"50gp","sourceCategory":"Remèdes & Antidotes","utilityGroups":["Remèdes & Antidotes"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"t","localeCode":"S","regionCode":"NW","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Sailcha","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-sailcha","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"remedes-antidotes","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Sailcha","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette fleur se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré frais, notamment dans les prairies rases, et elle est surtout connue dans le Nord-Ouest d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste presque introuvable.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle se porte sur soi.</p><p>Chez les Cardolani, porter cette fleur est un signe de bon augure. Tant qu’elle reste fraîche, elle est réputée raffermir le moral et protéger son porteur.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Sailcha","system":{"notes":"<p>This flower is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in short-grass plains, and is best known in north-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains almost impossible to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is worn or carried.</p><p>Among the Cardolani, wearing this flower is considered a sign of good fortune. While it remains fresh, it is believed to strengthen morale and protect its wearer.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Remèdes & Antidotes"],"en":["Remedies & Antidotes"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["remedes-antidotes"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"S","findDifficulty":"Sheer Folly","form":"Flower","prep":"wear","season":"","cost":"50gp","notes":"<p>This flower is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in short-grass plains, and is best known in north-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains almost impossible to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is worn or carried.</p><p>Among the Cardolani, wearing this flower is considered a sign of good fortune. While it remains fresh, it is believed to strengthen morale and protect its wearer.</p>","addictionFactor":0,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"7VtYl6fAKOIyykzm"}
{"name":"Sarah-Pokes-Her-Head","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/nuts/chestnut-roasted-brown-white.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-sarah-pokes-her-head","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"m-D-7-NW","sourceCost":"12gp","sourceCategory":"Nourriture","utilityGroups":["Nourriture"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"m","localeCode":"D","regionCode":"NW","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Sarah-Pokes-Her-Head","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-sarah-pokes-her-head","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"nourriture","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Sarah-Passe-la-Tête (Sarah-Pokes-Her-Head)","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette racine se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré doux, notamment dans les forêts de feuillus ou mixtes, et elle est surtout connue dans le Nord-Ouest d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste extrêmement difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle se consomme directement.</p><p>Une racine correctement préparée peut fournir à une personne jusqu’à trois semaines de nourriture.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Sarah-Pokes-Her-Head","system":{"notes":"<p>This root is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in deciduous or mixed forests, and is best known in north-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains extremely hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>A properly prepared root can provide one person with up to three weeks of food.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Nourriture"],"en":["Food"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["nourriture"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"D","findDifficulty":"Extremely Hard","form":"Root","prep":"ingest","season":"","cost":"12gp","notes":"<p>This root is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in deciduous or mixed forests, and is best known in north-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains extremely hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>A properly prepared root can provide one person with up to three weeks of food.</p>","addictionFactor":0,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"HCD5BkhGkJOvudSU"}
{"name":"Seathorn","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/nuts/chestnut-roasted-brown-white.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-seathorn","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"t-O-6-U","sourceCost":"35gp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Récupération"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"t","localeCode":"O","regionCode":"U","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Seathorn","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-seathorn","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Épine-de-Mer (Seathorn)","system":{"notes":"<p>Ce nodule se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré frais, notamment dans les côtes marines et rivages salés, et elle est surtout connue dans l’ensemble d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste très difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle se consomme directement.</p><p>Le nodule marin, parfois appelé « barnacle », est brisé pour en manger la chair, qui rend 1 à 6 points de vie. Il se conserve plusieurs mois avant de se dessécher.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Seathorn","system":{"notes":"<p>This nodule is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in sea coasts and saltwater shores, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains very hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>The marine nodule, sometimes called a “barnacle,” is cracked open and its flesh eaten, restoring 1–6 concussion hits. It keeps for several months before drying out.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"O","findDifficulty":"Very Hard","form":"Nodule","prep":"ingest","season":"","cost":"35gp","notes":"<p>This nodule is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in sea coasts and saltwater shores, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains very hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>The marine nodule, sometimes called a “barnacle,” is cracked open and its flesh eaten, restoring 1–6 concussion hits. It keeps for several months before drying out.</p>","addictionFactor":3,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"rnxL5YbG6unY4c4d"}
{"name":"Seregemor","type":"herb","img":"icons/commodities/flowers/flower-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-seregemor","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"c-H-6-NW","sourceCost":"180gp","sourceCategory":"Poisons","utilityGroups":["Poisons","Conversion"],"poisonType":"Conversion","climateCode":"c","localeCode":"H","regionCode":"NW","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Seregemor","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-seregemor","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"poison-conversion","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Seregemor","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette fleur se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat froid, notamment dans les landes, broussailles et bruyères, et elle est surtout connue dans le Nord-Ouest d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste très difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle est préparée sous forme de pâte.</p><p>Poison de conversion de niveau 1. Il transforme temporairement le sang en une substance noire imparfaite, provoquant incapacité et effondrement des caractéristiques mentales avant une récupération très lente.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Seregemor","system":{"notes":"<p>This flower is found chiefly in cold climates, especially in heaths, scrublands, and moors, and is best known in north-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains very hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is prepared as a paste.</p><p>Level 1 conversion poison. It temporarily transforms the victim’s blood into an imperfect black substance, causing incapacity and a collapse of mental stats followed by a very slow recovery.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Conversion"],"en":["Conversion"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["poison-conversion"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"H","findDifficulty":"Very Hard","form":"Flower","prep":"paste","season":"","cost":"180gp","notes":"<p>This flower is found chiefly in cold climates, especially in heaths, scrublands, and moors, and is best known in north-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains very hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is prepared as a paste.</p><p>Level 1 conversion poison. It temporarily transforms the victim’s blood into an imperfect black substance, causing incapacity and a collapse of mental stats followed by a very slow recovery.</p>","addictionFactor":0,"effects":[],"table":"","level":1},"_id":"eTGMisnvl6rlSjlv"}
{"name":"Sha","type":"herb","img":"icons/commodities/flowers/flower-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-sha","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"c-H-7-NW","sourceCost":"10gp","sourceCategory":"Renforts & Altérations","utilityGroups":["Renforts & Altérations"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"c","localeCode":"H","regionCode":"NW","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Sha","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-sha","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"renforts-alterations","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Sha","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette fleur se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat froid, notamment dans les landes, broussailles et bruyères, et elle est surtout connue dans le Nord-Ouest d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste extrêmement difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle se consomme directement.</p><p>Les fleurs séchées et réduites en poudre permettent de voir jusqu’à environ 300 pieds dans presque toute obscurité pendant 10 à 50 rounds. Une diarrhée pénible survient souvent plusieurs heures plus tard.</p><p>Un usage répété peut créer une accoutumance.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Sha","system":{"notes":"<p>This flower is found chiefly in cold climates, especially in heaths, scrublands, and moors, and is best known in north-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains extremely hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>The flowers are dried and powdered, allowing the user to see up to about 300 feet in almost complete darkness for 10–50 rounds. Painful diarrhea often follows several hours later.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Renforts & Altérations"],"en":["Enhancements & Alterations"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["renforts-alterations"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"H","findDifficulty":"Extremely Hard","form":"Flower","prep":"ingest","season":"","cost":"10gp","notes":"<p>This flower is found chiefly in cold climates, especially in heaths, scrublands, and moors, and is best known in north-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains extremely hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>The flowers are dried and powdered, allowing the user to see up to about 300 feet in almost complete darkness for 10–50 rounds. Painful diarrhea often follows several hours later.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>","addictionFactor":5,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"hB3CpURpzsd4SwmK"}
{"name":"Sheep’s Plume","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-sheeps-plume","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"h-F-4-SW","sourceCost":"5gp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Récupération"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"h","localeCode":"F","regionCode":"SW","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Sheep’s Plume","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-sheeps-plume","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Plume-de-Mouton (Sheep’s Plume)","system":{"notes":"<p>Ce roseau se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat chaud et humide, notamment dans les berges et rivages d’eau douce, et elle est surtout connue dans le Sud-Ouest d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste de difficulté moyenne à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle doit être préparée en infusion ou décoction.</p><p>La décoction rend 2 à 20 points de vie.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Sheep’s Plume","system":{"notes":"<p>This reed is found chiefly in hot and humid climates, especially in freshwater banks and shores, and is best known in south-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains of medium difficulty to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it must be prepared as an infusion or decoction.</p><p>The decoction restores 2–20 concussion hits.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"F","findDifficulty":"Medium","form":"Reed","prep":"brew","season":"","cost":"5gp","notes":"<p>This reed is found chiefly in hot and humid climates, especially in freshwater banks and shores, and is best known in south-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains of medium difficulty to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it must be prepared as an infusion or decoction.</p><p>The decoction restores 2–20 concussion hits.</p>","addictionFactor":4,"effects":[{"effect":"heal-hits","formula":"2d10"}],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"4vA9QO5To9UYPGEb"}
{"name":"Shen","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-shen","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"t-F-6-U","sourceCost":"27gp","sourceCategory":"Remèdes & Antidotes","utilityGroups":["Remèdes & Antidotes"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"t","localeCode":"F","regionCode":"U","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Shen","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-shen","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"remedes-antidotes","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Shen","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette feuille se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré frais, notamment dans les berges et rivages d’eau douce, et elle est surtout connue dans l’ensemble d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste très difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle se consomme directement.</p><p>Antidote de niveau 4 contre les poisons nerveux.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Shen","system":{"notes":"<p>This leaf is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in freshwater banks and shores, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains very hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>Level 4 antidote for nerve poisons.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Remèdes & Antidotes"],"en":["Remedies & Antidotes"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["remedes-antidotes"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"F","findDifficulty":"Very Hard","form":"Leaf","prep":"ingest","season":"","cost":"27gp","notes":"<p>This leaf is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in freshwater banks and shores, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains very hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>Level 4 antidote for nerve poisons.</p>","addictionFactor":3,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"NVGjpXgIj0QjD22L"}
{"name":"Shirolos","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-shirolos","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"m-H-8","sourceCost":"84gp","sourceCategory":"Poisons","utilityGroups":["Poisons","Respiratoire"],"poisonType":"Respiratoire","climateCode":"m","localeCode":"H","regionCode":null,"sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Shirolos","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-shirolos","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"poison-respiratoires","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Shirolos","system":{"notes":"<p>Ce liquide se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré doux, notamment dans les landes, broussailles et bruyères.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste presque introuvable.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle se consomme directement.</p><p>Poison respiratoire de niveau 10, distillation de Sweet Galenas et de vin blanc. Il provoque une somnolence extrême ou un état de transe suggestible pouvant durer des dizaines d’heures.</p><p>Un usage répété peut créer une accoutumance.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Shirolos","system":{"notes":"<p>This liquid is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in heaths, scrublands, and moors.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains almost impossible to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>Level 10 respiratory poison distilled from Sweet Galenas and white wine. It causes extreme drowsiness or a suggestible trance that can last for dozens of hours.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Respiratoires"],"en":["Respiratory"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["poison-respiratoires"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"H","findDifficulty":"Sheer Folly","form":"Liquid","prep":"ingest","season":"","cost":"84gp","notes":"<p>This liquid is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in heaths, scrublands, and moors.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains almost impossible to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>Level 10 respiratory poison distilled from Sweet Galenas and white wine. It causes extreme drowsiness or a suggestible trance that can last for dozens of hours.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>","addictionFactor":10,"effects":[],"table":"","level":10},"_id":"C1h9KhEWkyJCSLhS"}
{"name":"Silmaana","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-silmaana","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"m-T-2","sourceCost":"4gp","sourceCategory":"Poisons","utilityGroups":["Poisons","Réduction"],"poisonType":"Réduction","climateCode":"m","localeCode":"T","regionCode":null,"sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Silmaana","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-silmaana","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"poison-reduction","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Silmaana","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette tige se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré doux, notamment dans les hautes herbes.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste facile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle est réduite en poudre.</p><p>Poison de réduction de niveau 9C. Cette poudre argentée marque et cicatrise la peau, inflige 2 à 20 points de vie et peut provoquer des effets modérés.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Silmaana","system":{"notes":"<p>This stalk is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in tall grasslands.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains easy to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is ground into powder.</p><p>Level 9C Reduction poison. This silvery powder marks and scars the skin, inflicts 2–20 concussion hits, and can cause moderate general effects.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Réduction"],"en":["Reduction"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["poison-reduction"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"T","findDifficulty":"Easy","form":"Stalk","prep":"powder","season":"","cost":"4gp","notes":"<p>This stalk is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in tall grasslands.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains easy to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is ground into powder.</p><p>Level 9C Reduction poison. This silvery powder marks and scars the skin, inflicts 2–20 concussion hits, and can cause moderate general effects.</p>","addictionFactor":0,"effects":[],"table":"","level":9},"_id":"2OaseZRUBNC7WlEZ"}
{"name":"Siran","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-siran","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"s-S-6-M","sourceCost":"80gp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Muscles, nerfs & organes"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"s","localeCode":"S","regionCode":"M","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Siran","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-siran","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Siran","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette gousse se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat semi-aride, notamment dans les prairies rases, et elle est surtout connue dans le centre d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste très difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle se consomme directement.</p><p>Ce remède peut restaurer un organe ou une zone corporelle gravement atteinte, mais il fragilise temporairement la peau et peut provoquer de sévères réactions au soleil.</p><p>Son usage présente un risque très élevé d’accoutumance et doit rester exceptionnel.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Siran","system":{"notes":"<p>This clove is found chiefly in semi-arid climates, especially in short-grass plains, and is best known in central Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains very hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>This remedy can restore a badly damaged organ or body area, but it temporarily weakens the skin and can cause severe reactions to sunlight.</p><p>Its use carries a very high risk of addiction and should remain exceptional.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"S","findDifficulty":"Very Hard","form":"Clove","prep":"ingest","season":"","cost":"80gp","notes":"<p>This clove is found chiefly in semi-arid climates, especially in short-grass plains, and is best known in central Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains very hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>This remedy can restore a badly damaged organ or body area, but it temporarily weakens the skin and can cause severe reactions to sunlight.</p><p>Its use carries a very high risk of addiction and should remain exceptional.</p>","addictionFactor":31,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"z4vnqDhEunzo4ok3"}
{"name":"Siriena","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-siriena","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"s-S-5-U","sourceCost":"70gp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Muscles, nerfs & organes"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"s","localeCode":"S","regionCode":"U","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Siriena","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-siriena","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Siriena","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette herbe se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat semi-aride, notamment dans les prairies rases, et elle est surtout connue dans l’ensemble d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle doit être préparée en infusion ou décoction.</p><p>La décoction préserve une matière organique allant jusqu’à la taille d’un corps pendant environ une heure.</p><p>Des prises répétées peuvent entraîner une dépendance notable.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Siriena","system":{"notes":"<p>This grass is found chiefly in semi-arid climates, especially in short-grass plains, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it must be prepared as an infusion or decoction.</p><p>The decoction preserves organic matter up to the size of a body for about one hour.</p><p>Repeated doses can lead to significant dependence.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"S","findDifficulty":"Hard","form":"Grass","prep":"brew","season":"","cost":"70gp","notes":"<p>This grass is found chiefly in semi-arid climates, especially in short-grass plains, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it must be prepared as an infusion or decoction.</p><p>The decoction preserves organic matter up to the size of a body for about one hour.</p><p>Repeated doses can lead to significant dependence.</p>","addictionFactor":27,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"5VVSKhuYUmtx00vy"}
{"name":"Slird","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/fruit/berry-leaf-pink.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-slird","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"h-J-8-SW","sourceCost":"13gp","sourceCategory":"Poisons","utilityGroups":["Poisons","Nerveux"],"poisonType":"Nerveux","climateCode":"h","localeCode":"J","regionCode":"SW","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Slird","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-slird","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"poison-nerveux","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Slird","system":{"notes":"<p>Ce fruit se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat chaud et humide, notamment dans les jungles et forêts pluviales, et elle est surtout connue dans le Sud-Ouest d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste presque introuvable.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle est préparée sous forme de pâte.</p><p>Poison nerveux de niveau 2C agissant en 1 à 2 rounds. Il peut faire perdre toute sensation dans plusieurs extrémités pendant des semaines.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Slird","system":{"notes":"<p>This fruit is found chiefly in hot and humid climates, especially in jungles and rainforests, and is best known in south-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains almost impossible to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is prepared as a paste.</p><p>Level 2C nerve poison acting within 1–2 rounds. It can remove all sensation from several extremities for weeks.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Nerveux"],"en":["Nerve"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["poison-nerveux"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"J","findDifficulty":"Sheer Folly","form":"Fruit","prep":"paste","season":"","cost":"13gp","notes":"<p>This fruit is found chiefly in hot and humid climates, especially in jungles and rainforests, and is best known in south-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains almost impossible to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is prepared as a paste.</p><p>Level 2C nerve poison acting within 1–2 rounds. It can remove all sensation from several extremities for weeks.</p>","addictionFactor":1,"effects":[],"table":"","level":2},"_id":"9s26P3qfOiCouQ00"}
{"name":"Slota","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-slota","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"t-D-7","sourceCost":"36gp","sourceCategory":"Poisons","utilityGroups":["Poisons","Réduction"],"poisonType":"Réduction","climateCode":"t","localeCode":"D","regionCode":null,"sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Slota","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-slota","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"poison-reduction","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Slota","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette araignée se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré frais, notamment dans les forêts de feuillus ou mixtes.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste extrêmement difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle est préparée sous forme de pâte.</p><p>Poison de réduction de niveau 5A. Son effet extrême est une paralysie lente apparaissant en un jour, suivie de la mort en 1 à 10 jours.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Slota","system":{"notes":"<p>This spider is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in deciduous or mixed forests.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains extremely hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is prepared as a paste.</p><p>Level 5A Reduction poison. Its extreme effect is slow paralysis beginning within one day, followed by death in 1–10 days.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Réduction"],"en":["Reduction"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["poison-reduction"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"D","findDifficulty":"Extremely Hard","form":"Spider","prep":"paste","season":"","cost":"36gp","notes":"<p>This spider is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in deciduous or mixed forests.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains extremely hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is prepared as a paste.</p><p>Level 5A Reduction poison. Its extreme effect is slow paralysis beginning within one day, followed by death in 1–10 days.</p>","addictionFactor":0,"effects":[],"table":"","level":5},"_id":"RywXm9nIwBIDH92m"}
{"name":"Sorul Nut","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/nuts/chestnut-roasted-brown-white.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-sorul-nut","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"c-F-2","sourceCost":"1sp","sourceCategory":"Remèdes & Antidotes","utilityGroups":["Remèdes & Antidotes"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"c","localeCode":"F","regionCode":null,"sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Sorul Nut","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-sorul-nut","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"remedes-antidotes","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Sorul Nut","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette noix se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat froid, notamment dans les berges et rivages d’eau douce.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste facile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle se consomme directement.</p><p>Antidote de niveau 20 contre le Nur-oiolosse.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Sorul Nut","system":{"notes":"<p>This nut is found chiefly in cold climates, especially in freshwater banks and shores.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains easy to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>Level 20 antidote for Nur-oiolosse.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Remèdes & Antidotes"],"en":["Remedies & Antidotes"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["remedes-antidotes"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"F","findDifficulty":"Easy","form":"Nut","prep":"ingest","season":"","cost":"1sp","notes":"<p>This nut is found chiefly in cold climates, especially in freshwater banks and shores.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains easy to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>Level 20 antidote for Nur-oiolosse.</p>","addictionFactor":0,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"Zq45EbqVJFLvaRW8"}
{"name":"Splayfoot Goodwort","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/nuts/chestnut-roasted-brown-white.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-splayfoot-goodwort","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"m-F-6-W","sourceCost":"23gp","sourceCategory":"Renforts & Altérations","utilityGroups":["Renforts & Altérations"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"m","localeCode":"F","regionCode":"W","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Splayfoot Goodwort","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-splayfoot-goodwort","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"renforts-alterations","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Splayfoot Goodwort","system":{"notes":"<p>Ces graines se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré doux, notamment dans les berges et rivages d’eau douce, et elle est surtout connue dans l’Ouest d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste très difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle se consomme directement.</p><p>Chez les êtres bons et honnêtes, les graines inspirent confiance et détermination (+25) pendant 1 à 4 heures ; chez les créatures mauvaises ou liées aux Ténèbres, elles provoquent vertiges et confusion (−50).</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Splayfoot Goodwort","system":{"notes":"<p>This seeds is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in freshwater banks and shores, and is best known in western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains very hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>In good and honest beings, the seeds inspire confidence and determination (+25) for 1–4 hours; in evil creatures or those bound to Darkness they cause dizziness and confusion (−50).</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Renforts & Altérations"],"en":["Enhancements & Alterations"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["renforts-alterations"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"F","findDifficulty":"Very Hard","form":"Seeds","prep":"ingest","season":"","cost":"23gp","notes":"<p>This seeds is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in freshwater banks and shores, and is best known in western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains very hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>In good and honest beings, the seeds inspire confidence and determination (+25) for 1–4 hours; in evil creatures or those bound to Darkness they cause dizziness and confusion (−50).</p>","addictionFactor":0,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"ArsCdfbFeRsMrnFU"}
{"name":"Sûm-Kutia","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-sum-kutia","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"Honnin-SW","sourceCost":"0","sourceCategory":"Poisons","utilityGroups":["Poisons","Nerveux"],"poisonType":"Nerveux","climateCode":null,"localeCode":null,"regionCode":null,"sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Sûm-Kutia","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-sum-kutia","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"poison-nerveux","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Sûm-Kutia","system":{"notes":"<p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle est préparée sous forme de pâte.</p><p>Poison nerveux de niveau 4. Toute victime qui échoue à résister est paralysée pendant environ deux rounds par point d’échec.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Sûm-Kutia","system":{"notes":"<p>To obtain its properties, it is prepared as a paste.</p><p>Level 4 nerve poison. Any victim who fails to resist is paralyzed for about two rounds per point of failure.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Nerveux"],"en":["Nerve"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["poison-nerveux"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"","findDifficulty":"","form":"Mixture","prep":"paste","season":"","cost":"0","notes":"<p>To obtain its properties, it is prepared as a paste.</p><p>Level 4 nerve poison. Any victim who fails to resist is paralyzed for about two rounds per point of failure.</p>","addictionFactor":0,"effects":[],"table":"","level":4},"_id":"0xLGClqkWFMFaz6V"}
{"name":"Suranie","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/fruit/berry-leaf-pink.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-suranie","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"t-F-3-U","sourceCost":"2gp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Étourdissement"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"t","localeCode":"F","regionCode":"U","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Suranie","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-suranie","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Suranie","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette baie se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré frais, notamment dans les berges et rivages d’eau douce, et elle est surtout connue dans l’ensemble d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste assez aisée à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle se consomme directement.</p><p>La baie dissipe un round d’étourdissement.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Suranie","system":{"notes":"<p>This berry is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in freshwater banks and shores, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains fairly easy to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>The berry relieves one round of stun.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"F","findDifficulty":"Light","form":"Berry","prep":"ingest","season":"","cost":"2gp","notes":"<p>This berry is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in freshwater banks and shores, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains fairly easy to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>The berry relieves one round of stun.</p>","addictionFactor":3,"effects":[{"effect":"reduce-stun","value":1}],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"bazowALuh4jMmiem"}
{"name":"Tarnas","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/nuts/chestnut-roasted-brown-white.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-tarnas","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"h-J-6-U","sourceCost":"220gp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Muscles, nerfs & organes"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"h","localeCode":"J","regionCode":"U","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Tarnas","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-tarnas","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Tarnas","system":{"notes":"<p>Ce nodule se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat chaud et humide, notamment dans les jungles et forêts pluviales, et elle est surtout connue dans l’ensemble d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste très difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle doit être préparée en infusion ou décoction.</p><p>La décoction répare de graves dommages organiques, mais provoque souvent une nausée invalidante durant 1 à 10 heures.</p><p>Son usage présente un risque très élevé d’accoutumance et doit rester exceptionnel.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Tarnas","system":{"notes":"<p>This nodule is found chiefly in hot and humid climates, especially in jungles and rainforests, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains very hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it must be prepared as an infusion or decoction.</p><p>The decoction repairs severe organ damage but often causes incapacitating nausea for 1–10 hours.</p><p>Its use carries a very high risk of addiction and should remain exceptional.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"J","findDifficulty":"Very Hard","form":"Nodule","prep":"brew","season":"","cost":"220gp","notes":"<p>This nodule is found chiefly in hot and humid climates, especially in jungles and rainforests, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains very hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it must be prepared as an infusion or decoction.</p><p>The decoction repairs severe organ damage but often causes incapacitating nausea for 1–10 hours.</p><p>Its use carries a very high risk of addiction and should remain exceptional.</p>","addictionFactor":60,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"8vEyA1P7QVKg8Vw1"}
{"name":"Taynaga","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-taynaga","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"c-C-5","sourceCost":"27gp","sourceCategory":"Poisons","utilityGroups":["Poisons","Conversion"],"poisonType":"Conversion","climateCode":"c","localeCode":"C","regionCode":null,"sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Taynaga","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-taynaga","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"poison-conversion","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Taynaga","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette écorce se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat froid, notamment dans les forêts de conifères.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle est réduite en poudre.</p><p>Poison de conversion de niveau 8D. Cette poudre brunâtre stérilise la victime, inflige 5 à 50 points de vie de dégâts et peut produire des effets généraux modérés.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Taynaga","system":{"notes":"<p>This bark is found chiefly in cold climates, especially in coniferous forests.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is ground into powder.</p><p>Level 8D conversion poison. This brownish powder sterilizes the victim, inflicts 5–50 concussion hits, and can produce moderate general effects.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Conversion"],"en":["Conversion"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["poison-conversion"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"C","findDifficulty":"Hard","form":"Bark","prep":"powder","season":"","cost":"27gp","notes":"<p>This bark is found chiefly in cold climates, especially in coniferous forests.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is ground into powder.</p><p>Level 8D conversion poison. This brownish powder sterilizes the victim, inflicts 5–50 concussion hits, and can produce moderate general effects.</p>","addictionFactor":0,"effects":[],"table":"","level":8},"_id":"CqoCom8HIFkbVySM"}
{"name":"Telek (Icebane)","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-telek-icebane","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"f-S-5-NW","sourceCost":"10gp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Brûlures & exposition"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"f","localeCode":"S","regionCode":"NW","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Telek (Icebane)","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-telek-icebane","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Telek (Fléau-de-Glace / Icebane)","system":{"notes":"<p>On la rencontre aussi sous le nom de <strong>Fléau-de-Glace (Icebane)</strong>.</p><p>Ces baies se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat glacial, notamment dans les prairies rases, et elle est surtout connue dans le Nord-Ouest d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle peut être appliquée ou consommée.</p><p>Mangées, les baies rendent 3 à 30 points de vie perdus à cause du froid. Écrasées et frottées sur une gelure, elles peuvent la faire disparaître en une dizaine de rounds. Le jus se garde un mois.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Telek (Icebane)","system":{"notes":"<p>It is also known as <strong>Icebane</strong>.</p><p>This berries is found chiefly in frigid climates, especially in short-grass plains, and is best known in north-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it may be applied directly or consumed.</p><p>Eaten, the berries restore 3–30 concussion hits lost to cold. Crushed and rubbed onto frostbite, they can remove it in about ten rounds. The juice keeps for one month.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"S","findDifficulty":"Hard","form":"Berries","prep":"apply/ingest","season":"","cost":"10gp","notes":"<p>It is also known as <strong>Icebane</strong>.</p><p>This berries is found chiefly in frigid climates, especially in short-grass plains, and is best known in north-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it may be applied directly or consumed.</p><p>Eaten, the berries restore 3–30 concussion hits lost to cold. Crushed and rubbed onto frostbite, they can remove it in about ten rounds. The juice keeps for one month.</p>","addictionFactor":1,"effects":[{"effect":"heal-hits","formula":"3d10"}],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"Y9DXfCKa1tmRXp1N"}
{"name":"Terbas","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-terbas","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"m-D-3","sourceCost":"2gp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Muscles, nerfs & organes"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"m","localeCode":"D","regionCode":null,"sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Terbas","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-terbas","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Terbas","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette feuille se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré doux, notamment dans les forêts de feuillus ou mixtes.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste assez aisée à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle s’emploie par application directe.</p><p>Appliquée sur la zone atteinte, la feuille double la vitesse naturelle de récupération des nerfs lésés.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Terbas","system":{"notes":"<p>This leaf is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in deciduous or mixed forests.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains fairly easy to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is used by direct application.</p><p>Applied to the affected area, the leaf doubles the natural recovery rate of damaged nerves.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"D","findDifficulty":"Light","form":"Leaf","prep":"apply","season":"","cost":"2gp","notes":"<p>This leaf is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in deciduous or mixed forests.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains fairly easy to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is used by direct application.</p><p>Applied to the affected area, the leaf doubles the natural recovery rate of damaged nerves.</p>","addictionFactor":4,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"Q5HILURN1ttRqoqE"}
{"name":"Thurl","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-thurl","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"t-D-1-U","sourceCost":"2sp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Récupération"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"t","localeCode":"D","regionCode":"U","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Thurl","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-thurl","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Thurl","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette gousse se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré frais, notamment dans les forêts de feuillus ou mixtes, et elle est surtout connue dans l’ensemble d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste très facile à repérer.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle doit être préparée en infusion ou décoction.</p><p>La décoction rend 1 à 4 points de vie et se conserve une à deux semaines.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Thurl","system":{"notes":"<p>This clove is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in deciduous or mixed forests, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains routine to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it must be prepared as an infusion or decoction.</p><p>The decoction restores 1–4 concussion hits and keeps for one to two weeks.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"D","findDifficulty":"Routine","form":"Clove","prep":"brew","season":"","cost":"2sp","notes":"<p>This clove is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in deciduous or mixed forests, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains routine to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it must be prepared as an infusion or decoction.</p><p>The decoction restores 1–4 concussion hits and keeps for one to two weeks.</p>","addictionFactor":1,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"ccaPKmRYYp4try8a"}
{"name":"Thuryik","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-thuryik","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"s-V-8","sourceCost":"85gp","sourceCategory":"Poisons","utilityGroups":["Poisons","Respiratoire"],"poisonType":"Respiratoire","climateCode":"s","localeCode":"V","regionCode":null,"sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Thuryik","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-thuryik","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"poison-respiratoires","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Thuryik","system":{"notes":"<p>Ce gaz se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat semi-aride, notamment dans les terrains volcaniques.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste presque introuvable.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle se consomme directement.</p><p>Poison respiratoire de niveau 10 sous forme gazeuse. Un échec au Jet de Résistance plonge dans un profond sommeil de 1 à 10 heures.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Thuryik","system":{"notes":"<p>This gas is found chiefly in semi-arid climates, especially in volcanic terrain.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains almost impossible to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>Level 10 respiratory poison in gaseous form. A failed Resistance Roll puts the victim into a deep sleep for 1–10 hours.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Respiratoires"],"en":["Respiratory"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["poison-respiratoires"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"V","findDifficulty":"Sheer Folly","form":"Gas","prep":"ingest","season":"","cost":"85gp","notes":"<p>This gas is found chiefly in semi-arid climates, especially in volcanic terrain.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains almost impossible to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>Level 10 respiratory poison in gaseous form. A failed Resistance Roll puts the victim into a deep sleep for 1–10 hours.</p>","addictionFactor":0,"effects":[],"table":"","level":10},"_id":"aPqyTLfYIfiUWQCz"}
{"name":"Tuxlaxar (Raybled)","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-tuxlaxar-raybled","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"c-S-4-N","sourceCost":"75gp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Hémorragies & circulation"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"c","localeCode":"S","regionCode":"N","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Tuxlaxar (Raybled)","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-tuxlaxar-raybled","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Tuxlaxar (Sang-Rayé / Raybled)","system":{"notes":"<p>On la rencontre aussi sous le nom de <strong>Rayon-Sang (Raybled)</strong>.</p><p>Cette feuille se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat froid, notamment dans les prairies rases, et elle est surtout connue dans le Nord d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste de difficulté moyenne à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle doit être préparée en infusion ou décoction.</p><p>Une infusion préparée avec des feuilles très fraîches agit comme un puissant styptique et arrête toute hémorragie en 1 à 10 rounds.</p><p>Un usage répété peut créer une accoutumance.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Tuxlaxar (Raybled)","system":{"notes":"<p>It is also known as <strong>Raybled</strong>.</p><p>This leaf is found chiefly in cold climates, especially in short-grass plains, and is best known in northern Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains of medium difficulty to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it must be prepared as an infusion or decoction.</p><p>An infusion prepared from very fresh leaves acts as a powerful styptic and stops all bleeding in 1–10 rounds.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"S","findDifficulty":"Medium","form":"Leaf","prep":"brew","season":"","cost":"75gp","notes":"<p>It is also known as <strong>Raybled</strong>.</p><p>This leaf is found chiefly in cold climates, especially in short-grass plains, and is best known in northern Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains of medium difficulty to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it must be prepared as an infusion or decoction.</p><p>An infusion prepared from very fresh leaves acts as a powerful styptic and stops all bleeding in 1–10 rounds.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>","addictionFactor":6,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"YxPA6oBKkc1CAKgc"}
{"name":"Tyr-fira (Lifegiver)","type":"herb","img":"icons/commodities/flowers/flower-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-tyr-fira-lifegiver","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"f-A-9-U","sourceCost":"2000gp","sourceCategory":"Préservation & Survie","utilityGroups":["Préservation & Survie"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"f","localeCode":"A","regionCode":"U","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Tyr-fira (Lifegiver)","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-tyr-fira-lifegiver","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"preservation-survie","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Tyr-fira (Donneuse-de-Vie / Lifegiver)","system":{"notes":"<p>On la rencontre aussi sous le nom de <strong>Donne-Vie (Lifegiver)</strong>.</p><p>Cette fleur se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat glacial, notamment dans les hautes zones alpines, et elle est surtout connue dans l’ensemble d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste d’une rareté légendaire.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle se consomme directement.</p><p>Placée dans la bouche d’un mourant, cette fleur ramène ses blessures au minimum compatible avec la survie et empêche la mort. Une fleur cueillie se conserve environ une semaine.</p><p>Son usage présente un risque très élevé d’accoutumance et doit rester exceptionnel.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Tyr-fira (Lifegiver)","system":{"notes":"<p>It is also known as <strong>Lifegiver</strong>.</p><p>This blossom is found chiefly in frigid climates, especially in high alpine zones, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains of legendary rarity.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>Placed in the mouth of a dying person, this flower reduces their wounds to the minimum compatible with survival and prevents death. Once picked, the flower keeps for about one week.</p><p>Its use carries a very high risk of addiction and should remain exceptional.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Préservation & Survie"],"en":["Preservation & Survival"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["preservation-survie"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"A","findDifficulty":"Absurd","form":"Blossom","prep":"ingest","season":"","cost":"2000gp","notes":"<p>It is also known as <strong>Lifegiver</strong>.</p><p>This blossom is found chiefly in frigid climates, especially in high alpine zones, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains of legendary rarity.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>Placed in the mouth of a dying person, this flower reduces their wounds to the minimum compatible with survival and prevents death. Once picked, the flower keeps for about one week.</p><p>Its use carries a very high risk of addiction and should remain exceptional.</p>","addictionFactor":33,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"RgRLCWCjPYc8bLAL"}
{"name":"Ul-Naza","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-ul-naza","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"s-W-8-M","sourceCost":"4200gp","sourceCategory":"Remèdes & Antidotes","utilityGroups":["Remèdes & Antidotes"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"s","localeCode":"W","regionCode":"M","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Ul-Naza","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-ul-naza","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"remedes-antidotes","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Ul-Naza","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette feuille se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat semi-aride, notamment dans les terres désolées, et elle est surtout connue dans le centre d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste presque introuvable.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle se consomme directement.</p><p>Antidote de niveau 50 contre pratiquement tout poison. Une feuille enveloppée dans le cuir d’un animal mort par suffocation reste active près d’un an ; sans cette précaution, elle se dégrade en une semaine.</p><p>Un usage répété peut créer une accoutumance.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Ul-Naza","system":{"notes":"<p>This leaf is found chiefly in semi-arid climates, especially in wastelands, and is best known in central Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains almost impossible to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>Level 50 antidote against virtually any poison. A leaf wrapped in the hide of an animal that died of suffocation remains potent for nearly a year; without this precaution it deteriorates within a week.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Remèdes & Antidotes"],"en":["Remedies & Antidotes"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["remedes-antidotes"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"W","findDifficulty":"Sheer Folly","form":"Leaf","prep":"ingest","season":"","cost":"4200gp","notes":"<p>This leaf is found chiefly in semi-arid climates, especially in wastelands, and is best known in central Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains almost impossible to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>Level 50 antidote against virtually any poison. A leaf wrapped in the hide of an animal that died of suffocation remains potent for nearly a year; without this precaution it deteriorates within a week.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>","addictionFactor":9,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"F1JKITMjoEp6gsH5"}
{"name":"Uraana","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-uraana","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"t-S-3","sourceCost":"12gp","sourceCategory":"Poisons","utilityGroups":["Poisons","Respiratoire"],"poisonType":"Respiratoire","climateCode":"t","localeCode":"S","regionCode":null,"sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Uraana","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-uraana","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"poison-respiratoires","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Uraana","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette feuille se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré frais, notamment dans les prairies rases.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste assez aisée à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle est préparée sous forme de pâte.</p><p>Poison respiratoire de niveau 6A. Cette pâte crémeuse inflige 3 à 30 points de vie et provoque des effets respiratoires généralement légers.</p><p>Un usage répété peut créer une accoutumance.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Uraana","system":{"notes":"<p>This leaf is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in short-grass plains.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains fairly easy to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is prepared as a paste.</p><p>Level 6A respiratory poison. This creamy paste inflicts 3–30 concussion hits and generally causes light respiratory effects.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Respiratoires"],"en":["Respiratory"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["poison-respiratoires"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"S","findDifficulty":"Light","form":"Leaf","prep":"paste","season":"","cost":"12gp","notes":"<p>This leaf is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in short-grass plains.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains fairly easy to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is prepared as a paste.</p><p>Level 6A respiratory poison. This creamy paste inflicts 3–30 concussion hits and generally causes light respiratory effects.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>","addictionFactor":6,"effects":[],"table":"","level":6},"_id":"aKE2SKhbkTmOEH2X"}
{"name":"Uur (Ukur)","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/nuts/chestnut-roasted-brown-white.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-uur-ukur","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"f-H-3-N","sourceCost":"3gp","sourceCategory":"Nourriture","utilityGroups":["Nourriture"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"f","localeCode":"H","regionCode":"N","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Uur (Ukur)","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-uur-ukur","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"nourriture","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Uur (Ukur)","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette noix se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat glacial, notamment dans les landes, broussailles et bruyères, et elle est surtout connue dans le Nord d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste assez aisée à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle se consomme directement.</p><p>Une noix fournit approximativement l’équivalent d’une journée de nourriture.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Uur (Ukur)","system":{"notes":"<p>This nut is found chiefly in frigid climates, especially in heaths, scrublands, and moors, and is best known in northern Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains fairly easy to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>One nut provides approximately the equivalent of one day’s food.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Nourriture"],"en":["Food"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["nourriture"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"H","findDifficulty":"Light","form":"Nut","prep":"ingest","season":"","cost":"3gp","notes":"<p>This nut is found chiefly in frigid climates, especially in heaths, scrublands, and moors, and is best known in northern Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains fairly easy to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>One nut provides approximately the equivalent of one day’s food.</p>","addictionFactor":1,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"Mhf0n6MCxSDCjhM5"}
{"name":"Vinuk (Vasha)","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/nuts/chestnut-roasted-brown-white.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-vinuk-vasha","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"s-S-5-U","sourceCost":"2gp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Étourdissement"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"s","localeCode":"S","regionCode":"U","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Vinuk (Vasha)","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-vinuk-vasha","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Vinuk (Vasha)","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette racine se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat semi-aride, notamment dans les prairies rases, et elle est surtout connue dans l’ensemble d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle doit être préparée en infusion ou décoction.</p><p>La décoction dissipe 1 à 10 rounds d’étourdissement. La racine se conserve environ une semaine.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Vinuk (Vasha)","system":{"notes":"<p>This root is found chiefly in semi-arid climates, especially in short-grass plains, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it must be prepared as an infusion or decoction.</p><p>The decoction relieves 1–10 rounds of stun. The root keeps for about one week.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"S","findDifficulty":"Hard","form":"Root","prep":"brew","season":"","cost":"2gp","notes":"<p>This root is found chiefly in semi-arid climates, especially in short-grass plains, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it must be prepared as an infusion or decoction.</p><p>The decoction relieves 1–10 rounds of stun. The root keeps for about one week.</p>","addictionFactor":4,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"E97g88A1aENVyQZc"}
{"name":"Water Hemlock Plant","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-water-hemlock-plant","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"m-F-7","sourceCost":"18gp","sourceCategory":"Poisons","utilityGroups":["Poisons","Musculaire"],"poisonType":"Musculaire","climateCode":"m","localeCode":"F","regionCode":null,"sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Water Hemlock Plant","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-water-hemlock-plant","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"poison-musculaires","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Ciguë d’Eau (Water Hemlock Plant)","system":{"notes":"<p>Ce liquide se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré doux, notamment dans les berges et rivages d’eau douce.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste extrêmement difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle se consomme directement.</p><p>Poison musculaire de niveau 3, liquide clair ambré. Un échec modéré provoque une incapacité de 1 à 10 heures ; un échec sévère tue en 6 à 10 rounds.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Water Hemlock Plant","system":{"notes":"<p>This liquid is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in freshwater banks and shores.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains extremely hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>Level 3 muscle poison, a clear pale-amber liquid. A moderate failure causes incapacity for 1–10 hours; a severe failure kills in 6–10 rounds.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Musculaires"],"en":["Muscle"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["poison-musculaires"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"F","findDifficulty":"Extremely Hard","form":"Liquid","prep":"ingest","season":"","cost":"18gp","notes":"<p>This liquid is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in freshwater banks and shores.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains extremely hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>Level 3 muscle poison, a clear pale-amber liquid. A moderate failure causes incapacity for 1–10 hours; a severe failure kills in 6–10 rounds.</p>","addictionFactor":0,"effects":[],"table":"","level":3},"_id":"DuZjYrjm3JD8Zidk"}
{"name":"Welwal","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-welwal","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"h-J-7-SW","sourceCost":"12gp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Étourdissement"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"h","localeCode":"J","regionCode":"SW","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Welwal","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-welwal","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Welwal","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette feuille se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat chaud et humide, notamment dans les jungles et forêts pluviales, et elle est surtout connue dans le Sud-Ouest d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste extrêmement difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle se consomme directement.</p><p>La feuille dissipe trois rounds d’étourdissement.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Welwal","system":{"notes":"<p>This leaf is found chiefly in hot and humid climates, especially in jungles and rainforests, and is best known in south-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains extremely hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>The leaf relieves three rounds of stun.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"J","findDifficulty":"Extremely Hard","form":"Leaf","prep":"ingest","season":"","cost":"12gp","notes":"<p>This leaf is found chiefly in hot and humid climates, especially in jungles and rainforests, and is best known in south-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains extremely hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>The leaf relieves three rounds of stun.</p>","addictionFactor":3,"effects":[{"effect":"reduce-stun","value":3}],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"UI4TsABnBt7XbT6M"}
{"name":"Wifurwif","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-wifurwif","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"t-M-7-E","sourceCost":"55gp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Muscles, nerfs & organes"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"t","localeCode":"M","regionCode":"E","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Wifurwif","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-wifurwif","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Wifurwif","system":{"notes":"<p>Ce lichen se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré frais, notamment dans les montagnes, et elle est surtout connue dans l’Est d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste extrêmement difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle se consomme directement.</p><p>Ce lichen rare est employé pour réparer les lésions des nerfs.</p><p>Des prises répétées peuvent entraîner une dépendance notable.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Wifurwif","system":{"notes":"<p>This lichen is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in mountains, and is best known in eastern Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains extremely hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>This rare lichen is used to repair damaged nerves.</p><p>Repeated doses can lead to significant dependence.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"M","findDifficulty":"Extremely Hard","form":"Lichen","prep":"ingest","season":"","cost":"55gp","notes":"<p>This lichen is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in mountains, and is best known in eastern Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains extremely hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>This rare lichen is used to repair damaged nerves.</p><p>Repeated doses can lead to significant dependence.</p>","addictionFactor":15,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"D8ygWiOvSMhUDlcj"}
{"name":"Winclamit (Bloodkeep)","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/fruit/berry-leaf-pink.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-winclamit-bloodkeep","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"c-C-9-N","sourceCost":"100gp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Récupération"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"c","localeCode":"C","regionCode":"N","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Winclamit (Bloodkeep)","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-winclamit-bloodkeep","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Winclamit (Garde-Sang / Bloodkeep)","system":{"notes":"<p>On la rencontre aussi sous le nom de <strong>Garde-Sang (Bloodkeep)</strong>.</p><p>Ce fruit se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat froid, notamment dans les forêts de conifères, et elle est surtout connue dans le Nord d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste d’une rareté légendaire.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle se consomme directement.</p><p>Ce fruit extrêmement rare peut rendre 3 à 300 points de vie.</p><p>Un usage répété peut créer une accoutumance.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Winclamit (Bloodkeep)","system":{"notes":"<p>It is also known as <strong>Bloodkeep</strong>.</p><p>This fruit is found chiefly in cold climates, especially in coniferous forests, and is best known in northern Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains of legendary rarity.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>This extremely rare fruit can restore 3–300 concussion hits.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"C","findDifficulty":"Absurd","form":"Fruit","prep":"ingest","season":"","cost":"100gp","notes":"<p>It is also known as <strong>Bloodkeep</strong>.</p><p>This fruit is found chiefly in cold climates, especially in coniferous forests, and is best known in northern Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains of legendary rarity.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>This extremely rare fruit can restore 3–300 concussion hits.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>","addictionFactor":12,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"okPH3kzfQQDQvSEq"}
{"name":"Witan (Witav, Drugo-sreca)","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-witan-witav-drugo-sreca","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"h-J-6-SW","sourceCost":"15gp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Étourdissement"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"h","localeCode":"J","regionCode":"SW","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Witan (Witav, Drugo-sreca)","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-witan-witav-drugo-sreca","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Witan (Witav, Drugo-sreca)","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette feuille se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat chaud et humide, notamment dans les jungles et forêts pluviales, et elle est surtout connue dans le Sud-Ouest d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste très difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle se consomme directement.</p><p>La feuille dissipe deux rounds d’étourdissement et reste active environ deux semaines après la cueillette.</p><p>Un usage répété peut créer une accoutumance.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Witan (Witav, Drugo-sreca)","system":{"notes":"<p>This leaf is found chiefly in hot and humid climates, especially in jungles and rainforests, and is best known in south-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains very hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>The leaf relieves two rounds of stun and remains potent for about two weeks after picking.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"J","findDifficulty":"Very Hard","form":"Leaf","prep":"ingest","season":"","cost":"15gp","notes":"<p>This leaf is found chiefly in hot and humid climates, especially in jungles and rainforests, and is best known in south-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains very hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>The leaf relieves two rounds of stun and remains potent for about two weeks after picking.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>","addictionFactor":5,"effects":[{"effect":"reduce-stun","value":2}],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"KFA3JF9qg6yPF5Y7"}
{"name":"Witchbriar","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-witchbriar","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"t-C-5-NE","sourceCost":"14gp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Récupération"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"t","localeCode":"C","regionCode":"NE","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Witchbriar","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-witchbriar","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Ronce-de-Sorcière (Witchbriar)","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette épine se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré frais, notamment dans les forêts de conifères, et elle est surtout connue dans le Nord-Est d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle se consomme directement.</p><p>L’épine injecte un suc qui rend 1 à 5 points de vie. Gardées au sec, les épines restent utilisables environ un an.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Witchbriar","system":{"notes":"<p>This thorn is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in coniferous forests, and is best known in north-eastern Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>The thorn injects a sap that restores 1–5 concussion hits. Kept dry, the thorns remain usable for about one year.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"C","findDifficulty":"Hard","form":"Thorn","prep":"ingest","season":"","cost":"14gp","notes":"<p>This thorn is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in coniferous forests, and is best known in north-eastern Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>The thorn injects a sap that restores 1–5 concussion hits. Kept dry, the thorns remain usable for about one year.</p>","addictionFactor":2,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"TwA7Y30B5M2ZZIns"}
{"name":"Wolfwort (Stinkbush)","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-wolfwort-stinkbush","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"m-D-3-U","sourceCost":"4sp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Récupération"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"m","localeCode":"D","regionCode":"U","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Wolfwort (Stinkbush)","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-wolfwort-stinkbush","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Herbe-au-Loup (Wolfwort / Buisson-Puant / Stinkbush)","system":{"notes":"<p>On la rencontre aussi sous le nom de <strong>Buisson-Puant (Stinkbush)</strong>.</p><p>Cette feuille se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré doux, notamment dans les forêts de feuillus ou mixtes, et elle est surtout connue dans l’ensemble d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste assez aisée à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle se consomme directement.</p><p>Chaque feuille rend 1 point de vie. Au-delà d’une quinzaine par jour, nausées, vomissements et incapacité menacent ; quelques feuilles suffisent déjà à imprégner le corps d’une forte odeur animale.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Wolfwort (Stinkbush)","system":{"notes":"<p>It is also known as <strong>Stinkbush</strong>.</p><p>This leaf is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in deciduous or mixed forests, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains fairly easy to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>Each leaf restores 1 concussion hit. More than about fifteen per day risks nausea, vomiting, and incapacity; even a few leaves are enough to give the body a strong animal smell.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"D","findDifficulty":"Light","form":"Leaf","prep":"ingest","season":"","cost":"4sp","notes":"<p>It is also known as <strong>Stinkbush</strong>.</p><p>This leaf is found chiefly in mild temperate climates, especially in deciduous or mixed forests, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains fairly easy to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>Each leaf restores 1 concussion hit. More than about fifteen per day risks nausea, vomiting, and incapacity; even a few leaves are enough to give the body a strong animal smell.</p>","addictionFactor":0,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"pUR8T71obtG77afi"}
{"name":"Worlclivur","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-worlclivur","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"c-O-8-NW","sourceCost":"133gp","sourceCategory":"Poisons","utilityGroups":["Poisons","Musculaire"],"poisonType":"Musculaire","climateCode":"c","localeCode":"O","regionCode":"NW","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Worlclivur","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-worlclivur","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"poison-musculaires","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Worlclivur","system":{"notes":"<p>Ce lichen se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat froid, notamment dans les côtes marines et rivages salés, et elle est surtout connue dans le Nord-Ouest d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste presque introuvable.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle est préparée sous forme de pâte.</p><p>Poison musculaire de niveau 2 touchant surtout la vue : cécité d’un œil, spasmes des paupières ou cécité des deux yeux selon la gravité de l’échec. Le jus brut de la fleur agit comme un poison de niveau 1.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Worlclivur","system":{"notes":"<p>This lichen is found chiefly in cold climates, especially in sea coasts and saltwater shores, and is best known in north-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains almost impossible to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is prepared as a paste.</p><p>Level 2 muscle poison primarily affecting sight: blindness in one eye, eyelid spasms, or blindness in both eyes depending on the severity of the failure. Raw flower juice acts as a level 1 poison.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Musculaires"],"en":["Muscle"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["poison-musculaires"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"O","findDifficulty":"Sheer Folly","form":"Lichen","prep":"paste","season":"","cost":"133gp","notes":"<p>This lichen is found chiefly in cold climates, especially in sea coasts and saltwater shores, and is best known in north-western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains almost impossible to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is prepared as a paste.</p><p>Level 2 muscle poison primarily affecting sight: blindness in one eye, eyelid spasms, or blindness in both eyes depending on the severity of the failure. Raw flower juice acts as a level 1 poison.</p>","addictionFactor":0,"effects":[],"table":"","level":2},"_id":"w2dQ8yGLzVcQRylm"}
{"name":"Yaran","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-yaran","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"t-S-2-W","sourceCost":"9sp","sourceCategory":"Renforts & Altérations","utilityGroups":["Renforts & Altérations"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"t","localeCode":"S","regionCode":"W","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Yaran","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-yaran","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"renforts-alterations","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Yaran","system":{"notes":"<p>Ce pollen se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré frais, notamment dans les prairies rases, et elle est surtout connue dans l’Ouest d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste facile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle se consomme directement.</p><p>Le pollen aiguise fortement l’odorat et le goût, accordant environ +50 aux perceptions correspondantes pendant une heure.</p><p>Un usage répété peut créer une accoutumance.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Yaran","system":{"notes":"<p>This pollen is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in short-grass plains, and is best known in western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains easy to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>The pollen greatly sharpens smell and taste, granting about +50 to the corresponding perceptions for one hour.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Renforts & Altérations"],"en":["Enhancements & Alterations"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["renforts-alterations"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"S","findDifficulty":"Easy","form":"Pollen","prep":"ingest","season":"","cost":"9sp","notes":"<p>This pollen is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in short-grass plains, and is best known in western Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains easy to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>The pollen greatly sharpens smell and taste, granting about +50 to the corresponding perceptions for one hour.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>","addictionFactor":7,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"nwFHFNp8cACrmxKm"}
{"name":"Yellow Hemlock","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-yellow-hemlock","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"s-C-3-S","sourceCost":"175gp","sourceCategory":"Soins","utilityGroups":["Soins","Hémorragies & circulation"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"s","localeCode":"C","regionCode":"S","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Yellow Hemlock","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-yellow-hemlock","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"soins","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Ciguë Jaune (Yellow Hemlock)","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette résine se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat semi-aride, notamment dans les forêts de conifères, et elle est surtout connue dans le Sud d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste assez aisée à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle s’emploie par application directe.</p><p>L’arbre fournit une résine appelée Harfy qui arrête immédiatement presque toute hémorragie. Conservée dans un récipient hermétique, elle garde ses propriétés un an.</p><p>Un usage répété peut créer une accoutumance.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Yellow Hemlock","system":{"notes":"<p>This resin is found chiefly in semi-arid climates, especially in coniferous forests, and is best known in southern Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains fairly easy to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is used by direct application.</p><p>The tree yields a resin called Harfy that immediately stops almost any bleeding. Kept in an airtight container, it retains its properties for one year.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Soins"],"en":["Healing"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["soins"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"C","findDifficulty":"Light","form":"Resin","prep":"apply","season":"","cost":"175gp","notes":"<p>This resin is found chiefly in semi-arid climates, especially in coniferous forests, and is best known in southern Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains fairly easy to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is used by direct application.</p><p>The tree yields a resin called Harfy that immediately stops almost any bleeding. Kept in an airtight container, it retains its properties for one year.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>","addictionFactor":9,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"LvfywgTUYTz0BIHd"}
{"name":"Yuth","type":"herb","img":"icons/commodities/flowers/flower-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-yuth","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"h-J-8-S","sourceCost":"29gp","sourceCategory":"Remèdes & Antidotes","utilityGroups":["Remèdes & Antidotes"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"h","localeCode":"J","regionCode":"S","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Yuth","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-yuth","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"remedes-antidotes","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Yuth","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette fleur se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat chaud et humide, notamment dans les jungles et forêts pluviales, et elle est surtout connue dans le Sud d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste presque introuvable.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle se consomme directement.</p><p>Antidote de niveau 20 contre les venins nerveux.</p><p>Un usage répété peut créer une accoutumance.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Yuth","system":{"notes":"<p>This flower is found chiefly in hot and humid climates, especially in jungles and rainforests, and is best known in southern Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains almost impossible to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>Level 20 antidote for nerve venoms.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Remèdes & Antidotes"],"en":["Remedies & Antidotes"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["remedes-antidotes"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"J","findDifficulty":"Sheer Folly","form":"Flower","prep":"ingest","season":"","cost":"29gp","notes":"<p>This flower is found chiefly in hot and humid climates, especially in jungles and rainforests, and is best known in southern Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains almost impossible to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>Level 20 antidote for nerve venoms.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>","addictionFactor":8,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"qGwtn9BgkUzmNMc7"}
{"name":"Zaganzar","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/nuts/chestnut-roasted-brown-white.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-zaganzar","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"t-M-6","sourceCost":"139gp","sourceCategory":"Poisons","utilityGroups":["Poisons","Réduction"],"poisonType":"Réduction","climateCode":"t","localeCode":"M","regionCode":null,"sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Zaganzar","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-zaganzar","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"poison-reduction","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Zaganzar","system":{"notes":"<p>Cette racine se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat tempéré frais, notamment dans les montagnes.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste très difficile à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle est préparée sous forme liquide.</p><p>Poison de réduction de niveau 5H. Son extrait bleuté peut produire de sévères effets, notamment la cécité par destruction du nerf optique, et inflige 1 à 10 points de vie.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Zaganzar","system":{"notes":"<p>This root is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in mountains.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains very hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is prepared in liquid form.</p><p>Level 5H Reduction poison. Its bluish extract can cause severe effects, including blindness through destruction of the optic nerve, and inflicts 1–10 concussion hits.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Réduction"],"en":["Reduction"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["poison-reduction"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"M","findDifficulty":"Very Hard","form":"Root","prep":"liquid","season":"","cost":"139gp","notes":"<p>This root is found chiefly in cool temperate climates, especially in mountains.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains very hard to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is prepared in liquid form.</p><p>Level 5H Reduction poison. Its bluish extract can cause severe effects, including blindness through destruction of the optic nerve, and inflicts 1–10 concussion hits.</p>","addictionFactor":0,"effects":[],"table":"","level":5},"_id":"7bVtrEKZthDlYwxc"}
{"name":"Zulsendura (Zilsendura)","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-zulsendura-zilsendura","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"a-U-4-U","sourceCost":"70gp","sourceCategory":"Renforts & Altérations","utilityGroups":["Renforts & Altérations"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"a","localeCode":"U","regionCode":"U","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Zulsendura (Zilsendura)","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-zulsendura-zilsendura","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"renforts-alterations","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Zulsendura (Zilsendura)","system":{"notes":"<p>Ce champignon se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat aride, notamment dans les milieux souterrains, et elle est surtout connue dans l’ensemble d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste de difficulté moyenne à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle se consomme directement.</p><p>Ce champignon, aussi appelé Dry-rot ou Hurry-up, confère une accélération remarquable pendant trois rounds.</p><p>Des prises répétées peuvent entraîner une dépendance notable.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Zulsendura (Zilsendura)","system":{"notes":"<p>This mushroom is found chiefly in arid climates, especially in underground environments, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains of medium difficulty to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>This mushroom, also called Dry-rot or Hurry-up, grants remarkable acceleration for three rounds.</p><p>Repeated doses can lead to significant dependence.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Renforts & Altérations"],"en":["Enhancements & Alterations"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["renforts-alterations"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"U","findDifficulty":"Medium","form":"Mushroom","prep":"ingest","season":"","cost":"70gp","notes":"<p>This mushroom is found chiefly in arid climates, especially in underground environments, and is best known throughout Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains of medium difficulty to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it is consumed directly.</p><p>This mushroom, also called Dry-rot or Hurry-up, grants remarkable acceleration for three rounds.</p><p>Repeated doses can lead to significant dependence.</p>","addictionFactor":22,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"ZAQiGgHAFDPTwAOq"}
{"name":"Zur (Strapack)","type":"herb","img":"icons/consumables/plants/grass-leaves-stems-green.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herb-zur-strapack","collection":"merp-rmu-herbs","contentVersion":1,"source":"MERP Character Creation Using RMSS/RMFRP v2.5, pp. 206–211","sourceCode":"c-U-4-M","sourceCost":"12gp","sourceCategory":"Renforts & Altérations","utilityGroups":["Renforts & Altérations"],"poisonType":null,"climateCode":"c","localeCode":"U","regionCode":"M","sourceVariants":[],"sourceName":"Zur (Strapack)","compendiumSourceKey":"herb-zur-strapack","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-herbs","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/herbs-v1.json","compendiumFolderKey":"renforts-alterations","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Zur (Paquet-Sangle / Strapack)","system":{"notes":"<p>Ce champignon se rencontre surtout dans les régions au climat froid, notamment dans les milieux souterrains, et elle est surtout connue dans le centre d’Endor.</p><p>Dans un milieu favorable, elle reste de difficulté moyenne à trouver.</p><p>Pour en tirer ses propriétés, elle doit être préparée en infusion ou décoction.</p><p>La décoction triple environ la portée de l’odorat et de l’ouïe et accorde +50 aux perceptions correspondantes pendant une heure.</p><p>Un usage répété peut créer une accoutumance.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Zur (Strapack)","system":{"notes":"<p>This fungus is found chiefly in cold climates, especially in underground environments, and is best known in central Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains of medium difficulty to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it must be prepared as an infusion or decoction.</p><p>The decoction roughly triples the range of smell and hearing and grants +50 to the corresponding perceptions for one hour.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Renforts & Altérations"],"en":["Enhancements & Alterations"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["renforts-alterations"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"stackable":true,"stackType":"","quantity":1,"weight":0.25,"weightUnit":"oz","equipped":"carried","biome":"U","findDifficulty":"Medium","form":"Fungus","prep":"brew","season":"","cost":"12gp","notes":"<p>This fungus is found chiefly in cold climates, especially in underground environments, and is best known in central Endor.</p><p>Even in suitable terrain, it remains of medium difficulty to find.</p><p>To obtain its properties, it must be prepared as an infusion or decoction.</p><p>The decoction roughly triples the range of smell and hearing and grants +50 to the corresponding perceptions for one hour.</p><p>Repeated use can lead to habituation.</p>","addictionFactor":8,"effects":[],"table":"","level":0},"_id":"RRtfn7Vhsy1Y5gUO"}
